#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:46
