"Micro, see xref:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc[Deploy "
"Proxy as a Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ໃນ SLE Micro, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc[Deploy Proxy as a Virtual Machine]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Proxy Deployment"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide outlines the deployment process for the {productname} "
"{productnumber} Proxy container on {sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} "
"{bci-suma}.  This guide presumes you have already successfully deployed a "
"{productname} {productnumber} Server."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy container ໃນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}. ຄູ່ມືນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server ເສັດສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{sle-micro} is only supported as regular minion ([systemitem]``default`` "
"contact method) for the time being.  We are working on managing it as Salt "
"SSH client ([systemitem]``salt-ssh`` contact method), too."
msgstr "{sle-micro} ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ໃນຮູບແບບ regular minion (ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ [systemitem]``default``) ໃນຂະນະນີ້. ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງພັດທະນາການຈັດການໃນຮູບແບບ Salt SSH client (ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ [systemitem]``salt-ssh``) ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:4
msgid "To successfully deploy, you will perform the following actions:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#.  Add certificate tasks item
#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid "Review hardware requirements."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Synchronize the {sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-suma} parent "
"channel and the proxy extension child channel on the server."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Parent channel) ຂອງ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma} ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຂອງ proxy extension ໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:8
msgid "Install {sle-micro} or {sles} on a bare-metal machine."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} ຫຼື {sles} ໃນເຄື່ອງ Bare-metal."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:9
msgid "Create a {salt} activation key with Proxy Extension."
msgstr "ສ້າງ {salt} activation key ພ້ອມກັບ Proxy Extension."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Bootstrap the proxy as a client with the [systemitem]``default`` connection "
"method."
msgstr "ເຮັດ Bootstrap ໃຫ້ proxy ເປັນໄຄລແອນດ້ວຍວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ [systemitem]``default``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:11
msgid "Generate a proxy configuration."
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy (Configuration)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:12
