msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາ proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:13
