#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Use the proxy configuration to register the client as a proxy with "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນໄຄລແອນໃຫ້ເປັນ proxy ກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating system for the Proxy Container Host"
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Proxy Container Host"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The supported operating system for the container host are {sle-micro} "
"{microversion} and {sles} {bci-suma}."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ container host ແມ່ນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ແລະ {sles} {bci-suma}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container host"
msgstr "Container host (ໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:18
msgid ""
"A container host is a server equipped with a container engine like Podman, "
"which lets it manage and deploy containers.  These containers hold "
"applications and their essential parts, such as libraries, but not a full "
"operating system, making them lightweight.  This setup ensures applications "
"run the same way in different environments.  The container host supplies the "
"necessary resources such as CPU, memory, and storage for these containers."
msgstr "Container host ແມ່ນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີ Container Engine ເຊັ່ນ Podman, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຈັດການ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ containers ໄດ້. containers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ Libraries, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທັງໝົດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. Container host ຈະສະໜອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ CPU, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກັບ containers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements for the Proxy"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວສຳລັບ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about hardware requirements for deploying {productname} "
"Proxy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#proxy-hardware-requirements[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#proxy-hardware-requirements[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize the Parent and Proxy Extension Child Channels"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຂອງ Proxy Extension"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This section presumes that you have already entered your organization "
"credentials under the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials] in "
"the server's {webui}.  Products are listed on the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products] page.  This channel must be fully synchronized on the server, with "
"the child channel [systemitem]``Proxy`` as an extension option selected."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃນ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials] ໃນ {webui} ຂອງເຊີເວີແລ້ວ. ຜະລິດຕະພັນຕ່າງໆຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]. ຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຢ່າງສົມບູນໃນເຊີເວີ, ໂດຍເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ [systemitem]``Proxy`` ເປັນຕົວເລືອກ extension."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing the Proxy Parent Channel and Proxy Extension"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງ Proxy ແລະ Proxy Extension"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:24
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid "In the {productname} {webui} select menu:Admin[Products]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui} ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Admin[Products]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:25
msgid "From the products page enter {sle-micro} or {sles} in the filter field."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ {sle-micro} ຫຼື {sles} ໃນຊ່ອງ Filter."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Next use the drop-down to select the required architecture.  For this "
"example {x86_64}."
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Drop-down ເພື່ອເລືອກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນ {x86_64}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [systemitem]``Product Description`` field select the {sle-micro} "
"{microversion} or {sles} {bci-suma} checkbox then use the drop-down to "
"select the [systemitem]``SUSE Manager Proxy Extension 5.0 x86_64`` "
"extension."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [systemitem]``Product Description`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກໝາຍຕິກ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma} ຈາກນັ້ນໃຊ້ Drop-down ເພື່ອເລືອກ extension [systemitem]``SUSE Manager Proxy Extension 5.0 x86_64``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:28
msgid "Click the btn:[Add products] button."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Add products]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:29
msgid "Wait for the synchronization to complete."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {productname} Proxy Host"
msgstr "ກຽມ {productname} Proxy Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the following subsections, you either prepare the proxy host with "
"{sle-micro} or {sles}."
msgstr "ໃນຫົວຂໍ້ຍ່ອຍຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດກຽມ proxy host ດ້ວຍ {sle-micro} ຫຼື {sles}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:32
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:33
msgid ""
"To continue with deployment, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-proxy-persistent-storage[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການນຳໃຊ້ຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-proxy-persistent-storage[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:34
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:35
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:70
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Custom Persistent Storage"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເນື້ອທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນ (Persistent Storage) ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Configuring persistent storage is optional, but it is the only way to avoid "
"serious trouble with container full disk conditions.  If custom persistent "
"storage is required for your infrastructure, use the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` tool."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ, ແຕ່ມັນເປັນວິທີດຽວທີ່ຈະຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງເມື່ອເນື້ອທີ່ດິດຂອງ container ເຕັມ. ຫາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:36
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:72
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container storage and Squid cache volumes."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``. ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ container ແລະ Squid cache volumes ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:37
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:55
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:45
