#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:30
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:16
msgid "Use the command in the following manner:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

