msgid ""
"This command will create the persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງ volumes ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

