#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:59
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} Proxy suite is configured to use the same "
"image version and registry path for each of its services.  However, it is "
"possible to override the default values for a specific service using the "
"install parameters ending with [literal]``-tag`` and [literal]``-image``."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, {productname} Proxy suite ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ image ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ registry ດຽວກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ service. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ service ໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [literal]``-tag`` ແລະ [literal]``-image``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:61
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:44
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:32
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:46
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrpxy install podman --httpd-tag 0.1.0 --httpd-image "
"registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-httpd /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install podman --httpd-tag 0.1.0 --httpd-image registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-httpd /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc:62
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:45
