#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a Custom Container Image for a Service"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Custom Container Image ສຳລັບ Service"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:42
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:30
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:44
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:142
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} Proxy suite is set to use the same image "
"version and registry path for each of its services.  However, it is possible "
"to override the default values for a specific service using the install "
"parameters ending with [literal]``-tag`` and [literal]``-image``."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, {productname} Proxy suite ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ image ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ registry ດຽວກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ service. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ service ໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [literal]``-tag`` ແລະ [literal]``-image``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:43
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:31
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:45
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:143
msgid "For example, use it like this:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃຊ້ງານຄືແນວນີ້:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Deployment as a Virtual Machine - VMware"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບ Virtual Machine - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the Virtual Machine settings for deployment of "
"{productname} {productnumber} Proxy as an image.  VMware will be used as a "
"sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Machine ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບ Image. VMware ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Machine Settings - VMware"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Machine - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This section describes VMware configurations, focusing on the creation of an "
"extra virtual disk essential for the {productname} Proxy storage partition "
"within VMware environments."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VMware, ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ການສ້າງ virtual disk ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ storage partition ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ພາຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ VMware."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This section specifies the minimum requirements.  These are suitable for a "
"quick test installation, such as a proxy with one client."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກຳນົດຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອທົດສອບແບບໄວ, ເຊັ່ນ proxy ທີ່ມີໄຄລແອນດຽວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the VMware Virtual Machine"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Download {productname} Proxy [filename]``.vmdk`` file then transfer a copy "
"to your VMware storage."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ຈາກນັ້ນໂອນຍ້າຍສຳເນົາໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ VMware ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Make a copy of uploaded [filename]``.vmdk`` file using VMware web "
"interface.  This will convert provided [filename]``.vmdk`` file to the "
"format suitable for vSphere hypervisor."
msgstr "ສ້າງສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດແລ້ວໂດຍໃຊ້ VMware web interface. ນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບ vSphere hypervisor."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Create and name a new virtual machine based on the Guest OS Family "
"[systemitem]``Linux`` and Guest OS Version {sle} 15 (64-bit)."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນໃໝ່ໂດຍອີງຕາມ Guest OS Family [systemitem]``Linux`` ແລະ Guest OS Version {sle} 15 (64-bit)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:22
msgid "Add an additional [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` of 100 GB (or more)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` ເພີ່ມເຕີມຂະໜາດ 100 GB (ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:22
msgid "Configure RAM and number of CPUs with minimum values. *)"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ RAM ແລະ ຈຳນວນ CPU ຕາມຄ່າຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ. *)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:24
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:23
msgid "Set the network adapter as required."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ network adapter ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:25
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Power on the VM, and follow firstboot dialogs (keyboard layout, license "
"agreement, time zone, password for root)."
msgstr "ເປີດເຄື່ອງ VM, ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ (ຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດ, ເຂດເວລາ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ root)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber}  Proxy Deployment on K3s"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ໃນ K3s"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing K3s"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ K3s"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy is supported on K3s running on top of {sle-micro} in a "
"single node cluster.  If you need to deploy it in any other Kubernetes "
"environment, please contact support for evaluation."
msgstr "{productname} Proxy ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນ K3s ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ {sle-micro} ໃນຮູບແບບ single node cluster. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Kubernetes ອື່ນໆ, ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພື່ອປະເມີນຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the container host machine, install [literal]``K3s`` (replace "
"[literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` with the FQDN of your K3s host):"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງ container host, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``K3s`` (ປ່ຽນ [literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` ເປັນ FQDN ຂອງ K3s host ຂອງທ່ານ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | "
"INSTALL_K3S_EXEC=\"--tls-san=<K3S_HOST_FQDN>\" sh -\n"
msgstr "curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | INSTALL_K3S_EXEC=\"--tls-san=<K3S_HOST_FQDN>\" sh -\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Tools"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມື"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The installation requires the [literal]``mgrpxy`` and [literal]``helm`` "
"packages."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການແພັກເກດ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ [literal]``helm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The [literal]``mgrpxy`` and ``helm`` packages are available in the "
"{productname} Proxy product repositories."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ ``helm`` ມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນ repository ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:9
msgid "To install it run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ຣັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update pkg install helm mgrpxy\n"
msgstr "transactional-update pkg install helm mgrpxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:39
msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot)"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying the {productname} Proxy Helm Chart"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy Helm Chart"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To configure the storage of the volumes to be used by the {productname} "
"Proxy pod, define persistent volumes for the following claims.  If you do "
"not customize the storage configuration, K3s will automatically create the "
"storage volumes for you."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ volumes ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ {productname} Proxy pod, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ persistent volumes ສຳລັບ claims ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເອງ, K3s ຈະສ້າງ storage volumes ໃຫ້ທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid "The persistent volume claims are named:"
msgstr "Persistent volume claims ຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "[literal]``squid-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``squid-cache-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:16
msgid "[literal]``package-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``package-cache-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:17
msgid "[literal]``tftp-boot-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``tftp-boot-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Create the configuration for the {productname} Proxy as documented in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc[].  "
"Copy the configuration [literal]``tar.gz`` file and then install:"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/proxy-deployment-suma.adoc[]. ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``tar.gz`` ຈາກນັ້ນຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy install kubernetes /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install kubernetes /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-k3s-deployment-suma.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information see "
"link:https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/[] "
"(kubernetes) or link:https://rancher.com/docs/k3s/latest/en/storage/[] (K3s) "
"documentation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ link:https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/[] (kubernetes) ຫຼື link:https://rancher.com/docs/k3s/latest/en/storage/[] (K3s)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍ Proxy (Proxy Migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname} 4.3, the proxy can be deployed using three different "
"methods: RPM based, containerized running on podman or k3s."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} 4.3, proxy ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ສາມວິທີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ: ແບບ RPM, ແບບ container ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນ podman ຫຼື k3s."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname} {productnumber}, management of the containerized proxy "
"running with podman was re-designed and made simpler with the "
"[command]``mgrpxy`` tool.  At the same time, RPM based support was removed, "
"and only the containerized version running with podman or k3s is supported."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {productnumber}, ການຈັດການ containerized proxy ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ podman ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບໃໝ່ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgrpxy``. ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນ, ການຮອງຮັບແບບ RPM ໄດ້ຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເວີຊັນ container ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ podman ຫຼື k3s ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section describes migrating from Proxy 4.3 using the "
"[command]``mgrpxy`` tool."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງການຍ້າຍຈາກ Proxy 4.3 ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:5
msgid ""
"An in-place migration from {productname} 4.3 to {productnumber} is "
"unsupported.  The host operating system has changed from {sles} 15 SP4 to "
"{sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-suma}."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບ In-place (ຕິດຕັ້ງທັບ) ຈາກ {productname} 4.3 ໄປເປັນ {productnumber} ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ. ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງໂຮສໄດ້ປ່ຽນຈາກ {sles} 15 SP4 ເປັນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The traditional contact protocol is no longer supported in {productname} 5.0 "
"and later.  Before migrating from {productname} 4.3 to {productnumber}, any "
"existing traditional clients including the traditional proxies must be "
"migrated to {salt}."
msgstr "Traditional contact protocol ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປໃນ {productname} 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຖັດໄປ. ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍຈາກ {productname} 4.3 ໄປເປັນ {productnumber}, ໄຄລແອນແບບ traditional ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ລວມທັງ traditional proxies ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຍ້າຍໄປເປັນ {salt} ກ່ອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about migrating to {salt} clients, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.html"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຍ້າຍໄປເປັນ {salt} clients, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.html"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy a New {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Because in-place migration is not supported, the users must deploy a new "
"{productname} proxy with a new FQDN."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບ In-place, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງນຳໃຊ້ {productname} proxy ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ FQDN ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information about installing {productname} Proxy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate Clients to the New Proxy"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍໄຄລແອນ (Clients) ໄປຫາ Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Before migrating the clients, ensure that the new proxy is already deployed "
"and fully functional."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍໄຄລແອນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ proxy ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating Client Between Proxies"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍໄຄລແອນລະຫວ່າງ Proxies"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Log in to the {productname} Server {webui}."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} Server {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:15
msgid "From the left navigation, select menu:Systems[Systems List]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Systems[Systems List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:16
msgid "Navigate to the old 4.3 proxy page, and click the [guimenu]``Proxy`` tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ proxy 4.3 ເກົ່າ, ແລະ ຄລິກແຖບ [guimenu]``Proxy``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:17
msgid "Select all systems to \"SSM\"."
msgstr "ເລືອກທຸກລະບົບໄປທີ່ \"SSM\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:18
msgid "From the left navigation, select menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:19
msgid "Select the sub-menu menu:Misc[Proxy]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູຍ່ອຍ menu:Misc[Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:20
msgid "From the drop-down select the new proxy to migrate to."
msgstr "ຈາກ Drop-down, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ proxy ໃໝ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:21
msgid "Click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Change Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:22
msgid ""
"All selected clients will now be migrated to the new proxy.  You can check "
"the schedule progress to verify if all clients were successfully migrated."
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນທີ່ເລືອກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຫາ proxy ໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງແຜນວຽກ (Schedule) ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າໄຄລແອນທັງໝົດໄດ້ຖືກຍ້າຍຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:23
msgid ""
"After a few minutes, the clients will start to show up the new connection "
"path.  When all clients have the connection path under the new proxy, the "
"old 4.3 proxy system is not needed anymore and can be removed."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນບໍ່ພໍເທົ່າໃດນາທີ, ໄຄລແອນຈະເລີ່ມສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່. ເມື່ອໄຄລແອນທັງໝົດມີເສັ້ນທາງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພາຍໃຕ້ proxy ໃໝ່ແລ້ວ, ລະບົບ proxy 4.3 ເກົ່າກໍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ແລະ ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "TFTP files synchronization"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄຟລ໌ TFTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Containerized proxies do not use tftpsync mechanism to transfer tftproot "
"files.  Instead these files are transparently downloaded and cached on "
"demand."
msgstr "Containerized proxies ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ກົນໄກ tftpsync ເພື່ອໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ tftproot. ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນັ້ນ, ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ເຮັດ cache ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການຮຽກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:26
msgid ""
"To prevent false positive errors during [command]``cobbler sync`` run, "
"migrated 4.3 proxies need to be removed from tftpsync mechanism."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບ False positive ໃນລະຫວ່າງການລັນ [command]``cobbler sync``, ບັນດາ proxy 4.3 ທີ່ຍ້າຍມາແລ້ວຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກຖອນອອກຈາກກົນໄກ tftpsync."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If you previously configured a 4.3 proxy to receive TFTP files, one of the "
"following configuration option is required:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເຄີຍຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy 4.3 ເພື່ອຮັບໄຟລ໌ TFTP ມາກ່ອນ, ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the server container, run [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` with the "
"list of remaining 4.3 proxies as arguments.  If no 4.3 proxies remain, run "
"[command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` with no arguments."
msgstr "ໃນ server container, ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` ພ້ອມກັບລາຍຊື່ proxy 4.3 ທີ່ເຫຼືອຢູ່ເປັນ Arguments. ຫາກບໍ່ມີ proxy 4.3 ເຫຼືອຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ Arguments."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/proxy-migration-suma.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the server container, manually remove the relevant proxy from the "
"[option]``proxies`` setting in the [path]``/etc/cobbler/settings.yaml`` "
"file.  If there are no 4.3 proxies remaining, then manually remove the "
"[option]``proxies`` list completely."
msgstr "ໃນ server container, ໃຫ້ລຶບ proxy ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງອອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [option]``proxies`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/cobbler/settings.yaml``. ຫາກບໍ່ມີ proxy 4.3 ເຫຼືອຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບລາຍຊື່ [option]``proxies`` ອອກທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server Air-gapped Deployment"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Server ແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped)"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is Air-gapped Deployment?"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped) ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployments"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ (Deployments)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:6
msgid "{productname} supports two deployment variants."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບການນຳໃຊ້ສອງຮູບແບບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about installing {productname} Server Virtual Machine, "
"see xref:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc[Deploy "
"Server as a Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server Virtual Machine, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc[Deploy Server as a Virtual Machine]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:22
msgid ""
"To upgrade {productname} Server, users should upgrade all packages in the "
"system and follow the procedures defined in "
"xref:container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc[Server Upgrade]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ {productname} Server, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນອັບເກຣດທຸກແພັກເກດໃນລະບົບ ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ xref:container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc[Server Upgrade]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy {productname} on {sle-micro}"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ {sle-micro}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:13
msgid ""
"User should make the needed RPM available on the internal network. That can "
"be done by using a second {productname} Server or an RMT server."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນເຮັດໃຫ້ RPM ທີ່ຈຳເປັນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ. ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ {productname} Server ອັນທີສອງ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີ RMT."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Install {productname} on SLE Micro in air-gapped deployment"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນ SLE Micro ແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Install tools packages and image packages (replace $ARCH$ with the correct "
"architecture)."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ແພັກເກດຮູບພາບ (ປ່ຽນ $ARCH$ ເປັນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update pkg install mgradm* mgrctl* "
"suse-manager-5.0-$ARCH$-server-*\n"
msgstr "transactional-update pkg install mgradm* mgrctl* suse-manager-5.0-$ARCH$-server-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:20
msgid "Deploy {productname} with mgradm."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ {productname} ດ້ວຍ mgradm."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more detailed information about installing {productname} Server on "
"{sle-micro}, see "
"xref:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[Deploy Server as "
"a Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ໃນ {sle-micro}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[Deploy Server as a Virtual Machine]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "PTFs"
msgstr "PTFs"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The PTF images are not available as packages.  This means that they should "
"be pulled using [command]``podman`` on a machine with internet access, then "
"saved in an archive, transferred to the air-gapped machine and loaded there."
msgstr "PTF images ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກມັນຄວນຖືກດຶງ (Pull) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``podman`` ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີອິນເຕີເນັດ, ຈາກນັ້ນບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ (Archive), ໂອນຍ້າຍໄປຫາເຄື່ອງທີ່ແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped) ແລະ ໂຫຼດຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Pulling the image on a machine with internet access"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຶງ Image ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີອິນເຕີເນັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:26
msgid "Install [command]``podman``."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ [command]``podman``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:27
msgid "Authenticate against the {suse} Registry using the SCC credentials:"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ {suse} Registry ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SCC:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:28
msgid "Run the following commands in a shell."
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ Shell."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:29
msgid ""
"This example assumes that the PTF is for the [path]``server`` image, adjust "
"the example if the PTF concerns another image."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າ PTF ແມ່ນສຳລັບ [path]``server`` image, ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນຕົວຢ່າງຫາກ PTF ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ image ອື່ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SCC_USERID=aXXXX\n"
"PTFID=12345\n"
"echo "
"\"registry.suse.com/a/$SCC_USERID/$PTFID/suse/manager/5.0/x86_64/server:latest-ptf-$PTFID\" "
">>/tmp/ptf-images\n"
msgstr ""
"SCC_USERID=aXXXX\n"
"PTFID=12345\n"
"echo \"registry.suse.com/a/$SCC_USERID/$PTFID/suse/manager/5.0/x86_64/server:latest-ptf-$PTFID\" >>/tmp/ptf-images\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Verify that the file contains the full path to the PTF image.  If needed, "
"other images full paths can be added to the file, one per line."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າໄຟລ໌ມີເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມໄປຫາ PTF image. ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ສາມາດເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມຂອງ image ອື່ນໆລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ໄດ້, ໜຶ່ງລາຍການຕໍ່ແຖວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Pull each of the container images of the PTF and save them in a tar archive "
"by running the following commands."
msgstr "ດຶງແຕ່ລະ container images ຂອງ PTF ແລະ ບັນທຶກພວກມັນໄວ້ໃນ Tar archive ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for image in `cat /tmp/ptf-images`; do\n"
"    podman pull $image\n"
"done\n"
"podman save -o /tmp/ptf-images.tar $(cat /tmp/ptf-images)\n"
msgstr ""
"for image in `cat /tmp/ptf-images`; do\n"
"    podman pull $image\n"
"done\n"
"podman save -o /tmp/ptf-images.tar $(cat /tmp/ptf-images)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Transfer the [path]``/tmp/ptf-images.tar`` images archive on the server to "
"patch."
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍ [path]``/tmp/ptf-images.tar`` ບ່ອນເກັບ images ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະລົງແພັດ (Patch)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Loading the images on the server to patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໂຫຼດ images ໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະລົງແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:36
msgid "Ensure the [path]``ptf-images.tar`` file is available on the server."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟລ໌ [path]``ptf-images.tar`` ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:37
msgid "Load the images from the archive:"
msgstr "ໂຫຼດ images ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman load -i ptf-images.tar\n"
msgstr "podman load -i ptf-images.tar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:39
msgid "Install the PTF as it would be done on a connected machine, using command:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF ຄືກັນກັບທີ່ເຮັດໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm support ptf podman [--test|--ptf] NUMBER --user SCC_ACCOUNT\n"
msgstr "mgradm support ptf podman [--test|--ptf] NUMBER --user SCC_ACCOUNT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc:41
msgid "Because the images are already loaded they will not be pulled."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ images ຖືກໂຫຼດໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກດຶງ (Pull) ອີກ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you how to install and configure a {productname} "
"{productnumber} container on {sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} "
"{bci-suma}."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {productnumber} container ໃນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}."

#.  Link to hardware requirements do not show them here. We list them on other pages.
#.  Done within next section.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements for {productname}"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວສຳລັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This table shows the software and hardware requirements for deploying "
"{productname} Server on your bare metal machine.  For the purposes of this "
"guide your machine should have 16 GB of RAM, and at least 200 GB of disk "
"space.  For background information about disk space, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຊອບແວ ແລະ ຮາດແວສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Server ໃນເຄື່ອງ bare metal ຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຄູ່ມືນີ້, ເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານຄວນມີ RAM 16 GB, ແລະ ເນື້ອທີ່ດິດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 200 GB. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເນື້ອທີ່ດິດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software and Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຊອບແວ ແລະ ຮາດແວ"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Software and Hardware  | Recommended\n"
"| Operating System       | {sle-micro} {microversion} or\n"
"\n"
"                           {sles} {bci-suma}\n"
"| Architecture           | {x86_64}, {arm}, {s390x}, {ppc64le}\n"
"| Processor (CPU)        | Minimum of four (4) 64-bit CPU cores\n"
"| RAM                    | 16 GB\n"
"| Disk Space             | 200 GB\n"
"| Channel Requirements   | 50 GB per SUSE or openSUSE product\n"
"                          \n"
"                           360 GB per Red Hat product\n"
"| Swap space:            | 3 GB\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຊອບແວ ແລະ ຮາດແວ | ທີ່ແນະນຳ\n"
"| ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ | {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}\n"
"| ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ | {x86_64}, {arm}, {s390x}, {ppc64le}\n"
"| ຊີພີຢູ (CPU) | ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສີ່ (4) cores ສຳລັບ CPU 64-bit\n"
"| ແຣມ (RAM) | 16 GB\n"
"| ເນື້ອທີ່ດິດ | 200 GB\n"
"| ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel) | 50 GB ຕໍ່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ຫຼື openSUSE\n"
"| | 360 GB ຕໍ່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ Red Hat\n"
"| ເນື້ອທີ່ Swap: | 3 GB\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating system for the Server Container Host"
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Server Container Host"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The supported operating system for the container host is {sle-micro} "
"{microversion} or {sles} {bci-suma}."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ container host ແມ່ນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A container host is a server equipped with a container engine like "
"[systemitem]``Podman``, which lets it manage and deploy containers.  These "
"containers hold applications and their essential parts, such as libraries, "
"but not a full operating system, making them lightweight.  This setup "
"ensures applications run the same way in different environments.  The "
"container host supplies the necessary resources such as CPU, memory, and "
"storage for these containers."
msgstr "Container host ແມ່ນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີ Container Engine ເຊັ່ນ [systemitem]``Podman``, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຈັດການ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ containers ໄດ້. containers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ Libraries, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທັງໝົດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. Container host ຈະສະໜອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ CPU, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກັບ containers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Server deployment mandates the use of a fully qualified domain name (FQDN).  "
"In the absence of automatic DNS provision of an FQDN by your router or "
"network, the deployment process will not proceed successfully.  An FQDN "
"typically follows the format <host>.<domain>.com."
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ເຊີເວີຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN). ຫາກບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດ FQDN ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຜ່ານ DNS ຈາກເຣົາເຕີ ຫຼື ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳໃຊ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ. FQDN ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ <host>.<domain>.com."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:12
msgid "For instance:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:13
msgid "[literal]``suma.example.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``suma.example.com``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:14
msgid "[literal]``suma.container.lab``"
msgstr "[literal]``suma.container.lab``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information, see the section on network requirements in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persistent Volumes"
msgstr "Persistent Volumes (ເນື້ອທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນ)"

#.  This sections needs to be run by devs. How would a customer use custom storage? How do we set this up with mgradm?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} {productnumber} defines the required persistent storage "
"volumes by default.  These are created during installation by the "
"[command]``mgradm`` tool if they do not already exist."
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} ກຳນົດ persistent storage volumes ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄວ້ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm`` ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:18
msgid ""
"These volumes are created in [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``, "
"where [systemitem]``Podman`` stores its volumes by default."
msgstr "volumes ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``, ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ [systemitem]``Podman`` ເກັບ volumes ຂອງມັນໄວ້ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommendations"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You can leverage the simplicity of storage by mounting an external storage "
"device to this directory.  Because it will store the {postgresql} database, "
"binary packages for repositories, caches, operating system images, "
"autoinstallation distributions, and configuration files, we have three "
"recommendations:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຄວາມງ່າຍຂອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍການ Mount ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກເຂົ້າໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າມັນຈະເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql}, ແພັກເກດ Binary ສຳລັບ repositories, caches, images ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, autoinstallation distributions, ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງມີສາມຄຳແນະນຳ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fast Storage"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມໄວສູງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This mount point should ideally be NVMe or SSD-class devices.  Slower "
"storage will adversely affect {productname} performance."
msgstr "ຈຸດ Mount ນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນອຸປະກອນປະເພດ NVMe ຫຼື SSD. ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບທາງລົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large Capacity"
msgstr "ຄວາມຈຸຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Recommended minimum size for this is at least 300 GB, and larger if there "
"will be multiple Linux distributions or architectures to manage."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 300 GB, ແລະ ຄວນໃຫຍ່ກວ່ານີ້ຫາກມີຫຼາຍ Linux distributions ຫຼື ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended Filesystem"
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (Filesystem) ທີ່ແນະນຳ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:26
msgid ""
"XFS (though any supported filesystem for {sle-micro} {microversion} could "
"work)."
msgstr "XFS (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຮອງຮັບກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ (Optional)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can provide custom storage for the volumes by mounting disks on the "
"expected volume path inside it such as "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk``.  This adds to "
"the complexity of a {productname} deployment, and may affect the resilience "
"the default storage recommendation provides."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເອງສຳລັບ volumes ໂດຍການ Mount ດິດໃນເສັ້ນທາງ volume ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່ນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk``. ນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນໃຫ້ກັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname}, ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນທີ່ຄຳແນະນຳບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານມີໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For a list of all persistent volumes in the container, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຂອງ persistent volumes ທັງໝົດໃນ container, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {productname} Server Host"
msgstr "ກຽມ {productname} Server Host"

#.  FIXME
#.  Maybe, here we'd better use a section title such as:
#.  _Prepare Host OS for {productname} Deployment_
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:31
msgid ""
"You can deploy {productname} on {sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} "
"{bci-suma}.  {sle-micro} is a transactional system, while {sles} is a full "
"server operating system."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}. {sle-micro} ແມ່ນລະບົບແບບ Transactional, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ {sles} ແມ່ນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເຊີເວີແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Depending on your decision, either continue with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-server-micro[] "
"or with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-server-sles[] "
"and skip the not selected section."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການຕັດສິນໃຈຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-server-micro[] ຫຼື xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-server-sles[] ແລະ ຂ້າມພາກສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To continue with deployment, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-server-persistent-storage[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການນຳໃຊ້ຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-server-persistent-storage[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Configuring persistent storage is optional, but it is the only way to avoid "
"serious trouble with container full disk conditions.  It is highly "
"recommended to configure custom persistent storage with the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` tool."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ, ແຕ່ມັນເປັນວິທີດຽວທີ່ຈະຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງເມື່ອເນື້ອທີ່ດິດຂອງ container ເເຕັມ. ຂໍແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນເອງດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-server``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:37
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:54
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:44
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-server --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container storage and database volumes."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server --help``. ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ container ແລະ volumes ຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:39
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:56
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:46
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:31
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server <storage-disk-device> [<database-disk-device>]\n"
msgstr "mgr-storage-server <storage-disk-device> [<database-disk-device>]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:41
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:58
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:48
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1\n"
msgstr "mgr-storage-server /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy {productname} with [literal]``mgradm``"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ {productname} ດ້ວຍ [literal]``mgradm``"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying {productname} {productnumber} Using [literal]``mgradm``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} ໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``mgradm``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:48
msgid "Log in as root."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເປັນ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Execute the following command, replacing `<suma.example.com>` with your "
"fully qualified domain name:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ໂດຍປ່ຽນ `<suma.example.com>` ເປັນ Fully Qualified Domain Name ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman <suma.example.com>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman <suma.example.com>\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:51
msgid ""
"If the above command fails ensure that you have registered {productname} "
"{productnumber}.  If you skipped registration during installation and now "
"need to register from the command line, follow the steps below to log in to "
"the registry:"
msgstr "ຫາກຄຳສັ່ງຂ້າງເທິງລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນ {productname} {productnumber} ແລ້ວ. ຫາກທ່ານຂ້າມການລົງທະບຽນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕອນນີ້ຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ Command line, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Registry:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:52
msgid "Use the {productname} {productnumber} registration key when prompted."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} registration key ເມື່ອລະບົບຖາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Enter CA key (certificate authority) and administrator account password when "
"prompted."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ CA key (Certificate Authority) ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານບັນຊີຜູ້ບໍລິຫານເມື່ອລະບົບຖາມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:54
msgid ""
"The administrator account password must be at least 5 characters and less "
"than 48 characters in length."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານບັນຊີຜູ້ບໍລິຫານຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 5 ຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ບໍ່ເກີນ 48 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:55
msgid "Press btn:[Enter]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Enter]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:56
msgid "Enter the email address of the administration account.  Press btn:[Enter]."
msgstr "ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລຂອງບັນຊີຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ. ກົດ btn:[Enter]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:57
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:46
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:18
msgid "Wait for deployment to complete."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການນຳໃຊ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:58
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:64
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:47
msgid "Open a browser and proceed to your servers FQDN."
msgstr "ເປີດບຣາວເຊີ ແລະ ໄປຫາ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:59
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Enter your username (default is [literal]``admin``) and the password you set "
"during the deployment process."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ (ມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ [literal]``admin``) ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:60
msgid ""
"In this guide you deployed {productname} {productnumber} Server as a "
"container.  Proceed to the next section to add your organization credentials "
"for syncing with {scclongform}."
msgstr "ໃນຄູ່ມືນີ້, ທ່ານໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server ໃນຮູບແບບ container. ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນຖັດໄປເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scclongform}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect {productname} {productnumber} to {scclongform}"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} {productnumber} ກັບ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:62
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"This section covers synchronizing with {scc} from the {webui} and adding "
"your first client channel."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scc} ຈາກ {webui} ແລະ ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໄຄລແອນ (Client channel) ທຳອິດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:63
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Entering Organization Credentials"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:66
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, select menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:67
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page select the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກແຖບ btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:68
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Add a new credential]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Add a new credential]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:69
msgid "Point your browser to the {scclongform}."
msgstr "ເປີດບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານໄປທີ່ {scclongform}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:70
msgid "Select your organization from the left navigation."
msgstr "ເລືອກອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານຈາກແຖບເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Select the users tab from the top of the page then btn:[Organization "
"Credentials]."
msgstr "ເລືອກແຖບຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Users) ຈາກດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າ ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:72
msgid "Make a note of your **Mirroring credentials**."
msgstr "ຈົດບັນທຶກ **Mirroring credentials** ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Back in the {productname} {webui} enter your [guimenu]``Username`` and "
"[guimenu]``Password``, and confirm with btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ກັບມາທີ່ {productname} {webui}, ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Username`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Password`` ຂອງທ່ານ, ຈາກນັ້ນຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:74
msgid ""
"When the credentials are confirmed with a green check-mark icon, proceed "
"with <<proc-quickstart-first-channel-sync>>."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍໄອຄອນໝາຍຕິກສີຂຽວແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໃນ <<proc-quickstart-first-channel-sync>>."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:75
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing with {scclongform}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:76
msgid "In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:77
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page select the [guimenu]``SUSE "
"Products`` tab.  If you recently registered with {scclongform} a list of "
"products will begin populating the table.  This operation could take up to a "
"few minutes.  You can monitor the progress of the operation in section on "
"the right ``Refresh the product catalog from {scclongform}``.  The table of "
"products lists architecture, channels, and status information.  For more "
"information, see xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Setup Wizard``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກແຖບ [guimenu]``SUSE Products``. ຫາກທ່ານຫາກໍລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}, ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະເລີ່ມປາກົດໃນຕາຕະລາງ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໄດ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນດ້ານຂວາ ``Refresh the product catalog from {scclongform}``. ຕາຕະລາງຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະສະແດງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:78
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "admin_suse_products.png"
msgstr "admin_suse_products.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Use the ``Filter by product description`` and ``Filter by architecture`` to "
"filter the list of displayed products.  The channels listed on the "
"btn:[Products] page provide repositories for clients."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ ``Filter by product description`` ແລະ ``Filter by architecture`` ເພື່ອກັ່ນຕອງລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ສະແດງ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໜ້າ btn:[Products] ຈະສະໜອງ repositories ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Add channels to {productname} by selecting the check box to the left of each "
"channel.  Click the arrow symbol to the left of the description to unfold a "
"product and list available modules."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ໂດຍການເລືອກຊ່ອງໝາຍຕິກທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງ. ຄລິກສັນຍະລັກລູກສອນທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງຄຳອະທິບາຍເພື່ອເປີດເບິ່ງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນທີ່ມີໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:81
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add Products] at the top of the page to start product "
"synchronization."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add Products] ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:82
msgid ""
"After adding the channel, {productname} will schedule the channel to be "
"synchronized.  This can take a long time as {productname} will copy channel "
"software sources from the {suse} repositories located at {scclongform} to "
"the local [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` "
"directory of your server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງແລ້ວ, {productname} ຈະຈັດຕາຕະລາງໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} ຈະສຳເນົາຊອບແວຈາກ {suse} repositories ທີ່ຢູ່ {scclongform} ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` ຂອງເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:83
msgid ""
"When the channel is fully synchronized, a bootstrap repository for it will "
"be automatically generated.  This step is crucial for successfully "
"bootstrapping clients, ensuring that the channel synchronization and "
"distribution are operational on the client side. This completes the "
"installation and configuration of {productname}, along with preparing the "
"channels necessary for bootstrapping clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນຢ່າງສົມບູນ, bootstrap repository ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການເຮັດ Bootstrap ໄຄລແອນໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ແລະ ການແຈກຢາຍຊ່ອງທາງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນຝ່າຍໄຄລແອນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການສິ້ນສຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}, ພ້ອມກັບການກຽມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Bootstrap ໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:84
msgid ""
"When the channel synchronization process is complete, you can proceed with "
"registering the {productname} {productnumber} Proxy or additional clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂັ້ນຕອນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ຫຼື ໄຄລແອນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:85
msgid ""
"For more instructions, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entering the Container for Management"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ Container ເພື່ອການຈັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:87
msgid "To get to a shell inside the container, run on the container host:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາ Shell ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ລັນໃນເຄື່ອງ container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment as a Virtual Machine - KVM"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server ໃນຮູບແບບ Virtual Machine - KVM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the required Virtual Machine settings for deployment "
"of {productname} {productnumber} as an image.  KVM will be combined with "
"Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) as a sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Machine ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} ໃນຮູບແບບ Image. KVM ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The preferred method for deploying {productname} {productnumber} Server is "
"to use one of the following available images.  All tools are included in "
"these images greatly simplifying deployment."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ Image ໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ເຄື່ອງມືທັງໝົດໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ Image ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແລ້ວ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການນຳໃຊ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Images for {productname} {productnumber} are available at "
"link:https://www.suse.com/download/suse-manager/[{productname} "
"{productnumber} VM images]."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບ (Images) ສຳລັບ {productname} {productnumber} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ທີ່ link:https://www.suse.com/download/suse-manager/[{productname} {productnumber} VM images]."

