#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:41
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
