msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ {sle-micro} ແລະ {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:42
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:32
