msgid "Boot the virtual machine."
msgstr "ບູດ (Boot) ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (Virtual Machine)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:43
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:33
