msgstr "ຫາກມີການອັບເດດໃຫ້ທຳການຣີບູດ (reboot)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:53
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:43
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:28
msgid ""
"This step is optional.  However, if custom persistent storage is required "
"for your infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` tool."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄົງທີ່ (persistent storage) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-server``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:59
msgid ""
"This command will move the persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` to specified storage devices."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະຍ້າຍວໍລຸມການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄົງທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຫາອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:63
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:53
msgid "Run the following command to deploy {productname}:"
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ (deploy) {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc:64
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment as a Virtual Machine - "
"VMware"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber} ໃນຮູບແບບເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the required Virtual Machine settings for deployment "
"of {productname} {productnumber} as an Image.  VMware will be used as a "
"sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (Virtual Machine) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber} ໃນຮູບແບບຮູບພາບ (Image). VMware ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ sandbox ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Virtual Machine Settings - VMware"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ {productname} - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This sections describes VMware configurations, focusing on the creation of "
"an extra virtual disk essential for the {productname} storage partition "
"within VMware environments."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VMware, ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ການສ້າງດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname} ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ VMware."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Download {productname} Server [filename]``.vmdk`` file then transfer a copy "
"to your VMware storage."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ຂອງ {productname} Server ແລ້ວຍ້າຍສຳເນົາໄປທີ່ VMware storage ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:21
msgid "Add an additional [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` of 500 GB (or more)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` ເພີ່ມເຕີມຂະໜາດ 500 GB (ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Before starting obtain your {productname} Registration Code from "
"{scclongform} - https://scc.suse.com."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຂໍລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຈາກ {scclongform} - https://scc.suse.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vmdk-suma.adoc:34
msgid "Register {sle-micro} with {scc}."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {sle-micro} ກັບ {scc}."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server Migration to a Containerized Environment"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄປສູ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#.  container host = new server = new server machine with the {productname} {productnumber} Server container(s)
#.  old server = {productname} 4.3 Server
#.  We need to figure out which SUMA versions prior to the container release can or should be migrated. Something like any version prior to yyyy.mm and later than.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and Considerations"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "General"
msgstr "ທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To migrate a {productname} 4.3 Server to a container, you require a new "
"machine with {sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-suma}, and "
"[literal]``mgradm`` installed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍ້າຍເຊີເວີ {productname} 4.3 ໄປສູ່ຄອນເທນເນີ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ທີ່ມີ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``mgradm`` ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:5
msgid ""
"An in-place migration from {productname} 4.3 to {productnumber} is not "
"supported, regardless of whether the chosen host operating system is "
"{sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-suma}."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບຢູ່ກັບທີ່ (in-place migration) ຈາກ {productname} 4.3 ໄປເປັນ {productnumber} ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເລືອກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໂຮສ (host OS) ເປັນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma} ກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Before migrating from {productname} 4.3 to {productnumber}, any existing "
"traditional clients including the traditional proxies must be migrated to "
"{salt}."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍຈາກ {productname} 4.3 ໄປຫາ {productnumber}, ລູກຂ່າຍແບບເກົ່າ (traditional clients) ທຸກເຄື່ອງ ລວມທັງພຣັອກຊີແບບເກົ່າ (traditional proxies) ຕ້ອງຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຫາ {salt} ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about migrating traditional {productname} 4.3 clients "
"to {salt} clients, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍ {productname} 4.3 ແບບເກົ່າ ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ {salt}, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Traditional contact protocol is no longer supported in {productname} 5.0 and "
"later."
msgstr "ໂປຣໂຕຄອນການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບເກົ່າ (Traditional contact protocol) ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປໃນ {productname} 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This guide only covers the migration from {productname} 4.3 to "
"{productnumber}.  Migrating an existing {productname} {productnumber} "
"instance to the same version while switching the host operating system from "
"{sle-micro} {microversion} to {sles} {bci-suma}, or vice versa, is not "
"handled by the [command]``mgradm migrate`` command."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ກວມເອົາສະເພາະການຍ້າຍຈາກ {productname} 4.3 ໄປຫາ {productnumber} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຍ້າຍ {productname} {productnumber} ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄປຫາເວີຊັນດຽວກັນ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປ່ຽນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໂຮສຈາກ {sle-micro} {microversion} ໄປເປັນ {sles} {bci-suma}, ຫຼື ກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm migrate``."

#
#
#. // 2025-06-25, ke: with https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-docs/pull/4056
#. //                 the Hostnames section is considered obsolete.  Thus
#. //                 commented for now.
#. === Hostnames
#. * The current migration procedure does not include functionality for renaming hostnames.
#.   As a result, the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the new server will remain the same as that of the old server.
#. * The IP address must remain unchanged to ensure that the clients can contact the server.
#. +
#. [IMPORTANT]
#. ====
#. After the migration, it will be necessary to manually update the DHCP and DNS records to point to the new server.
#. ====
#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Keys"
msgstr "ກະແຈ GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:11
msgid "Self trusted GPG keys are not migrated."
msgstr "ກະແຈ GPG ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (Self trusted) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:12
msgid ""
"GPG keys that are trusted in the RPM database only are not migrated.  Thus "
"synchronizing channels with [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` can fail."
msgstr "ກະແຈ GPG ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ RPM ເທົ່ານັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (synchronizing) ຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍ [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` ອາດຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The administrator must migrate these keys manually from the 4.3 installation "
"to the container host after the actual server migration."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕ້ອງຍ້າຍກະແຈເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນ 4.3 ໄປຫາຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍເຊີເວີຕົວຈິງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Manual Migration of the 4.3 GPG Keys to New Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍກະແຈ GPG ຂອງເວີຊັນ 4.3 ໄປຫາເຊີເວີໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:15
msgid "Copy the keys from the 4.3 server to the container host of the new server."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ກະແຈຈາກເຊີເວີ 4.3 ໄປຫາຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສຂອງເຊີເວີໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Later, add each key to the migrated server with the command "
"[command]``mgradm gpg add <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE>``."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມແຕ່ລະກະແຈເຂົ້າໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ຍ້າຍມາແລ້ວດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm gpg add <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE>``."

#. The current migration procedure does not include functionality for renaming hostnames.
#. As a result, the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the new server will remain the same as that of the old server.
#. Additionally, the IP address must remain unchanged to ensure that the clients can contact the server.
#. After the migration, it will be necessary to manually update the DHCP and DNS records to point to the new server.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (Migration)"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {productname} {productnumber} Server Host"
msgstr "ຕຽມໂຮສສຳລັບເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Do not pre-install {productname} on the prepared {sle-micro} {microversion} "
"or {sles} {bci-suma} system.  The migration process is designed to perform "
"the server installation automatically.  Running [command]``mgradm install`` "
"and then [command]``mgradm migrate`` is not supported and will lead to an "
"unsupported system state."
msgstr "ຫ້າມຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໄວ້ກ່ອນໃນລະບົບ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma} ທີ່ກຽມໄວ້. ຂະບວນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ການຣັນ [command]``mgradm install`` ແລ້ວຕາມດ້ວຍ [command]``mgradm migrate`` ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the following steps, we are only preparing the host system, not "
"installing the actual {productname} {productnumber} Server."
msgstr "ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ກຽມລະບົບໂຮສເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber} ຕົວຈິງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Connection Preparation"
msgstr "ການກຽມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This step ensures that the new {productname} {productnumber} Server can "
"connect to the existing 4.3 Server over SSH without requiring a password.  "
"It involves generating and configuring SSH keys, setting up an SSH agent, "
"and copying the public key to the old server."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber} ໃໝ່ ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ 4.3 ເດີມຜ່ານ SSH ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍການສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າກະແຈ SSH, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH agent, ແລະ ການກັອບປີ້ public key ໄປຫາເຊີເວີເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This setup is required for the migration process to run without manual "
"intervention."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຍ້າຍລະບົບດຳເນີນໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີການແຊກແຊງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the SSH Connection"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Ensure that for [systemitem]``root`` an SSH key exists on the new "
"{productnumber} server.  If a key does not exist, create it with:"
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າສຳລັບ [systemitem]``root`` ມີກະແຈ SSH ຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productnumber} ໃໝ່ແລ້ວ. ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ມີກະແຈ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -t rsa\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -t rsa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The SSH configuration and agent should be ready on the new server for a "
"connection to the 4.3 server that does not prompt for a password."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ແລະ agent ຄວນຈະພ້ອມຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ 4.3 ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຖາມຫາລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "eval $(ssh-agent); ssh-add\n"
msgstr "eval $(ssh-agent); ssh-add\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:29
msgid ""
"To establish a connection that does not prompt for a password, the migration "
"script relies on an SSH agent running on the new server.  If the agent is "
"not active yet, initiate it by running [command]``eval $(ssh-agent)``.  Then "
"add the SSH key to the running agent with [command]``ssh-add`` followed by "
"the path to the private key.  You will be prompted to enter the password for "
"the private key during this process."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຖາມຫາລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ສະຄຣິບການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະອາໄສ SSH agent ທີ່ຣັນຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່. ຫາກ agent ຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການຣັນ [command]``eval $(ssh-agent)``. ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມກະແຈ SSH ເຂົ້າໃນ agent ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ [command]``ssh-add`` ຕາມດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາ private key. ທ່ານຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ private key ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Copy the public SSH key to the {productname} 4.3 Server "
"([literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>``) with [command]``ssh-copy-id``.  Replace "
"[literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` with the FQDN of the 4.3 server:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ public SSH key ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ {productname} 4.3 ([literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>``) ດ້ວຍ [command]``ssh-copy-id``. ແທນບ່ອນ [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` ດ້ວຍ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ 4.3:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-copy-id <old server.fqdn>\n"
msgstr "ssh-copy-id <old server.fqdn>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The SSH key will be copied into the old server's "
"[path]``~/.ssh/authorized_keys`` file.  For more information, see the "
"[literal]``ssh-copy-id`` manpage."
msgstr "ກະແຈ SSH ຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``~/.ssh/authorized_keys`` ຂອງເຊີເວີເກົ່າ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ manpage ຂອງ [literal]``ssh-copy-id``."

#.  . This step is optional:
#.    The migration script only uses the 4.3 server's FQDN in the SSH command.
#.    This means that every other configuration required to connect, needs to be defined in the [path]``~/.ssh/config`` file.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Establish an SSH connection from the new server to the old {productname} "
"Server to check that no password is needed.  Also there must not by any "
"problem with the host fingerprint.  In case of trouble, remove old "
"fingerprints from the [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` file.  Then try again.  "
"The fingerprint will be stored in the local [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` "
"file."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈາກເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຫາເຊີເວີ {productname} ເກົ່າເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີບັນຫາກັບ fingerprint ຂອງໂຮສ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ລົບ fingerprints ເກົ່າອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ. fingerprint ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform the Migration"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:35
msgid ""
"When planning your migration from {productname} 4.3 to {productname} "
"{productnumber}, ensure that your target instance meets or exceeds the "
"specifications of the old setup."
msgstr "ເມື່ອວາງແຜນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈາກ {productname} 4.3 ໄປຫາ {productname} {productnumber}, ໃຫ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງຂອງທ່ານມີຄຸນສົມບັດເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າເດີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:36
msgid ""
"This includes, but is not limited to, memory (RAM), CPU Cores, Storage, and "
"Network Bandwidth."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມເຖິງ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຈຳກັດພຽງແຕ່, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (RAM), ຄໍຂອງຊີພີຢູ (CPU Cores), ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຊ່ອງສັນຍານເຄືອຂ່າຍ (Network Bandwidth)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing the Migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:38
msgid ""
"This step is optional.  If custom persistent storage is required for your "
"infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` tool.  For more "
"information about [command]``mgr-storage-server``, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ຫາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-server``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [command]``mgr-storage-server``, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Execute the following command to install a new {productname} server.  "
"Replace [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` with the FQDN of the 4.3 server:"
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃໝ່. ແທນບ່ອນ [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` ດ້ວຍ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ 4.3:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Make sure to upgrade your 4.3 server and apply all available updates before "
"starting the migration process.  Additionally, remove any unnecessary "
"channels to help reduce the overall migration time."
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າໄດ້ອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີ 4.3 ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກການອັບເດດທີ່ມີຢູ່ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມຂະບວນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ໃຫ້ລົບຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອອກ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາໃນການຍ້າຍລະບົບໂດຍລວມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:41
msgid ""
"The migration can take a very long time depending on the amount of data that "
"needs to be replicated.  To reduce downtime it is possible to run the "
"migration multiple times in a process of _initial replication_, "
"_re-replication_, or _final replication and switch over_ while all the "
"services on the old server can stay up and running."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຫຼາຍ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງທຳສຳເນົາ (replicate). ເພື່ອຫຼຸດເວລາທີ່ລະບົບຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (downtime), ທ່ານສາມາດຣັນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນຂະບວນການຂອງ _initial replication_, _re-replication_, ຫຼື _final replication and switch over_ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການບໍລິການທັງໝົດໃນເຊີເວີເກົ່າຍັງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Only during the final migration the processes on the old server need to be "
"stopped."
msgstr "ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຂະບວນການຕ່າງໆໃນເຊີເວີເກົ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For all non-final replications add the parameter [command]``--prepare`` to "
"prevent the automatic stopping the services on the old server.  For example "
"on {productname} server:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການທຳສຳເນົາທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ [command]``--prepare`` ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຢຸດການບໍລິການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເຊີເວີເກົ່າ. ຕົວຢ່າງໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm migrate podman <oldserver.fqdn> --prepare\n"
msgstr "mgradm migrate podman <oldserver.fqdn> --prepare\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Final Migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລະບົບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:46
msgid "Stop the {productname} services on 4.3 Server:"
msgstr "ຢຸດການບໍລິການ {productname} ໃນເຊີເວີ 4.3:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:47
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-service stop\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-service stop\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:48
msgid "Stop the PostgreSQL service on 4.3 Server:"
msgstr "ຢຸດການບໍລິການ PostgreSQL ໃນເຊີເວີ 4.3:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:49
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl stop postgresql\n"
msgstr "systemctl stop postgresql\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:50
msgid "Perform the migration on {productname} server"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm migrate podman <oldserver.fqdn>\n"
msgstr "mgradm migrate podman <oldserver.fqdn>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:52
msgid "Migrate trusted SSL CA certificates."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL CA ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration of the Certificates"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Trusted SSL CA certificates that were installed as part of an RPM and stored "
"on {productname} 4.3 in the [path]``/usr/share/pki/trust/anchors/`` "
"directory will not be migrated.  Because {suse} does not install RPM "
"packages in the container, the administrator must migrate these certificate "
"files manually from the 4.3 installation after the migration."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL CA ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືເຊິ່ງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ RPM ແລະ ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ {productname} 4.3 ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/share/pki/trust/anchors/`` ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປ. ເນື່ອງຈາກ {suse} ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ RPM ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ, ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕ້ອງຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນ 4.3 ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating the Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:56
msgid "Copy the file from the 4.3 server to the new server."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ຈາກເຊີເວີ 4.3 ໄປຫາເຊີເວີໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:57
msgid "For example, as [path]``/local/ca.file``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເກັບໄວ້ເປັນ [path]``/local/ca.file``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:58
msgid "Copy the file into the container with:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນຄອນເທນເນີດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp /local/ca.file server:/etc/pki/trust/anchors/\n"
msgstr "mgrctl cp /local/ca.file server:/etc/pki/trust/anchors/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:60
msgid ""
"After successfully running the [command]``mgradm migrate`` command, the "
"{salt} setup on all clients will still point to the old 4.3 server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm migrate`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {salt} ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຈະຍັງຄົງຊີ້ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ 4.3 ເກົ່າຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/suma/server-migration-suma.adoc:61
msgid ""
"To redirect them to the {productnumber} server, it is required to rename the "
"new server at the infrastructure level (DHCP and DNS) to use the same FQDN "
"and IP address as 4.3 server."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທິດທາງໄປຫາເຊີເວີ {productnumber}, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີໃໝ່ໃນລະດັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານ (DHCP ແລະ DNS) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ FQDN ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວກັນກັບເຊີເວີ 4.3."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrating  the {productname} server to a containerized environment"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄປສູ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To migrate a regular {productname} server to a container, a new machine is "
"required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍ້າຍເຊີເວີ {productname} ປົກກະຕິໄປສູ່ຄອນເທນເນີ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເຄື່ອງໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:3
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid "It is not possible to perform an in-place migration."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບຢູ່ກັບທີ່ (in-place migration) ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The migration procedure currently does not include any hostname renaming "
"functionality.  The fully qualified domain name (FQDN) on the new server "
"will remain identical to that on the old server.  Therefore, following "
"migration, it will be necessary to manually adjust the DNS records to point "
"to the new server."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນ ຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຍັງບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນການປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname). FQDN ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຈະຍັງຄົງຄືກັນກັບໃນເຊີເວີເກົ່າ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນ DNS (DNS records) ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຊີ້ໄປຫາເຊີເວີໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Initial preparation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "Stop the {productname} services on the old server:"
msgstr "ຢຸດການບໍລິການ {productname} ໃນເຊີເວີເກົ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid "Stop the PostgreSQL service:"
msgstr "ຢຸດການບໍລິການ PostgreSQL:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the SSH connection"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The SSH configuration and agent should be ready on the new host for a "
"passwordless connection to the oldserver."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ແລະ agent ຄວນຈະພ້ອມຢູ່ໃນໂຮສໃໝ່ ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີເກົ່າໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To establish a passwordless connection, the migration script relies on an "
"SSH agent running on the server.  If the SSH agent is not active yet, "
"initiate it by running `eval $(ssh-agent)`. Then, add the SSH key to the "
"running agent with `ssh-add /path/to/the/private/key`. You will be prompted "
"to enter the password for the private key during this process."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ສະຄຣິບການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະອາໄສ SSH agent ທີ່ຣັນຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ. ຫາກ SSH agent ຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການຣັນ `eval $(ssh-agent)`. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເພີ່ມກະແຈ SSH ເຂົ້າໃນ agent ດ້ວຍ `ssh-add /path/to/the/private/key`. ທ່ານຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ private key ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid "The migration script only uses the old server's FQDN in the SSH command."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີເກົ່າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This means that every other configuration required to connect needs to be "
"defined in the [systemfile]``~/.ssh/config`` file."
msgstr "ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ [systemfile]``~/.ssh/config``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare for Kubernetes"
msgstr "ກຽມພ້ອມສຳລັບ Kubernetes"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Before executing the migration with [command]``mgradm migrate`` command, it "
"is essential to predefine **Persistent Volumes**, especially considering "
"that the migration job initiates the container from scratch.  For more "
"information, see the installation section for comprehensive guidance on "
"preparing these volumes in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm migrate``, ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດ **Persistent Volumes** ໄວ້ກ່ອນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອພິຈາລະນາວ່າວຽກການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄອນເທນເນີໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນໃນການກຽມວໍລຸມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrating"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Execute the following command to install a new {productname} server, "
"replacing **<oldserversource.fqdn>** with the appropriate FQDN of the old "
"server:"
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃໝ່, ໂດຍແທນບ່ອນ **<oldserversource.fqdn>** ດ້ວຍ FQDN ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງເຊີເວີເກົ່າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm migrate podman <oldnserver.fqdn>\n"
msgstr "mgradm migrate podman <oldnserver.fqdn>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "or"
msgstr "ຫຼື"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm migrate kubernetes <oldnserver.fqdn>\n"
msgstr "mgradm migrate kubernetes <oldnserver.fqdn>\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-migration-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"After successfully running the [command]``mgradm migrate`` command, the "
"{salt} setup on all clients will still point to the old server.  To redirect "
"them to the new server, it is required to rename the new server at the "
"infrastructure level (DHCP and DNS) to use the same FQDN and IP address as "
"the old server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm migrate`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {salt} ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຈະຍັງຄົງຊີ້ໄປຫາເຊີເວີເກົ່າຢູ່. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທິດທາງໄປຫາເຊີເວີໃໝ່, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີໃໝ່ໃນລະດັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານ (DHCP ແລະ DNS) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ FQDN ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວກັນກັບເຊີເວີເກົ່າ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install containerized {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ (Proxy) {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Only {opensuse} Leap 15.3 and newer are supported to be used as container "
"host for {productname} Proxy containers."
msgstr "ສະເພາະ {opensuse} Leap 15.3 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນ container host ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy containers."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Only {sles} 15 SP5 or {sle-micro} {microversion} and newer are supported to "
"be used as container host for {productname} Proxy containers."
msgstr "ສະເພາະ {sles} 15 SP5 ຫຼື {sle-micro} {microversion} ແລະ ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ເປັນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ ສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີພຣັອກຊີຂອງ {productname}."

