#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To ensure that domain name of the {productname} Server can be resolved by "
"the clients:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຊອກຫາຊື່ໂດເມນ (domain name) ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Both container proxy and client machines must be connected to a DNS server"
msgstr "ທັງເຄື່ອງ container proxy ແລະ ເຄື່ອງ client ຈະຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ DNS server"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Reverse lookup must work"
msgstr "Reverse lookup ຈະຕ້ອງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install container services on the host system"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງການບໍລິການຄອນເທນເນີໃນລະບົບໂຮສ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Container host to be used as a base for {productname} Proxy containers needs "
"to be first registered as a client to the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີພຣັອກຊີຂອງ {productname} ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນເປັນລູກຂ່າຍກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ກ່ອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information about registering client to the {productname} Server, "
"see xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບເຊີເວີ {productname}, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid ""
"[literal]``Containers Module`` is required to be available for container "
"host on a {sles} machine."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ [literal]``Containers Module`` ສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສໃນເຄື່ອງ {sles}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy containers are using [literal]``podman`` and "
"[literal]``systemd`` to run and manage all proxy containers."
msgstr "{productname} Proxy containers ໃຊ້ [literal]``podman`` ແລະ [literal]``systemd`` ເພື່ອຣັນ (run) ແລະ ຈັດການ proxy containers ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid ""
"First step is to install the [literal]``mgrpxy`` utility provided by the "
"package of the same name."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດແມ່ນການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມື [literal]``mgrpxy`` ເຊິ່ງສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [literal]``mgrpxy`` package is available in the {productname} Proxy "
"product repositories."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The [literal]``mgrpxy`` package is available in the container utils "
"repository: pick the one matching the distribution in: "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບເຄື່ອງມືຄອນເທນເນີ: ໃຫ້ເລືອກອັນທີ່ກົງກັບລຸ້ນທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນ: https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "To install them run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ຣັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in helm mgrpxy\n"
msgstr "zypper in helm mgrpxy\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Installation of container utility tool [literal]``mgrpxy`` for "
"{productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມືຄອນເທນເນີ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Assign [literal]``Containers Module`` software channel to the container host "
"in the {productname}.  For more information about assigning software "
"channels to the system, see xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (software channel) [literal]``Containers Module`` ໃຫ້ກັບ container host ໃນ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid "Log in as `root` on the container host."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ `root` ເທິງ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid "Manually install [literal]``mgrpxy`` package:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install mgrpxy\n"
msgstr "zypper install mgrpxy\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Proxy containers"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີພຣັອກຊີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:28
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy containers require some volumes to be mounted for long "
"term storage.  Those volumes are automatically created by "
"[literal]``podman`` and can be listed using the [command]``podman volume "
"ls`` command.  By default, [literal]``podman`` stores the files of the "
"volumes in [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``.  The volumes are "
"named:"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy containers ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການເມົາທ໌ volumes ບາງສ່ວນສຳລັບການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄລຍະຍາວ. volumes ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ [literal]``podman`` ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``podman volume ls``. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [literal]``podman`` ຈະເກັບໄຟລ໌ຂອງ volumes ໄວ້ໃນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``. volumes ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີຊື່ວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid "[path]``uyuni-proxy-squid-cache``"
msgstr "[path]``uyuni-proxy-squid-cache``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:30
msgid "[path]``uyuni-proxy-rhn-cache``"
msgstr "[path]``uyuni-proxy-rhn-cache``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:31
msgid "[path]``uyuni-proxy-tftpboot``"
msgstr "[path]``uyuni-proxy-tftpboot``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:32
msgid ""
"To override default volume settings, create the volumes prior to the first "
"start of the pod using the [command]``podman volume create`` command."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ volume ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ volumes ກ່ອນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ pod ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``podman volume create``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:33
msgid ""
"By default, the [package]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-services`` package creates "
"these three directories that can be used to mount external disks:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແພັກເກັດ [package]``uyuni-proxy-systemd-services`` ຈະສ້າງສາມໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເມົາທ໌ດິດພາຍນອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/var/lib/uyuni/proxy-rhn-cache\n"
"/var/lib/uyuni/proxy-squid-cache\n"
"/var/lib/uyuni/proxy-tftpboot \n"
msgstr ""
"/var/lib/uyuni/proxy-rhn-cache\n"
"/var/lib/uyuni/proxy-squid-cache\n"
"/var/lib/uyuni/proxy-tftpboot \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:35
msgid "If [path]``/etc/fstab`` has these entries:"
msgstr "ຫາກ [path]``/etc/fstab`` ມີລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/dev/uyuni-proxy/rhn-cache    /var/lib/uyuni/proxy-rhn-cache    xfs "
"\tdefaults 0 0\n"
"/dev/uyuni-proxy/squid-cache  /var/lib/uyuni/proxy-squid-cache  xfs "
"\tdefaults 0 0\n"
"/dev/uyuni-proxy/tftpboot     /var/lib/uyuni/proxy-tftpboot     xfs "
"\tdefaults 0 0\n"
msgstr ""
"/dev/uyuni-proxy/rhn-cache    /var/lib/uyuni/proxy-rhn-cache    xfs \tdefaults 0 0\n"
"/dev/uyuni-proxy/squid-cache  /var/lib/uyuni/proxy-squid-cache  xfs \tdefaults 0 0\n"
"/dev/uyuni-proxy/tftpboot     /var/lib/uyuni/proxy-tftpboot     xfs \tdefaults 0 0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:37
msgid "Run these commands to create custom volumes:"
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງວໍລຸມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman volume create --driver local --opt "
"device=/dev/mapper/uyuni--proxy-rhn--cache --opt type=xfs "
"uyuni-proxy-rhn-cache\n"
"podman volume create --driver local --opt "
"device=/dev/mapper/uyuni--proxy-squid--cache --opt type=xfs "
"uyuni-proxy-squid-cache\n"
"podman volume create --driver local --opt "
"device=/dev/mapper/uyuni--proxy-tftpboot --opt type=xfs "
"uyuni-proxy-tftpboot\n"
msgstr ""
"podman volume create --driver local --opt device=/dev/mapper/uyuni--proxy-rhn--cache --opt type=xfs uyuni-proxy-rhn-cache\n"
"podman volume create --driver local --opt device=/dev/mapper/uyuni--proxy-squid--cache --opt type=xfs uyuni-proxy-squid-cache\n"
"podman volume create --driver local --opt device=/dev/mapper/uyuni--proxy-tftpboot --opt type=xfs uyuni-proxy-tftpboot\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To install the systemd service starting the {productname} proxy, run the "
"[command]``mgrpxy install podman /path/to/config.tar.gz`` command."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງການບໍລິການ systemd ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພຣັອກຊີຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgrpxy install podman /path/to/config.tar.gz``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:40
msgid ""
"It is possible to add custom arguments passed to podman container pod with "
"the one or more [literal]``--podman-arg`` parameters to the install command."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມອາກິວເມນ (arguments) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອສົ່ງໄປຫາ pod ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ podman ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``--podman-arg`` ໜຶ່ງຕົວ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນໃນຄຳສັ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:41
msgid ""
"It is possible to modify the tag to use for container images with the "
"[literal]``--tag=latest`` parameter to the install command."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂແທັກ (tag) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮູບພາບຄອນເທນເນີໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``--tag=latest`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Changing the containers images and version parameters is dangerous and can "
"cause a non-functional system."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງຮູບພາບຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ພາຣາມິເຕີເວີຊັນແມ່ນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ ແລະ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:43
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a custom container image for a service"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ custom container image ສຳລັບບໍລິການ"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Allow network access for provided services on container host firewall"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄືອຂ່າຍສຳລັບບໍລິການຕ່າງໆເທິງ container host firewall"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:52
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy containers work as so called node-port service.  This "
"means proxy container pod shares container host network TCP and UDP port "
"space.  For this reason container host firewall must be configured to accept "
"incoming traffic on ports used by {productname} Proxy containers.  Those "
"ports are:"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy containers ເຮັດວຽກໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ node-port service. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ proxy container pod ຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ພອດ TCP ແລະ UDP ຮ່ວມກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງ container host. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ໄຟວໍຂອງ container host ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດຄ່າເພື່ອຮັບການຈະລາຈອນຂາເຂົ້າໃນພອດທີ່ {productname} Proxy containers ໃຊ້. ພອດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:53
msgid "69/UDP - TFTP"
msgstr "69/UDP - TFTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:54
msgid "80/TCP - HTTP"
msgstr "80/TCP - HTTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:55
msgid "443/TCP - HTTPS"
msgstr "443/TCP - HTTPS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:56
msgid "4505/TCP - Salt"
msgstr "4505/TCP - Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:57
msgid "4506/TCP - Salt"
msgstr "4506/TCP - Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:58
msgid "8022/TCP - SSH"
msgstr "8022/TCP - SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Continue with setting up the installed {productname} Proxy as a containers "
"at "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃນຮູບແບບຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Containerized {productname} Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບ Container"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Once container host for {productname} Proxy containers is prepared, setup of "
"containers require few additional steps to finish configuration."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ container host ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy containers ຖືກກະກຽມແລ້ວ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ containers ຈະຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມອີກເລັກນ້ອຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid "Generate {productname} Proxy configuration archive file"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ (archive) ການກຳນົດຄ່າ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Transfer configuration archive to the container host prepared in "
"installation step and extract it"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າໄປຫາ container host ທີ່ກະກຽມໄວ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລ້ວແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid "Start the proxy sevices with [literal]``mgrpxy``"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ [literal]``mgrpxy``"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer {productname} Proxy configuration"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍການກຳນົດຄ່າ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Both [command]``spacecmd`` command and {webui} ways generate a configuration "
"archive.  This archive needs to be made available on container host."
msgstr "ທັງຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacecmd`` ແລະ ວິທີການຜ່ານ {webui} ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂຶ້ນມາ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດຕຽມໄວ້ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid "Transfer this generated archive to the container host."
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນນີ້ໄປຫາຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For installation instructions to use the archive to get the proxy "
"containers, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນການສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີພຣັອກຊີ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-installation-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start {productname} Proxy containers"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} Proxy containers"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Start {productname} Proxy containers"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} Proxy containers"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid "Check if all containers started up as expected by calling"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ containers ທັງໝົດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman ps\n"
msgstr "podman ps\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:134
msgid "Five {productname} Proxy containers should be present:"
msgstr "ຄວນຈະມີ 5 {productname} Proxy containers ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "And should be part of [literal]``proxy-pod`` container pod."
msgstr "ແລະ ຄວນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ [literal]``proxy-pod`` container pod."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy a {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ (Deploy) {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide outlines the deployment process for the {productname} "
"{productnumber} Proxy.  This guide presumes you have already successfully "
"deployed a {productname} {productnumber} Server.  To successfully deploy, "
"you will perform the following actions:"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍຂະບວນການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy. ຄູ່ມືນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດຜົນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checklist: Proxy Deployment"
msgstr "ລາຍການກວດສອບ (Checklist): ການຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Synchronize the {leapmicro} {microversion} parent channel and the Proxy "
"extension child channel on the server."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (parent channel) ຂອງ {leapmicro} {microversion} ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channel) ຂອງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ Proxy ໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "Install {leapmicro} {microversion} on a bare-metal machine."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {leapmicro} {microversion} ໃນເຄື່ອງຈິງ (bare-metal)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"During the installation, register {leapmicro} {microversion} along with the "
"{productname} {productnumber} Proxy extension."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນ {leapmicro} {microversion} ພ້ອມກັບສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
