#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sync the Parent and Proxy Extension Child channels"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ Parent ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Products are listed on the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard -> Products] page.  This "
"channel must be fully synchronized on the server, with the child channel "
"[systemitem]Proxy as an extension option selected."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard -> Products]. ຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຢ່າງສົມບູນໃນເຊີເວີ, ໂດຍເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ [systemitem]Proxy ເປັນທາງເລືອກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Sync the Proxy Parent Channel and Proxy Extension"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ Proxy Parent ແລະ ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid "From the products page enter {sle-micro} in the filter field."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ {sle-micro} ໃນຊ່ອງຕົວຕອງ (filter)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Next use the dropdown to select the required architecture. For this example "
"{x86_64}."
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມນູລົງ (dropdown) ເພື່ອເລືອກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນ {x86_64}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:27
