"In the [systemitem]``Product Description`` field select the {sle-micro} "
"{microversion} checkbox then use the dropdown to select the "
"[systemitem]``SUSE Manager Proxy Extension 5.0 x86_64`` extension."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [systemitem]``Product Description``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ checkbox ຂອງ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຈາກນັ້ນໃຊ້ເມນູລົງເພື່ອເລືອກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ [systemitem]``SUSE Manager Proxy Extension 5.0 x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:28
