msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [systemitem]``Extension and Module Selection``, ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ checkbox **Hide Development Versions**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:51
