msgstr "transactional-update pkg install mgrpxy mgrpxy-bash-completion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:71
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This step is optional.  However, if custom persistent storage is required "
"for your infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` tool."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:81
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/actkey-bootstrap-proxy-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Activation Key for the Proxy"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Activation Key ສຳລັບ Proxy"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Create an Activation Key"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ສ້າງ Activation Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:83
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Activation Keys] then click btn:[+ Create key]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Systems[Activation Keys] ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[+ Create key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:84
msgid ""
"Create an activation key for the proxy host with {sle-micro} {microversion} "
"as the parent channel. This key should include all recommended channels and "
"the Proxy as an extension child channel."
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ສຳລັບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ ໂດຍມີ {sle-micro} {microversion} ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ຄີນີ້ຄວນລວມເອົາທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ແນະນຳ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:85
msgid "Proceed to boostrapping the proxy host as a minion."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການບູດສະແຕຣບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສໃຫ້ເປັນ minion."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy Host as a Minion"
msgstr "ບູດສະແຕຣບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສໃຫ້ເປັນ Minion"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Bootstrap the Proxy Host"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ບູດສະແຕຣບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:88
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:3
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:89
msgid "Fill in the fields for your Proxy host."
msgstr "ກອກຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆສຳລັບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:90
msgid "Select the Activation key created in the previous step from the dropdown."
msgstr "ເລືອກ Activation key ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈາກເມນູລົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:91
msgid "Click btn:[+ Bootstrap]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[+ Bootstrap]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:92
msgid ""
"Wait for the Bootstrap process to complete successfully.  Check the "
"menu:Salt[] menu and confirm the {salt} minion key is listed and accepted."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂະບວນການ Bootstrap ສຳເລັດຜົນ. ກວດສອບເມນູ menu:Salt[] ແລະ ຢືນຢັນວ່າຄີຂອງ {salt} minion ຖືກສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:93
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:97
msgid "Reboot the Proxy host."
msgstr "ຣີບູດພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:94
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:System[] list and trigger a second reboot "
"after all events are finished to conclude the onboarding."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂຮສຈາກລາຍຊື່ menu:System[] ແລະ ທຳການຣີບູດຄັ້ງທີສອງຫຼັງຈາກທຸກເຫດການສຳເລັດ ເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການນຳລະບົບເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານ (onboarding)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Update the Proxy Host"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ອັບເດດພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:96
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:Systems[] list and apply all patches to update "
"it."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂຮສຈາກລາຍຊື່ menu:Systems[] ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດຊ໌ (patches) ທັງໝົດເພື່ອອັບເດດມັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:98
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:99
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The configuration archive of the {productname} Proxy is generated by the "
"{productname} Server.  Each additional Proxy requires its own configuration "
"archive."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ {productname} Proxy ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍເຊີເວີ {productname}. ແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່ ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໃຜມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:100
msgid ""
"The container host for the {productname} Proxy must be registered as a salt "
"minion to the {productname} Server prior to generating this Proxy "
"configuration."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນເປັນ salt minion ກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:101
msgid "You will perform the following tasks:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:102
msgid "Generate a Proxy configuration file."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:103
msgid "Transfer the configuration to the Proxy."
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:104
msgid "Start the Proxy with the [literal]``mgrpxy`` command."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Generating a Proxy Container Configuration using Web UI"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄອນເທນເນີພຣັອກຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ Web UI"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:106
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] and fill the "
"required data:"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:107
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນແບບເຕັມ (FQDN) ສຳລັບ proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:108
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the {productname} Server or another {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນແບບເຕັມ (FQDN) ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ຫຼື {productname} Proxy ໂຕອື່ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:109
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` field type SSH port on which SSH service "
"is listening on {productname} Proxy. Recommended is to keep default 8022."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນພອດ SSH ທີ່ບໍລິການ SSH ເປີດຮັບຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Proxy. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 8022."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:110
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` field type maximal allowed "
"size for Squid cache. Typically this should be at most 60% of available "
"storage for the containers."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບ Squid cache. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄວນມີຂະໜາດບໍ່ເກີນ 60% ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີສຳລັບ containers."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:111
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` selection list choose if new server "
"certificate should be generated for {productname} Proxy or an existing one "
"should be used.  You can consider generated certificates as {productname} "
"builtin (self signed) certificates."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະສ້າງ server certificate ໃໝ່ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຫຼື ຈະໃຊ້ certificate ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດຖືວ່າ certificate ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເປັນ certificate ພາຍໃນ (self signed) ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:112
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Depending on the choice then provide either path to signing CA certificate "
"to generate a new certificate or path to an existing certificate and its key "
"to be used as proxy certificate."
msgstr "ອີງຕາມຕົວເລືອກຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ signing CA certificate ເພື່ອສ້າງ certificate ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ certificate ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ key ຂອງມັນເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນ proxy certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:113
msgid ""
"The CA certificates generated on the server are stored in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/ssl-build`` directory."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເຊີເວີແມ່ນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/ssl-build``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:114
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information about existing or custom certificates and the concept "
"of corporate and intermediate certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ certificate ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື custom certificates ແລະ ແນວຄວາມຄິດກ່ຽວກັບ corporate ແລະ intermediate certificates, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Generate] to register new proxy FQDN in {productname} Server and "
"generate configuration archive with details for container host."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Generate] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ proxy FQDN ໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າພ້ອມລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:116
msgid ""
"After a few moments you are presented with file to download. Save this file "
"locally."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈັກພັກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫລດ. ກະລຸນາບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Target for macro image
