#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:119
msgid ""
"The {webui} generates a configuration archive.  This archive needs to be "
"made available on the Proxy container host."
msgstr "{webui} ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດຕຽມໄວ້ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສຂອງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Copy the Proxy configuration"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ກັອບປີ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:121
