msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:126
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:66
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:77
