#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom YAML Configuration and Deployment with [command]``mgradm``"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ YAML ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ [command]``mgradm``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You have the option to create a custom [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` file, which "
"the [command]``mgradm`` tool can utilize during deployment.  All "
"[command]``mgradm`` arguments have their YAML counterparts.  For example, "
"the [command]``mgradm`` argument ``--ssl-db-ca-intermediate`` can be "
"specified in the [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` file as follows:"
msgstr "ທ່ານມີທາງເລືອກໃນການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເຊິ່ງເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm`` ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທຸກອາກິວເມນຂອງ [command]``mgradm`` ຈະມີສ່ວນທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ YAML. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ອາກິວເມນ ``--ssl-db-ca-intermediate`` ຂອງ [command]``mgradm`` ສາມາດລະບຸໃນໄຟລ໌ [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssl:\n"
"  db:\n"
"    ca:\n"
"      intermediate: /path/to/ca-intermediate.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"ssl:\n"
"  db:\n"
"    ca:\n"
"      intermediate: /path/to/ca-intermediate.crt\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm`` will prompt for basic variables if they are not provided "
"using command line parameters or the [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` configuration "
"file."
msgstr "[command]``mgradm`` ຈະຖາມຫາຕົວປ່ຽນພື້ນຖານ ຫາກພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລະບຸຜ່ານພາຣາມິເຕີໃນຄອມມານລາຍ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [filename]``mgradm.yaml``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For security, **using command line parameters to specify passwords should be "
"avoided**: use a configuration file with proper permissions instead."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, **ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີໃນຄອມມານລາຍເພື່ອລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານ**: ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີການກຳນົດສິດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແທນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Deploying the {productname} container with Podman using a custom "
"configuration file"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} ດ້ວຍ Podman ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Prepare a configuration file named [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` similar to the "
"following example:"
msgstr "ກຽມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` ຄ້າຍຄືກັບຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block .
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Database password. Randomly generated by default\n"
"db:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretDBPass\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະຫັດຜ່ານຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຖືກສຸ່ມສ້າງຂຶ້ນ\n"
"db:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretDBPass\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Password for the CA certificate\n"
"ssl:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretSSLPassword\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະຫັດຜ່ານ ສຳລັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA\n"
"ssl:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretSSLPassword\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Your SUSE Customer Center credentials\n"
"scc: \n"
"  user: ccUsername\n"
"  password: ccPassword\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SUSE Customer Center ຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"scc: \n"
"  user: ccUsername\n"
"  password: ccPassword\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Organization name\n"
"organization: YourOrganization\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຊື່ອົງກອນ\n"
"organization: YourOrganization\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Email address sending the notifications\n"
"emailFrom: notifications@example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"# ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລສຳລັບສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ\n"
"emailFrom: notifications@example.com\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Administrators account details\n"
"admin:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretAdminPass\n"
"  login: LoginName\n"
"  firstName: Admin\n"
"  lastName: Admin\n"
"  email: email@example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລາຍລະອຽດບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ\n"
"admin:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretAdminPass\n"
"  login: LoginName\n"
"  firstName: Admin\n"
"  lastName: Admin\n"
"  email: email@example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"From the terminal, as root, run the following command.  Entering your "
"server's FQDN is optional."
msgstr "ຈາກເທີມິນໍ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ການປ້ອນ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີແມ່ນສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm -c mgradm.yaml install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgradm -c mgradm.yaml install podman <FQDN>\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You must deploy the container as sudo or root.  The following error will be "
"displayed on the terminal if you miss this step."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີໃນຖານະ sudo ຫຼື root. ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໃນເທີມິນໍ ຖ້າເຈົ້າຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:19
msgid "Open a browser and proceed to your server's FQDN or IP address."
msgstr "ເປີດບຣາວເຊີ ແລະ ໄປທີ່ FQDN ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In this section you learned how to deploy an {productname} {productnumber} "
"Server container using a custom YAML configuration."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} {productnumber} Server ໂດຍໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າ YAML ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of persistent storage volumes"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂອງວໍລຸມເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Modifications performed within containers are not retained.  Any alterations "
"made outside of persistent volumes will be discarded.  Below is a list of "
"persistent volumes for {productname} {productnumber}."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້. ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆທີ່ຢູ່ນອກວໍລຸມຖາວອນຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ຂອງວໍລຸມຖາວອນສຳລັບ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To customize the default volume locations, ensure you create the necessary "
"volumes before launching the pod for the first time, utilizing the "
"[command]``podman volume create`` command."
msgstr "ເພື່ອກຳນົດສະຖານທີ່ວໍລຸມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເອງ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງວໍລຸມທີ່ຈຳເປັນກ່ອນການເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ pod ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``podman volume create``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Ensure that this table aligns precisely with the volumes mapping outlined in "
"both the Helm chart and the systemctl services definitions."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບການກຳນົດວໍລຸມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນທັງ Helm chart ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າບໍລິການ systemctl."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The following volumes are stored under the **Podman** default storage "
"location on the server."
msgstr "ວໍລຸມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ **Podman** ໃນເຊີເວີ."

