#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting and Stopping Containers"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມ ແລະ ການຢຸດຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {productname} {productnumber} Server container can be restarted, "
"started, and stopped using the following commands:"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} {productnumber} Server ສາມາດຖືກຣີສະຕາດ, ເລີ່ມ, ແລະ ຢຸດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To [command]``restart`` the {productname} {productnumber} Server execute the "
"following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອ [command]``restart`` ເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber} ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mgradm restart\n"
"5:23PM INF Welcome to mgradm\n"
"5:23PM INF Executing command: restart\n"
msgstr ""
"# mgradm restart\n"
"5:23PM INF Welcome to mgradm\n"
"5:23PM INF Executing command: restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:5
msgid "To [command]``start`` the server execute the following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອ [command]``start`` ເຊີເວີ ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mgradm start\n"
"5:21PM INF Welcome to mgradm\n"
"5:21PM INF Executing command: start\n"
msgstr ""
"# mgradm start\n"
"5:21PM INF Welcome to mgradm\n"
"5:21PM INF Executing command: start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:7
msgid "To [command]``stop`` the server execute the following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອ [command]``stop`` ເຊີເວີ ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/start-and-stop-containers.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mgradm stop\n"
"5:21PM INF Welcome to mgradm\n"
"5:21PM INF Executing command: stop\n"
msgstr ""
"# mgradm stop\n"
"5:21PM INF Welcome to mgradm\n"
"5:21PM INF Executing command: stop\n"

#.  Coming soon:
#. You can also check on the status of services running in the container with:
#. ----
#. mgradm status
#. ----
#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understanding [command]``mgr-storage-server`` and "
"[command]``mgr-storage-proxy``"
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈກ່ຽວກັບ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` are "
"helper scripts provided with {productname} 5.0 and later."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ແມ່ນສະຄຣິບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ {productname} 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` are "
"helper scripts provided with {productname}."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ແມ່ນສະຄຣິບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:4
msgid "They are designed to configure storage for {productname} Server and Proxy."
msgstr "ພວກມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The scripts take disk devices as arguments.  [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` "
"requires a single argument for the storage disk device.  "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` requires a storage disk device and can "
"optionally accept a second argument for a dedicated database disk device.  "
"While both normal and database storage can reside on the same disk, it is "
"advisable to place the database on a dedicated, high-performance disk to "
"ensure better performance and easier management."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຮັບຄ່າອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ເປັນອາກິວເມັນ (arguments). [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຕ້ອງການອາກິວເມັນດຽວສຳລັບອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ຕ້ອງການອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ສາມາດຮັບອາກິວເມັນທີສອງສຳລັບອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍສະເພາະ. ເຖິງວ່າທັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຢູ່ເທິງດິສກ໌ດຽວກັນໄດ້, ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ແຍກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງໂດຍສະເພາະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ ແລະ ການຈັດການທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "What these tools do"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດຫຍັງແດ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Both [command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` "
"perform standard storage setup operations:"
msgstr "ທັງ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຈະປະຕິບັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:8
msgid "Validate the provided storage devices."
msgstr "ກວດສອບອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:9
msgid "Ensure that devices are empty and suitable for use."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອຸປະກອນນັ້ນວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມແກ່ການໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:10
msgid "Create XFS filesystems on the specified devices."
msgstr "ສ້າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:11
msgid "Mount the devices temporarily for data migration."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ (Mount) ອຸປະກອນໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:12
msgid "Move the relevant storage directories to the new devices."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Create entries in [path]``/etc/fstab`` so that the storage mounts "
"automatically on boot."
msgstr "ສ້າງລາຍການໃນ [path]``/etc/fstab`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ວໍລຸມຖືກເມົາທ໌ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເປີດເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:14
msgid "Remount the devices at their final locations."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ອຸປະກອນຄືນໃໝ່ໃນສະຖານທີ່ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional tool-specific behavior"
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳເພີ່ມເຕີມສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງມື"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `mgr-storage-server`\n"
"|\n"
"Optionally supports a separate device for database storage.\n"
"\n"
"Stops SUSE Manager services during migration, restarts them afterward.\n"
"\n"
"Moves Podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` "
"to the prepared storage, and optionally "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` to the prepared "
"database storage.\n"
"\n"
"| `mgr-storage-proxy`\n"
"|\n"
"Focuses only on proxy storage (no database storage support).\n"
"\n"
"Stops and restarts the proxy service during migration.\n"
"\n"
"Moves podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` "
"to the prepared storage.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| `mgr-storage-server`\n"
"|\n"
"ຮອງຮັບອຸປະກອນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"\n"
"ຢຸດບໍລິການ SUSE Manager ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ເລີ່ມການເຮັດງານໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ.\n"
"\n"
"ຍ້າຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີວໍລຸມຂອງ Podman [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຽມໄວ້, ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຽມໄວ້ໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"| `mgr-storage-proxy`\n"
"|\n"
"ເນັ້ນໃສ່ສະເພາະບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພຣັອກຊີ (ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ).\n"
"\n"
"ຢຸດ ແລະ ເລີ່ມບໍລິການພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"\n"
"ຍ້າຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີວໍລຸມຂອງ Podman [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຽມໄວ້.\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Both tools automate standard Linux storage operations.  There is no hidden "
"or custom logic beyond what a Linux administrator would do manually."
msgstr "ທັງສອງເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ບໍ່ມີເຫດຜົນທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ ຫຼື ແບບພິເສດນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ Linux ຈະເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "What these tools do *not* do"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ເຮັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:19
msgid "They do *not* create or manage LVM volumes."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ສ້າງ ຫຼື ຈັດການວໍລຸມ LVM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:20
msgid "They do *not* configure RAID or complex storage topologies."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ຕັ້ງຄ່າ RAID ຫຼື ໂຄງສ້າງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:21
msgid ""
"They do *not* prevent you from managing storage using normal Linux tools "
"after setup."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ຂັດຂວາງເຈົ້າຈາກການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື Linux ທົ່ວໄປຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:22
msgid ""
"They do *not* provide dynamic resizing or expansion capabilities — these "
"must be handled using standard Linux storage tools."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍແບບໄດນາມິກ — ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດການດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-installation storage management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັງການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Once storage has been configured, you can safely manage it using standard "
"Linux commands."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດການມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 1: Extending storage if using LVM"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 1: ການຂະຫຍາຍບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖ້າໃຊ້ LVM"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"
msgstr ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2: Migrating to a larger disk "
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 2: ການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງດິສກ໌ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:29
msgid "Add and format the new disk."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຟໍແມັດດິສກ໌ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:30
msgid "Mount it temporarily."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ມັນໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:31
msgid "Use `rsync` to copy data."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `rsync` ເພື່ອກ່າຍຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:32
msgid "Update `/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ `/etc/fstab`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:33
msgid "Remount at the correct location."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ຄືນໃໝ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use, or not use"
msgstr "ຄວນໃຊ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:35
msgid "Always take a backup before making changes to your storage setup."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສະເໝີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Use these tools *only* during initial storage setup or when migrating to new "
"storage where the tool is expected to handle data migration and update "
"`/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ *ສະເພາະ* ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ເມື່ອຍ້າຍໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງເຄື່ອງມືຈະຊ່ວຍຈັດການການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ອັບເດດ `/etc/fstab` ໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Do *not* rerun these scripts for resizing or expanding storage. Use standard "
"Linux tools (e.g., [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) for such "
"operations."
msgstr "*ຫ້າມ* ລັນສະຄຣິບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ້ຳເພື່ອການປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux (ເຊັ່ນ: [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "ບົດສະຫຼຸບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:39
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` help "
"automate the initial persistent storage setup for {productname} components "
"using standard Linux storage practices.  They do not limit or interfere with "
"standard storage management afterward."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳກັດ ຫຼື ແຊກແຊງການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:40
msgid "After setup, continue managing your storage using familiar Linux tools."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່ໄປໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Linux ທີ່ທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:41
msgid ""
"A full database volume can cause significant issues with system operation.  "
"As disk usage notifications have not yet been adapted for containerized "
"environments, users are encouraged to monitor the disk space used by Podman "
"volumes themselves, either through tools such as Grafana, Prometheus, or any "
"other preferred method.  Pay particular attention to the `var-pgsql` volume, "
"located under [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."
msgstr "ວໍລຸມຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຕັມສາມາດກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການໃຊ້ດິສກ໌ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບຄອນເທນເນີ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງຄວນຕິດຕາມພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍວໍລຸມຂອງ Podman ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ Grafana, Prometheus ຫຼື ວິທີອື່ນໆ. ໃຫ້ເອົາໃຈໃສ່ເປັນພິເສດຕໍ່ວໍລຸມ `var-pgsql` ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Upgrade"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before running the upgrade command, it is required to upgrade the "
"[literal]``mgrpxy`` tool first."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັນຄຳສັ່ງອັບເກຣດ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເກຣດເຄື່ອງມື [literal]``mgrpxy`` ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເກຣດພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:4
msgid "Refresh software repositories with [command]``zypper``:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ດ້ວຍ [command]``zypper``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:6
msgid "Apply available updates:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:7
msgid "For {sle-micro}:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {sle-micro}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:9
msgid "If updates were applied, [literal]``reboot``."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫາກມີການຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດ, ໃຫ້ [literal]``reboot``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:10
msgid "For {sles}:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {sles}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper up\n"
msgstr "zypper up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The {productname} {productnumber} Proxy containers running on "
"[literal]``podman`` can be updated using the following command:"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ [literal]``podman`` ສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy upgrade podman\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy upgrade podman\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:14
msgid "Or, those running on a Kubernetes cluster can update using:"
msgstr "ຫຼື, ຖ້າເຮັດວຽກເທິງຄລັສເຕີ Kubernetes ສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy upgrade kubernetes\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy upgrade kubernetes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:16
msgid "On podman, clean up the unused container images to free disk space:"
msgstr "ໃນ podman, ໃຫ້ລຶບອິເມຈຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman image prune -a\n"
msgstr "podman image prune -a\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On {kube} the image cleanup is handled automatically, or it depends on the "
"{kube} distribution."
msgstr "ໃນ {kube} ການລຶບອິເມຈຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຫຼື ຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະເວີຊັນຂອງ {kube}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If you do not specify the tag parameter when upgrading to specific version, "
"it will default to upgrading to the most recent version.  To upgrade to a "
"specific version, provide the tag parameter with the desired image tag."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸພາຣາມິເຕີ tag ເມື່ອອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນສະເພາະ, ລະບົບຈະອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸພາຣາມິເຕີ tag ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ tag ຂອງອິເມຈທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:20
msgid ""
"While there is an option to upgrade a specific container using its specific "
"tag, this feature is intended for applying PTFs only.  We highly recommend "
"using the same tag for all proxy containers to ensure consistency under "
"normal circumstances."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີຕົວເລືອກໃນການອັບເກຣດຄອນເທນເນີສະເພາະໂດຍໃຊ້ tag ຂອງມັນ, ແຕ່ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ PTFs ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ tag ດຽວກັນສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີພຣັອກຊີທັງໝົດເພື່ອຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງກັນໃນສະຖານະການປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For air-gapped installations, first upgrade the container RPM packages, then "
"run the [command]``mgrpxy upgrade podman`` command."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບແຍກອອກຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ (air-gapped), ໃຫ້ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ RPM ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgrpxy upgrade podman``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Upgrade"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before running the upgrade command, it is required to upgrade the "
"[literal]``mgradm`` tool first."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັນຄຳສັ່ງອັບເກຣດ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເກຣດເຄື່ອງມື [literal]``mgradm`` ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The {productname} Server container can be updated using the following "
"command:"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} Server ສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm upgrade podman\n"
msgstr "mgradm upgrade podman\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This command will bring the status of the container up-to-date and restart "
"the server."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະອັບເດດສະຖານະຂອງຄອນເທນເນີໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ຣີສະຕາດເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:15
msgid "Clean up the unused container images to free disk space:"
msgstr "ລຶບອິເມຈຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrading to specific version"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນສະເພາະ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:18
msgid ""
"If you do not specify the tag parameter, it will default to upgrading to the "
"most recent version. To upgrade to a specific version, provide the tag "
"parameter with the desired image tag."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸພາຣາມິເຕີ tag, ລະບົບຈະອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸພາຣາມິເຕີ tag ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ tag ຂອງອິເມຈທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information on the upgrade command and its parameters, use the "
"following command:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄຳສັ່ງອັບເກຣດ ແລະ ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm upgrade podman -h\n"
msgstr "mgradm upgrade podman -h\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For air-gapped installations, first upgrade the container RPM packages, then "
"run the [literal]``mgradm`` command."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບແຍກອອກຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ (air-gapped), ໃຫ້ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ RPM ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgradm``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/db-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade the Database"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

