#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "Before you begin installation, ensure that you have:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"A {scclongform} account.  This account gives you access to organization "
"credentials and registration keys for {productname} Server, Proxy and Retail "
"Branch Server."
msgstr "ບັນຊີ {scclongform}. ບັນຊີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ ແລະ ຄີການລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບ {productname} Server, Proxy ແລະ Retail Branch Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "Supported Browsers for {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SSL certificates for your environment.  By default {productname} "
"{productnumber} uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} {productnumber} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບ self-signed."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:6
msgid "The following section contains more information on these requirements."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "{scclongform} Account and Credentials"
msgstr "ບັນຊີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create an account with {scclongform} prior to deployment of {productname} "
"{productnumber}."
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີກັບ {scclongform} ກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtain Your Organization Credentials"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ວິທີຮັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:10
msgid "Navigate to https://scc.suse.com/login in your web browser."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/login ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:11
msgid "Log in to your {scc} account, or follow the prompts to create a new account."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you have not yet done so, click btn:[Connect to an Organization] and type "
"or search for your organization."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Connect to an Organization] ແລ້ວພິມ ຫຼື ຄົ້ນຫາອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Manage my Organizations] and select your organization from the "
"list by clicking the organization name."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Manage my Organizations] ແລະ ເລືອກອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານຈາກລາຍຊື່ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Users] tab, and then select the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] sub-tab."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ btn:[Users], ແລ້ວເລືອກແຖບຍ່ອຍ btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:15
msgid "Record your login information for use during {productname} setup."
msgstr "ຈົດບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Depending on your organization's setup, you might also need to activate your "
"subscription, using the btn:[Activate Subscriptions] menu from the left "
"navigation bar."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງອົງກອນທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ (subscription) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ btn:[Activate Subscriptions] ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:17
msgid "For more information about using {scc}, see https://scc.suse.com/docs/help."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {scc}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://scc.suse.com/docs/help."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Browsers for {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:19
msgid ""
"To use the {webui} to manage your {productname} environment, you must run an "
"up to date web browser."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ {webui} ໃນການຈັດການສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ບຣາວເຊີເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:20
msgid "{productname} is supported on:"
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບໃນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:21
msgid "Latest Firefox browser shipped with {sles}"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີ Firefox ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ {sles}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:22
msgid "Latest Chrome browser on all operating systems"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີ Chrome ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໃນທຸກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:23
msgid "Latest Edge browser shipped with Windows"
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີ Edge ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ Windows"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Windows Internet Explorer is not supported.  The {productname} {webui} will "
"not render correctly under Windows Internet Explorer."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Windows Internet Explorer. {productname} {webui} ຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫາກໃຊ້ຜ່ານ Windows Internet Explorer."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"{productname} uses SSL certificates to ensure that clients are registered to "
"the correct server.  By default, {productname} uses a self-signed "
"certificate.  If you have certificates signed by a third-party CA, you can "
"import them to your {productname} installation."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (self-signed). ຖ້າທ່ານມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ CA ພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳພວກມັນເຂົ້າມາໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more on self-signed certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For more on imported certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This table outlines hardware and software requirements for the {productname} "
"Server and Proxy, on {x86_64}, {arm}, {ppc64le} and {s390x} architecture."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ລະບຸຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ ແລະ ຊອບແວສຳລັບ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64}, {arm}, {ppc64le} ແລະ {s390x}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} installations based on {ppc64le} or {s390x} architecture "
"cannot use secure boot for network booting clients.  This limitation exists "
"because the shim bootloader is not available for both these architectures."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ທີ່ໃຊ້ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {ppc64le} ຫຼື {s390x} ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ secure boot ສຳລັບການບູດຄລາຍເອນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້. ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າ shim bootloader ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບທັງສອງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This table outlines hardware and software requirements for the {productname} "
"Server and Proxy on {x86_64}, and {arm} architecture."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ລະບຸຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ ແລະ ຊອບແວສຳລັບ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64} ແລະ {arm}."

#. ifeval::[{suma-content} == true]
#. For {ibmz} hardware requirements, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-ibmz.adoc[].
#. endif::[]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For {productname} {smr} hardware requirements, see "
"xref:retail:retail-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຮາດແວຂອງ {productname} {smr}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-requirements.adoc[]."

#.  In this table, replace ``version`` with the version of the product you are using.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"One of {sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-suma} is the operating "
"system of the container host.  In the following, {sles} as the installed "
"host operating system is explicitly mentioned only if it matters.  Otherwise "
"we either write {sle-micro} or just host operating system."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌ (container host) ແມ່ນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma}. ໃນເນື້ອຫາຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ຈະມີການລະບຸ {sles} ໃນຖານະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໂຮສ໌ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ຄຳວ່າ {sle-micro} ຫຼື ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໂຮສ໌ລ້າໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The container host with {sle-micro} as operating system requires as free "
"disk space:"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sle-micro} ຕ້ອງການພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:9
msgid "Minimum for base installation 100 GB"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບພື້ນຖານ 100 GB"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:10
msgid "Plus a minimum of 130 GB for repository data"
msgstr "ບວກເພີ່ມອີກຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 130 GB ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repository)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Depending on the amount of selected software, {sles} as operating system can "
"require considerably more disk space."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນຊອບແວທີ່ເລືອກ, {sles} ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ຫຼາຍກວ່າປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"By default the {productname} Server container stores mirrored repository "
"(packages or products), database, and other data in subdirectories of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`` directory.  Repository "
"synchronization fails if this directory runs out of disk space.  Estimate "
"how much space the [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`` directory "
"requires based on the number and kind of clients and repositories you plan "
"to mirror."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} Server ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ repository ທີ່ເຮັດ mirror ໄວ້, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍຂອງ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ repository ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຖ້າພື້ນທີ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ເຕັມ. ໃຫ້ປະເມີນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຳນວນ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງຄລາຍເອນ ລວມທັງ repository ທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະເຮັດ mirror."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about filesystem and partitioning details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[] "
"and the detailed installation instructions in the Installation and "
"Deployment sections of this guide."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partition), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[] ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງລະອຽດໃນພາກສ່ວນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງຄູ່ມືນີ້."

