#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The images by default have a 40 GB [literal]``/`` partition.  The cloud "
"image of {sle-micro} 5.5 has just a 5 GB [literal]``/`` partition. Both work "
"flawlessly with {productname}.  As long as external storage is mounted to "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``, {productname} does not need "
"or use storage on the [literal]``/`` partition, but leaves that to the "
"management of the container host itself."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ອິເມຈຈະມີພາທິຊັນ [literal]``/`` ຂະໜາດ 40 GB. ສ່ວນຄລາວອິເມຈຂອງ {sle-micro} 5.5 ຈະມີພຽງ 5 GB. ທັງສອງແບບສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ຢ່າງດີ. ຕາບໃດທີ່ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກເມົາທ໌ໄວ້ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``, {productname} ກໍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ໃນພາທິຊັນ [literal]``/`` ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ເປັນການຈັດການຂອງຕົວຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌ເອງ."

