#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} performance depends on hardware resources, network bandwidth, "
"latency between clients and server, etc."
msgstr "ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ {productname} ຂຶ້ນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຮາດແວ, ບຣິດວິດຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ (bandwidth), ຄວາມໜ່ວງ (latency) ລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Based on the experience and different deployments that are in use, the "
"advice for optimal performance of {productname} Server with an adequate "
"number of proxies is to not exceed 10,000 clients per single server.  It is "
"highly recommended to move to the Hub setup and involve consultancy when you "
"have more than 10,000 clients.  Even with fine-tuning and an adequate number "
"of proxies, such a large number of clients can lead to performance issues."
msgstr "ອີງຕາມປະສົບການ ແລະ ການວາງລະບົບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່, ຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດຂອງ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ພ້ອມກັບຈຳນວນພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແມ່ນບໍ່ຄວນເກີນ 10,000 ລູກຂ່າຍ ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງເຊີເວີ. ຂໍແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບ Hub ແລະ ປຶກສາຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານ ເມື່ອທ່ານມີ ລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າ 10,000 ເຄື່ອງ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີການປັບແຕ່ງລະບົບ ແລະ ມີຈຳນວນພຣັອກຊີທີ່ພຽງພໍ, ແຕ່ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຫຼາຍຂະໜາດນັ້ນ ກໍ່ອາດຈະນຳໄປສູ່ບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about managing a large number of clients, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການຄລາຍເອນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:21
msgid ""
"One of {sle-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {sles-version} {sp-version} is "
"the operating system of the container host."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌ແມ່ນ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {sles-version} {sp-version}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Minimum requirements are suitable for a quick test installation, such as a "
"Proxy with one client.  If you want to use a production environment start "
"with recommended values."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂັ້ນຕ່ຳແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອທົດສອບແບບໄວໆ, ເຊັ່ນພຣັອກຊີທີ່ມີຄລາຍເອນເຄື່ອງດຽວ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຈິງ (production), ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ."

