#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:25
msgid ""
"By default the {productname} Proxy container caches packages in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory.  If there is not enough space available, the proxy will remove "
"old, unused packages and replace them with newer packages."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} Proxy ຈະເກັບແຄັດ (cache) ຂອງແພັກເກດໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/``. ຫາກພື້ນທີ່ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ, ພຣັອກຊີຈະລຶບແພັກເກດເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ອອກ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍແພັກເກດໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:13
msgid "As a result of this behavior:"
msgstr "ຈາກພຶດຕິກຳນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The larger "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory is on the proxy, the less traffic will be between the proxy and "
"the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຍິ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` ໃນພຣັອກຊີໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າໃດ, ປະລິມານການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ {productname} Server ກໍຈະຍິ່ງໜ້ອຍລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:28
msgid ""
"By making the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory on the proxy the same size as "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` on the "
"{productname} Server, you avoid a large amount of traffic after the first "
"synchronization."
msgstr "ໂດຍການກຳນົດຂະໜາດໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` ໃນພຣັອກຊີໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` ໃນ {productname} Server, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຫຼີກລ່ຽງປະລິມານການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນມະຫາສານຫຼັງຈາກການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory can be small on the {productname} Server compared to the proxy.  "
"For a guide to size estimation, see the <<server-hardware-requirements>> "
"section."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` ໃນ {productname} Server ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າໃນພຣັອກຊີໄດ້. ສຳລັບວິທີການປະເມີນຂະໜາດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນພາກສ່ວນ <<server-hardware-requirements>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In general, {suse} recommends to adjust the value for the cache directory to "
"about 80 % of available free space.  The [option]``cache_dir`` value is set "
"when generating proxy configuration on the server.  You cannot set the "
"option directly in [path]``squid.conf``."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ {suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປັບຄ່າຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແຄັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ທີ່ປະມານ 80% ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄ່າ [option]``cache_dir`` ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເມື່ອມີການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີໃນເຊີເວີ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ [path]``squid.conf`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Requirement"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{postgresql} is the only supported database.  Using a remote {postgresql} "
"database or remote file systems (such as NFS) with the {postgresql} database "
"is not supported.  In other words, {postgresql} should be on the fastest "
"available storage device for {productname}."
msgstr "{postgresql} ແມ່ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນດຽວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ. ການໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແບບຣີໂມດ (remote) ຫຼື ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແບບຣີໂມດ (ເຊັ່ນ NFS) ຮ່ວມກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື, {postgresql} ຄວນຢູ່ໃນອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Because of potential performance issues, running a {postgresql} database "
"remotely from {productname} is discouraged.  While such an environment is "
"possible and even stable in many cases, there is always a risk of data loss "
"if something goes wrong."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແບບຣີໂມດຈາກ {productname}. ເຖິງວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດັ່ງກ່າວຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ແລະ ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນໃນຫຼາຍກໍລະນີ, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນຫາກມີສິ່ງຜິດປົກກະຕິເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:34
msgid "{suse} might not be able to provide assistance in such cases."
msgstr "{suse} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫ້ຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persistent Storage and Permissions"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດສິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:36
msgid "Persistent volumes are created by default when deploying the container."
msgstr "ວໍລຸມຖາວອນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:37
msgid ""
"However, it is recommended that the volumes are stored on one or more "
"separate storage devices.  Such a setup helps avoid data loss in production "
"environments.  This can be done after container deployment."
msgstr "ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບວໍລຸມໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອັນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຈິງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Storage devices best should be set up after first deploying the container.  "
"For more details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent "
"Container Volumes]."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent Container Volumes]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:39
msgid ""
"We recommend you use XFS as the filesystem type for all volumes.  The size "
"of the disk for repositories storage is dependent on the number of "
"distributions and channels you intend to manage with {productname}.  See the "
"tables in this section for guides to estimate the size required."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ XFS ເປັນປະເພດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບທຸກວໍລຸມ. ຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສຳລັບເກັບ repository ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນຂອງ distribution ແລະ channel ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ເພື່ອເປັນແນວທາງໃນການປະເມີນຂະໜາດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Do not use NFS for {cobbler} or {postgresql} storage, neither NFS on SELinux "
"environments.  These scenarios are not supported."
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ NFS ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {cobbler} ຫຼື {postgresql}, ລວມທັງຫ້າມໃຊ້ NFS ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ SELinux. ສະຖານະການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:41
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, use this command to find all available storage "
"devices:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:42
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"
msgstr "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:43
msgid "Use the [command]``lsblk`` command to see the name and size of each device."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``lsblk`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` command with the device names to set "
"up the external disks as the locations for the storage and, optionally on a "
"disk of its own, for the database:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ອຸປະກອນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ພາຍນອກໃຫ້ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ ສາມາດແຍກດິສກ໌ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:46
msgid ""
"The external storage volumes are set up as XFS partitions mounted at "
"[path]``/manager_storage`` and [path]``/pgsql_storage``."
msgstr "ໂວນລູມຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນພາທິຊັນ XFS ທີ່ເມົາທ໌ (mounted) ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/manager_storage`` ແລະ [path]``/pgsql_storage``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:47
msgid ""
"It is possible to use the same storage device for both channel data and the "
"database.  This is not recommended, as growing channel repositories might "
"fill up the storage, which poses a risk to database integrity.  Using "
"separate storage devices may also increase performance.  If you want to use "
"a single storage device, run [command]``mgr-storage-server`` with a single "
"device name parameter."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັນສຳລັບທັງຂໍ້ມູນ channel ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້. ແຕ່ບໍ່ແນະນຳ, ເພາະ repository ຂອງ channel ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນອັນຕະລາຍຕໍ່ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແຍກກັນຍັງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບອີກດ້ວຍ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນດຽວ, ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ໂດຍລະບຸພາຣາມິເຕີຊື່ອຸປະກອນພຽງອັນດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:48
msgid ""
"If you are installing a proxy, the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` command "
"takes only one device name parameter and will set up the external storage "
"location as the Squid cache."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຈະຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີຊື່ອຸປະກອນພຽງອັນດຽວ ແລະ ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກໃຫ້ເປັນ Squid cache."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logical Volume Management (LVM)"
msgstr "ການຈັດການວໍລຸມແບບໂລຈິກ (LVM)"

#.  container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-vm-suma.adoc etc.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:50
msgid ""
"For all kind of virtual machines (VM), LVM is generally not needed and not "
"recommended.  The disk setup is virtual and separate disks for volumes are "
"possible and recommended."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເວີຊວລແມຊີນ (VM) ທຸກປະເພດ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ LVM ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ເປັນແບບເວີຊວລ, ການແຍກດິສກ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວໍລຸມຈຶ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ແລະ ເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ແນະນຳ."

#.  container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:51
msgid "For other deployments, separate disks for volumes are also recommended."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອື່ນໆ, ກໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ແຍກດິສກ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວໍລຸມເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:52
msgid ""
"On the container host of the {productname} Server, the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` command moves the complete content of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` directory to a separate disk "
"and remounts it to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``.  "
"Optionally, if a second device name is specified, "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` moves the content of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` database directory "
"to a second separate disk and remounts it to "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql``."
msgstr "ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌ຂອງ {productname} Server, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ຈະຍ້າຍເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງດິສກ໌ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ ເມົາທ໌ມັນຄືນໃໝ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``. ຖ້າມີການລະບຸຊື່ອຸປະກອນທີສອງ, [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ຈະຍ້າຍເນື້ອຫາຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຖານຂໍ້ມູນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` ໄປຍັງດິສກ໌ແຍກອີກໜຶ່ງໜ່ວຍ ແລະ ເມົາທ໌ມັນຄືນໃໝ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Similarly, on the container host of the {productname} Proxy, the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` command moves the complete content of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` directory to a separate disk "
"and remounts it to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgstr "ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌ຂອງ {productname} Proxy, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຈະຍ້າຍເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງດິສກ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ ເມົາທ໌ມັນຄືນໃໝ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

#
#
#. // *** The following is commented, and can probably deleted ***
#. // When installation takes place on bare metal (on-premise), [command]``cockpit`` can be used to create an LVM setup.
#. // In such a case, the disk setup needs to be performed manually.
#. // With containers {productname} now has [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` as an extra disk.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Proxy with {opensuse} Leap"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ດ້ວຍ {opensuse} Leap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} Proxy can be installed on {opensuse} Leap {opensuse-version}."
msgstr "{productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນ {opensuse} Leap {opensuse-version}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {opensuse} Leap with Uyuni Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {opensuse} Leap ພ້ອມກັບ Uyuni ພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid "Install {opensuse} Leap and apply all package updates available."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {opensuse} Leap ແລະ ອັບເດດແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Configure a resolvable fully qualified domain name (FQDN) with "
"menu:yast[System > Network Settings > Hostname/DNS]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ໂດເມນ (FQDN) ທີ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ ດ້ວຍ menu:yast[System > Network Settings > Hostname/DNS]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "Add the repository with the {productname} Proxy software."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repository) ທີ່ມີຊອບແວ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid "As [systemitem]``root`` enter:"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root`` ແລ້ວປ້ອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Proxy-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"
"zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-proxy-stable\n"
msgstr ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Proxy-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"
"zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-proxy-stable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "Refresh metadata from the repositories."
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊ (Refresh) metadata ຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Install the pattern for the {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ pattern ສຳລັບ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_proxy\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "Reboot the {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot) {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about the stable version of {productname}, see "
"link:https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນທີ່ສະຖຽນຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ link:https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about the development version of {productname}, see "
"link:https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນພັດທະນາຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ link:https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When the installation is complete, you can continue with {productname} "
"setup.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy"

#.  **This file is needed to link generically to proxy installation**
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are various scenarios to deploy a {productname} Proxy.  All these "
"scenarios presume you have already successfully deployed a {productname} "
"{productnumber} Server."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy. ທຸກຮູບແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber} Server ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Deployment"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງເທິງ Public Cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Public clouds provide {productname} under a {byoslongform} ({byos}) or "
"{payglongform} ({payg}) models."
msgstr "Public clouds ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ {productname} ພາຍໃຕ້ຮູບແບບ {byoslongform} ({byos}) ຫຼື {payglongform} ({payg})."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about using {productname} in the public cloud, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[Public Cloud "
"Guide]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ public cloud, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[Public Cloud Guide]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni Server with openSUSE"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni Server ດ້ວຍ openSUSE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} Server can be installed on openSUSE."
msgstr "{productname} Server ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ເທິງ openSUSE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the latest version and updates of openSUSE Leap, "
"see https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ການອັບເດດຂອງ openSUSE Leap, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni on openSUSE Leap"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni ເທິງ openSUSE Leap"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing openSUSE Leap with Uyuni"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Leap ພ້ອມກັບ Uyuni"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"As the base system, install openSUSE Leap with all available service packs "
"and package updates applied."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Leap ທີ່ມີການອັບເດດ service packs ແລະ packages ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ ເພື່ອເປັນລະບົບພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "Set variables to use to create repository as [systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ repository ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"
msgstr ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Add the repository for installing the {productname} Server software as "
"[systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ repository ສຳລັບຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວ {productname} Server ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"
msgstr "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid "Refresh metadata from the repositories as [systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊ (Refresh) ຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຈາກ repositories ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "Install the pattern for the {productname} Server as [systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ pattern ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information about the stable version of {productname}, see "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ (stable version) ຂອງ {productname}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about the development version of {productname}, see "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນກຳລັງພັດທະນາ (development version) ຂອງ {productname}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid ""
"When the installation is complete, you can continue with {productname} "
"setup.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."

