#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "This section details the networking and port requirements for {productname}."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ພອດ (port) ສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"IP forwarding will be enabled by containerized installation.  This means "
"{productname} Server and Proxies will behave as a router.  This behavior is "
"done by podman directly.  Podman containers do not run if IP forwarding is "
"disabled."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບຄອນເທນເນີຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ IP forwarding. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບເຣົາເຕີ (router). ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ podman ໂດຍກົງ. ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງ Podman ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫາກ IP forwarding ຖືກປິດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Consider achieving network isolation of the {productname} environment "
"according to your policies."
msgstr "ຄວນພິຈາລະນາການເຮັດ network isolation ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຕາມນະໂຍບາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "For more information, see https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020166."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020166."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN)"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນແບບເຕັມ (Fully Qualified Domain Name - FQDN)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The {productname} server must resolve its FQDN correctly.  If the FQDN "
"cannot be resolved, it can cause serious problems in a number of different "
"components."
msgstr "{productname} server ຈະຕ້ອງສາມາດແປ (resolve) FQDN ຂອງມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດແປ FQDN ໄດ້, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງໃນຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring the hostname and DNS, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ hostname ແລະ DNS, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hostname and IP Address"
msgstr "Hostname ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To ensure that the {productname} domain name can be resolved by its clients, "
"both server and client machines must be connected to a working DNS server.  "
"You also need to ensure that reverse lookups are correctly configured."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ clients ສາມາດແປຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງ {productname} ໄດ້, ທັງເຄື່ອງ server ແລະ client ຈະຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ DNS server ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ reverse lookups ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up a DNS server, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-dns.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-dns.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reenable router advertisements"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ router advertisements ອີກຄັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When the {productname} is installed using [command]``mgradm install podman`` "
"or [command]``mgrpxy install podman``, it sets up Podman which enables IPv4 "
"and IPv6 forwarding.  This is needed for communication from the outside of "
"the container."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``mgradm install podman`` ຫຼື [command]``mgrpxy install podman``, ມັນຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ Podman ເຊິ່ງຈະເປີດໃຊ້ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 forwarding. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສື່ສານຈາກພາຍນອກຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"However, if your system previously had "
"[literal]``/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/eth0/accept_ra`` set to [literal]``1``, "
"it will stop using router advertisements.  As a result, the routes are no "
"longer obtained via router advertisements and the default IPv6 route is "
"missing."
msgstr "ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານເຄີຍຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/eth0/accept_ra`` ເປັນ [literal]``1`` ມາກ່ອນ, ມັນຈະຢຸດການໃຊ້ router advertisements. ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບເສັ້ນທາງ (routes) ຜ່ານ router advertisements ໄດ້ອີກ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ IPv6 ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຫາຍໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:15
msgid "To recover correct functioning of the IPv6 routing, follow the procedure:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງ IPv6 ກັບມາເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reenabling router advertisements"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ router advertisements ອີກຄັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create a file in [path]``/etc/sysctl.d``, for example "
"[literal]``99-ipv6-ras.conf``."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃນ [path]``/etc/sysctl.d``, ຕົວຢ່າງ [literal]``99-ipv6-ras.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:18
msgid "Add the following parameter and value to the file:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ ແລະ ຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ໃນໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "net.ipv6.conf.eth0.accept_ra = 2\n"
msgstr "net.ipv6.conf.eth0.accept_ra = 2\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:21
msgid "Network management is not working when you have no wicked."
msgstr "ການຈັດການເຄືອຂ່າຍຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ມີ wicked."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment behind HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃຕ້ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Some environments enforce internet access through a HTTP or HTTPS proxy.  "
"This could be a Squid server or similar.  To allow the {productname} Server "
"internet access in such configuration, you need to configure the following."
msgstr "ບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມມີການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດຜ່ານ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS proxy. ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນ Squid ເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} Server ເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າດັ່ງນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For operating system internet access, modify [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` "
"according to your needs:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"PROXY_ENABLED=\"no\"\n"
"HTTP_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"HTTPS_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"NO_PROXY=\"localhost, 127.0.0.1\"\n"
msgstr ""
"PROXY_ENABLED=\"no\"\n"
"HTTP_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"HTTPS_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"NO_PROXY=\"localhost, 127.0.0.1\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For ``Podman`` container internet access, modify "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/custom.conf`` according "
"to your needs.  For example, set:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ ``Podman``, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/custom.conf`` ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TZ=Europe/Berlin\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=\"\n"
"Environment=\"https_proxy=user:password@http://192.168.10.1:3128\"\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TZ=Asia/Vientiane\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=\"\n"
"Environment=\"https_proxy=user:password@http://192.168.10.1:3128\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For Java application internet access, modify [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"according to your needs.  On the container host, execute [literal]``mgrctl "
"term`` to open a command line inside the server container:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Java, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌, ໃຫ້ລັນ [literal]``mgrctl term`` ເພື່ອເປີດ command line ພາຍໃນເຊີເວີຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Modify [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` according to your needs.  For example, "
"set:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Use proxy FQDN, or FQDN:port\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_username =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_password =\n"
"# no_proxy is a comma seperated list\n"
"server.satellite.no_proxy =\n"
msgstr ""
"# ໃຊ້ proxy FQDN, ຫຼື FQDN:port\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_username =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_password =\n"
"# no_proxy ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ\n"
"server.satellite.no_proxy =\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:32
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to enforce the new configuration:"
msgstr "ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌, ໃຫ້ຣີສະຕາດເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Air-gapped Deployment"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບແຍກອອກຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ (Air-gapped)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If you are on an internal network and do not have access to {scclongform}, "
"you can use an "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc[Air-gapped "
"Deployment]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {scclongform} ໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-air-gapped-deployment-suma.adoc[Air-gapped Deployment]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In a production environment, the {productname} Server and clients should "
"always use a firewall.  For a comprehensive list of the required ports, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."
msgstr "ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຈິງ, {productname} Server ແລະ ຄລາຍເອນຄວນໃຊ້ໄຟວໍ (firewall) ສະເໝີ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ພອດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."

#. For more information on disconnected setup and port configuration, see xref:administration:disconnected-setup.adoc[].
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required Network Ports"
msgstr "ພອດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:38
msgid ""
"This section contains a comprehensive list of ports that are used for "
"various communications within {productname}."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍການພອດທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:39
msgid ""
"You will not need to open all of these ports.  Some ports only need to be "
"opened if you are using the service that requires them."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດ. ບາງພອດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດສະເພາະເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ບໍລິການທີ່ຕ້ອງການພອດນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "ports_diagram.png"
msgstr "ports_diagram.png"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "ports_proxy_diagram.png"
msgstr "ports_proxy_diagram.png"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຂອງ Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:46
msgid ""
"External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Server to protect the server from unauthorized access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Server ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ server ຈາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:48
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍນອກສຳລັບ {productname} Server"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By    | Notes\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP       | Required only if clients are "
"requesting IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP       | Required if server is used as a PXE "
"server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 80          | TCP      | HTTP       | Required temporarily for some "
"bootstrap repositories and automated installations.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS      | Serves the {webui}, client, and "
"server and proxy (``tftpsync``) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt       | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands "
"from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt       | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results "
"back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 5556        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Taskomatic JMX "
"metrics.\n"
"| 5557        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Tomcat JMX "
"metrics.\n"
"| 9100        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Node exporter "
"metrics.\n"
"| 9187        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping PostgreSQL "
"metrics.\n"
"| 9800        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Taskomatic "
"metrics.\n"
"| 25151       | TCP      | Cobbler    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 67 | TCP/UDP | DHCP | ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະຫາກຄລາຍເອນຕ້ອງການຂໍທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກເຊີເວີ.\n"
"| 69 | TCP/UDP | TFTP | ຈຳເປັນຫາກໃຊ້ເຊີເວີເປັນ PXE server ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຄລາຍເອນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 80 | TCP | HTTP | ຈຳເປັນຊົ່ວຄາວສຳລັບບາງ bootstrap repositories ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {webui}, ຄລາຍເອນ, ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການສື່ສານຈາກຄລາຍເອນ.\n"
"ຄລາຍເອນຈະເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັບຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ Salt master.\n"
"| 4506 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການສື່ສານຈາກຄລາຍເອນ.\n"
"ຄລາຍເອນຈະເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອລາຍງານຜົນກັບໄປຫາ Salt master.\n"
"| 5556 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (scraping) Taskomatic JMX metrics.\n"
"| 5557 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ Tomcat JMX metrics.\n"
"| 9100 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ Node exporter metrics.\n"
"| 9187 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL metrics.\n"
"| 9800 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ Taskomatic metrics.\n"
"| 25151 | TCP | Cobbler |\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຂອງ Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:51
msgid ""
"External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Server to restrict what the server can access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Server ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂອບເຂດສິ່ງທີ່ server ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Server to "
"communicate with external services."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} Server ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          | TCP | HTTP       | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
"Port 80 is not used to serve the {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP | HTTPS      | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
"| 25151       | TCP | Cobbler    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 80 | TCP | HTTP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scclongform}.\n"
"ພອດ 80 ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {webui}.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scclongform}.\n"
"| 25151 | TCP | Cobbler |\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດພາຍໃນຂອງ Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Internal ports are used internally by the {productname} Server.  Internal "
"ports are only accessible from [literal]``localhost``."
msgstr "ພອດພາຍໃນແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname} Server. ພອດພາຍໃນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຈາກ [literal]``localhost`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:57
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:75
msgid "In most cases, you will not need to adjust these ports."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Port Requirements for {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍໃນສຳລັບ {productname} Server"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Notes\n"
"| 2828        | Satellite-search API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat "
"and Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829        | Taskomatic API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005        | Tomcat shutdown port.\n"
"| 8009        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080        | Salt-API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat and "
"Taskomatic.\n"
"| 25151       | Cobbler's XMLRPC API\n"
"| 32000       | Port for a TCP connection to the Java Virtual Machine (JVM) "
"that runs Taskomatic and satellite-search.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 2828        | Satellite-search API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ RHN ໃນ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829        | Taskomatic API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ RHN ໃນ Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005        | ພອດສຳລັບປິດ Tomcat (Tomcat shutdown port).\n"
"| 8009        | Tomcat ໄປ Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080        | Tomcat ໄປ Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080        | Salt-API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ RHN ໃນ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic.\n"
"| 25151       | Cobbler's XMLRPC API\n"
"| 32000       | ພອດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຍັງ Java Virtual Machine (JVM) ທີ່ໃຊ້ Taskomatic ແລະ satellite-search.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Port 32768 and higher are used as ephemeral ports.  These are most often "
"used to receive TCP connections.  When a TCP connection request is received, "
"the sender will choose one of these ephemeral port numbers to match the "
"destination port."
msgstr "ພອດ 32768 ແລະ ສູງກວ່າ ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ ephemeral ports. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP. ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP, ຜູ້ສົ່ງຈະເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນເລກ ephemeral port ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບພອດປາຍທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:61
msgid "You can use this command to find out which ports are ephemeral ports:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າພອດໃດແດ່ທີ່ເປັນ ephemeral ports:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"
msgstr "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຂອງ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:64
msgid ""
"External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Proxy to protect the proxy from unauthorized access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Proxy ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ proxy ຈາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the "
"{productname} proxy."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} proxy ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:66
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍນອກສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 22          |          |         | Only required if the user wants to "
"manage the proxy host with {salt} SSH.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | Required only if clients are requesting "
"IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | Required if the server is used as a PXE "
"server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | {webui}, client, and server and proxy "
"(``tftpsync``) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands "
"from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results "
"back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 8022        |          |         | Required for ssh-push and "
"ssh-push-tunnel contact methods. Clients connected to the proxy initiate "
"check in on the server and hop through to clients.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 22 | | | ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການຈັດການພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ໌ດ້ວຍ {salt} SSH.\n"
"| 67 | TCP/UDP | DHCP | ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະຫາກຄລາຍເອນຕ້ອງການຂໍທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກເຊີເວີ.\n"
"| 69 | TCP/UDP | TFTP | ຈຳເປັນຫາກໃຊ້ເຊີເວີເປັນ PXE server ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຄລາຍເອນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {webui}, ຄລາຍເອນ, ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການສື່ສານຈາກຄລາຍເອນ.\n"
"ຄລາຍເອນຈະເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັບຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ Salt master.\n"
"| 4506 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການສື່ສານຈາກຄລາຍເອນ.\n"
"ຄລາຍເອນຈະເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອລາຍງານຜົນກັບໄປຫາ Salt master.\n"
"| 8022 | | | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ ssh-push ແລະ ssh-push-tunnel.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຂອງ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:69
msgid ""
"External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Proxy to restrict what the proxy can access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Proxy ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂອບເຂດສິ່ງທີ່ proxy ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Proxy to "
"communicate with external services."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} Proxy ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          |          |         | Used to reach the server.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | Salt    | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | Salt    | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 80 | | | ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scclongform}.\n"
"| 4505 | TCP | Salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 4506 | TCP | Salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Client Ports"
msgstr "ພອດພາຍນອກຂອງ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:74
msgid ""
"External client ports must be opened to configure a firewall between the "
"{productname} Server and its clients."
msgstr "ພອດພາຍນອກຂອງ client ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ clients ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Clients"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍນອກສຳລັບ {productname} Clients"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Direction | Protocol | Notes\n"
"| 22          | Inbound   | SSH      | Required for ssh-push and "
"ssh-push-tunnel contact methods.\n"
"| 80          | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 443         | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 4505        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 9090        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus user "
"interface.\n"
"| 9093        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus alert "
"manager.\n"
"| 9100        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus node "
"exporter.\n"
"| 9117        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus Apache "
"exporter.\n"
"| 9187        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus PostgreSQL.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ທິດທາງ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 22 | ຂາເຂົ້າ | SSH | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ ssh-push ແລະ ssh-push-tunnel.\n"
"| 80 | ຂາອອກ | | ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 443 | ຂາອອກ | | ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 4505 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 4506 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 9090 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus user interface.\n"
"| 9093 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus alert manager.\n"
"| 9100 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus node exporter.\n"
"| 9117 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus Apache exporter.\n"
"| 9187 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus PostgreSQL.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required URLs"
msgstr "URLs ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:79
msgid ""
"There are some URLs that {productname} must be able to access to register "
"clients and perform updates.  In most cases, allowing access to these URLs "
"is sufficient:"
msgstr "ມີບາງ URLs ທີ່ {productname} ຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ clients ແລະ ດຳເນີນການອັບເດດ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ URLs ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນພຽງພໍແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:80
msgid "[literal]``scc.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``scc.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:81
msgid "[literal]``updates.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``updates.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:82
msgid "[literal]``installer-updates.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``installer-updates.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:83
msgid "[literal]``registry.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``registry.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:84
msgid "[literal]``registry-storage.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``registry-storage.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:85
msgid "[literal]``opensuse.org``"
msgstr "[literal]``opensuse.org``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:86
msgid "Additionally, you may need access to these URLs for non-SUSE products:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ SUSE:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:87
msgid "[literal]``download.nvidia.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``download.nvidia.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:88
msgid "[literal]``public.dhe.ibm.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``public.dhe.ibm.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:89
msgid "[literal]``nu.novell.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``nu.novell.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:90
msgid ""
"You can find additional details on whitelisting the specified URLs and their "
"associated IP addresses in this article: "
"https://support.scc.suse.com/s/kb/SUSE-Customer-Center-and-SUSE-registry-URLs-for-access-behind-a-firewall-and-or-through-a-proxy[Accessing "
"{scclongform} and SUSE registry behind a firewall and/or through a proxy]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຮັດ whitelist URL ທີ່ລະບຸ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້ໃນບົດຄວາມນີ້: https://support.scc.suse.com/s/kb/SUSE-Customer-Center-and-SUSE-registry-URLs-for-access-behind-a-firewall-and-or-through-a-proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:91
msgid ""
"If you are using non-{suse} clients you might also need to allow access to "
"other servers that provide specific packages for those operating systems.  "
"For example, if you have {ubuntu} clients, you will need to be able to "
"access the {ubuntu} server."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ clients ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ server ອື່ນໆທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດສະເພາະສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ຖ້າທ່ານມີ {ubuntu} clients, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {ubuntu} server ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting firewall access for non-{suse} "
"clients, see xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟວໍສຳລັບ clients ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy - Minor Upgrade"
msgstr "Proxy - ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you perform any proxy update, schedule a maintenance window.  The "
"clients registered to {productname} through the proxy will not be able to "
"connect to {productname} while the update is in progress.  For more "
"information about maintenance windows, see "
"xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການອັບເດດ proxy ໃດໆ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດເວລາ maintenance window. clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຜ່ານ proxy ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ກຳລັງອັບເດດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ maintenance windows, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Minor proxy upgrades do not include a version upgrade of the operating "
"system.  For more information, see the {productname} {productnumber} release "
"notes."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ proxy ແບບຍ່ອຍຈະບໍ່ລວມເຖິງການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ release notes ຂອງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade the Proxy"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To update a proxy you first stop the proxy service, then update the software "
"and finally restart the proxy service."
msgstr "ໃນການອັບເດດ proxy, ກ່ອນອື່ນທ່ານຕ້ອງປິດບໍລິການ proxy, ຈາກນັ້ນອັບເດດຊອບແວ ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ proxy ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating the {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "On the {productname} Proxy, stop the proxy service:"
msgstr "ເທິງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ປິດບໍລິການ proxy:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy] and "
"click the name of the proxy."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Proxy] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Select all the packages to be updated on the proxy, and then apply the "
"selection."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະອັບເດດເທິງ proxy, ແລ້ວນຳໃຊ້ການເລືອກນັ້ນ."

#.  and channels (unless the system's base channel changes).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "On the {productname} Proxy, start the proxy service:"
msgstr "ເທິງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-proxy start\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-proxy start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-minor-uyuni.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you need to update many proxies, you can create an action chain of this "
"command sequence on the {productname} Server.  You can use the action chain "
"to perform updates on multiple proxies at the same time."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດຫຼາຍ proxies, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ action chain ຂອງລຳດັບຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເທິງ {productname} Server. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ action chain ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເດດຫຼາຍ proxies ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy"

#.  needs to be updated for container use
#.  For more information about installing proxies, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy systems are installed with the {unifiedinstaller} and "
"registered to {productname} using bootstrap script or {webui}."
msgstr "{productname} Proxy ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ {unifiedinstaller} ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ bootstrap script ຫຼື {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"After the client is succesfully bootstrapped, it needs to be configured as "
"{productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຄລາຍເອນຖືກ bootstrap ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This procedure describes software channel setup and registering the "
"installed proxy as the {productname} client, using an activation key."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ software channel ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນ proxy ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃຫ້ເປັນ {productname} client ໂດຍໃຊ້ activation key."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Create an activation key based on the "
"[systemitem]``SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Pool`` base channel."
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ base channel [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Pool``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ (activation keys), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Before you can select the correct child channels while creating the "
"activation key, ensure you have completely downloaded the {productname} "
"Proxy {productnumber} channel and all the recommended and mandatory "
"{sle} {sles-version} {sp-base} channels."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເລືອກ child channels ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນເວລາສ້າງ activation key, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ດາວໂຫລດຊ່ອງ {productname} Proxy {productnumber} ແລະ ຊ່ອງ {sle} {sles-version} {sp-base} ທັງໝົດທີ່ແນະນຳ ແລະ ຈຳເປັນສຳເລັດສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` listing select the recommended channels "
"by clicking the ``include recommended`` icon:"
msgstr "ຈາກລາຍການ [guimenu]``Child Channels`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ແນະນຳໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ ``include recommended``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:10
msgid "SLE-Module-Basesystem15-{sp-base}-Pool"
msgstr "SLE-Module-Basesystem15-{sp-base}-Pool"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:11
msgid "SLE-Module-Basesystem15-{sp-base}-Updates"
msgstr "SLE-Module-Basesystem15-{sp-base}-Updates"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:12
msgid "SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-{sp-base}-Pool"
msgstr "SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-{sp-base}-Pool"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:13
msgid "SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-{sp-base}-Updates"
msgstr "SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-{sp-base}-Updates"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:14
msgid "SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Pool"
msgstr "SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Pool"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:15
msgid "SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Updates"
msgstr "SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Updates"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Updates`` channel is "
"mandatory."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Updates`` ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:17
msgid "To bootstrap a proxy, use the bootstrap script."
msgstr "ໃນການ bootstrap proxy, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ bootstrap script."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrap scripts, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrap scripts, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Alternatively, in the {productname} {webui}, navigate to "
"menu:System[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:System[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], and check "
"that the four proxy channels ([systemitem]``Pool`` and "
"[systemitem]``Updates`` for [systemitem]``SLE-PRODUCT`` and "
"[systemitem]``SLE-MODULE``) plus the recommended channels are selected."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກທັງສີ່ proxy channels ([systemitem]``Pool`` ແລະ [systemitem]``Updates`` ສຳລັບ [systemitem]``SLE-PRODUCT`` ແລະ [systemitem]``SLE-MODULE``) ລວມທັງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ແນະນຳແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-registration.adoc:21
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``SLE-PRODUCT-Pool`` must be the base channel and the others are "
"child channels."
msgstr "[systemitem]``SLE-PRODUCT-Pool`` ຈະຕ້ອງເປັນ base channel ແລະ ຊ່ອງອື່ນໆເປັນ child channels."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy - Major Upgrade"
msgstr "Proxy - ການອັບເກຣດຫຼັກ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Major proxy upgrades include a version upgrade of the operating system.  For "
"more information, see the {productname} {productnumber} release notes."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ proxy ແບບຫຼັກຈະລວມເຖິງການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ release notes ຂອງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparation for the Upgrade"
msgstr "ການກະກຽມສຳລັບການອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Adding openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} Software Channels at the "
"Command Prompt"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} Software Channels ຜ່ານ Command Prompt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command to add the appropriate "
"channels:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels opensuse_leap15_5 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-155\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels opensuse_leap15_5 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-155\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid "Fully synchronize all channels with [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync``."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ສົມບູນດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To upgrade a proxy you first stop the proxy service, then you replace the "
"software repositories and update the software, and finally you restart the "
"proxy service."
msgstr "ໃນການອັບເກຣດ proxy, ກ່ອນອື່ນທ່ານຕ້ອງປິດບໍລິການ proxy, ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນແທນ software repositories ແລະ ອັບເດດຊອບແວ, ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການ proxy ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Click menu:Software[Software Channels], and as the base channel select the "
"openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} channel that is listed in the "
"[systemitem]``Customs Channels`` list."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ menu:Software[Software Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງ openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ [systemitem]``Customs Channels`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ base channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` pane, select the {opensuse-version} child "
"channels."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Child Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ {opensuse-version} child channels."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], and [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` with "
"btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Next], ແລະ ຢືນຢັນການປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍ btn:[Confirm] ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change``."

#. At least not for the migration from 15.2 to 15.3.
#. . Click menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade], and select all the packages to be updated on the proxy, and then apply the selection.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click menu:Details[Remote Command], add `zypper --non-interactive dup "
"--allow-vendor-change --replacefiles` to the script field, and click "
"btn:[Schedule]"
msgstr "ຄລິກ menu:Details[Remote Command], ປ້ອນ `zypper --non-interactive dup --allow-vendor-change --replacefiles` ລົງໃນຊ່ອງສະຄຣິບ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "Wait until the remote command is executed."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຄຳສັ່ງຣີໂມດຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດສຳລັບຄລາວສາທາລະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section provides the requirements for installing {productname} on "
"public cloud infrastructure.  We have tested these instructions on Amazon "
"EC2, Google Compute Engine, and Microsoft Azure, but they should work on "
"other providers as well, with some variation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຄລາວສາທາລະນະ. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທົດສອບຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, ແລະ Microsoft Azure, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍຄວນຈະໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອື່ນໆຄືກັນ ໂດຍອາດມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, here are some considerations:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {productname} setup procedure performs a forward-confirmed reverse DNS "
"lookup.  This must succeed in order for the setup procedure to complete and "
"for {productname} to operate as expected.  It is important to perform "
"hostname and IP configuration before you set up {productname}."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຈະມີການກວດສອບ forward-confirmed reverse DNS lookup. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງສຳເລັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດສົມບູນ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ hostname ແລະ IP ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{productname} Server and Proxy instances need to run in a network "
"configuration that provides you control over DNS entries, but cannot be "
"accessed from the internet at large."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຂໍ້ມູນ DNS ໄດ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຄວນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Within this network configuration DNS resolution must be provided: `hostname "
"-f` must return the fully qualified domain name (FQDN)."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດການແປຊື່ DNS: `hostname -f` ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນເປັນຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ສົມບູນ (FQDN)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "DNS resolution is also important for connecting clients."
msgstr "ການແປຊື່ DNS ກໍມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄຄແອນ (client) ຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"DNS is dependent on the cloud framework you choose.  Refer to the cloud "
"provider documentation for detailed instructions."
msgstr "DNS ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄລາວເຟຣມເວີກ (cloud framework) ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງຈາກເອກະສານຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳທີ່ລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"We recommend that you locate software repositories, the server database, and "
"the proxy squid cache on an external virtual disk.  This prevents data loss "
"if the instance is unexpectedly terminated.  This section includes "
"instructions for setting up an external virtual disk."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານເກັບຄັງຊອບແວ (repositories), ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເຊີເວີ, ແລະ proxy squid cache ໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນ (virtual disk) ພາຍນອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ມູນສູນຫາຍຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກປິດການເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ລວມມີຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When you use {productname} on a public cloud, you must use a restricted "
"network.  We recommend using a VPC private subnet with an appropriate "
"firewall setting.  Only machines in your specified IP ranges must be able to "
"access the instance."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ {productname} ເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ VPC private subnet ພ້ອມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ firewall ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ຄວນມີພຽງແຕ່ເຄື່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Running {productname} on the public cloud means implementing robust security "
"measures. It is essential to limit, filter, monitor, and audit access to the "
"instance.  {SUSE} strongly advises against a globally accessible "
"{productname} instance that lacks adequate perimeter security."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະໝາຍເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້ມາດຕະການຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ. ມັນຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຈຳກັດ, ກັ່ນຕອງ, ຕິດຕາມ, ແລະ ກວດສອບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. {SUSE} ແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດຂາດວ່າບໍ່ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກທົ່ວໂລກໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີລະບົບຄວາມປອດໄພຮອບນອກທີ່ພຽງພໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To access the {productname} {webui}, allow HTTPS when configuring the "
"network access controls.  This allows you to access the {productname} "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດ HTTPS ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In EC2 and Azure, create a new security group, and add inbound and outbound "
"rules for HTTPS.  In GCE, check the ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` box under the "
"``Firewall`` section."
msgstr "ໃນ EC2 ແລະ Azure, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ security group ໃໝ່, ແລະ ເພີ່ມກົດ inbound ແລະ outbound ສຳລັບ HTTPS. ໃນ GCE, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງ ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ ``Firewall``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Storage Volumes"
msgstr "ກຽມບໍລິມາດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (Storage Volumes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"We recommend that the repositories and the database for {productname} are "
"stored on separate storage devices from the root volume.  This will help to "
"avoid data loss and possibly increase performance."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບຄັງຊອບແວ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ {productname} ໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ root volume. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The {productname} container utilizes default storage locations. These "
"locations should be configured prior to deployment for custom storage.  For "
"more information see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent "
"container volumes]"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງ {productname} ໃຊ້ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສະຖານທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າກ່ອນການນຳໃຊ້ ຫາກຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent container volumes]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:18
msgid "Do not use logical volume management (LVM) for public cloud installations."
msgstr "ຢ່າໃຊ້ການຈັດການບໍລິມາດແບບລໍຈິກ (LVM) ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The size of the disk for repositories storage is dependent on the number of "
"distributions and channels you intend to manage with {productname}.  When "
"you attach the virtual disks, they will appear in your instance as Unix "
"device nodes.  The names of the device nodes will vary depending on your "
"provider, and the instance type selected."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສຳລັບເກັບຄັງຊອບແວແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນ distro ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ {productname}. ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນ, ພວກມັນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງທ່ານເປັນ Unix device nodes. ຊື່ຂອງ device nodes ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Ensure the root volume of the {productname} Server is 100{nbsp}GB or "
"larger.  Add an additional storage disk of 500{nbsp}GB or more, and choose "
"SSD storage if you can.  The cloud images for {productname} Server use a "
"script to assign this separate volume when your instance is launched."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ root volume ຂອງ {productname} Server ມີຂະໜາດ 100{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ. ເພີ່ມດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ 500{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ແລະ ເລືອກ SSD ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້. Cloud images ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ຈະໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອມອບໝາຍວໍລຸມທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກນີ້ເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:21
msgid ""
"When you launch your instance, you can log in to the {productname} Server "
"and use this command to find all available storage devices:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} Server ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you are not sure which device to choose, use the [command]``lsblk`` "
"command to see the name and size of each device.  Choose the name that "
"matches with the size of the virtual disk you are looking for."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະເລືອກອຸປະກອນໃດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``lsblk`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ. ເລືອກຊື່ທີ່ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can set up the external disk with the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` "
"command.  This creates an XFS partition mounted at ``/manager_storage`` and "
"uses it as the location for the database and repositories:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ພາຍນອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງພາດທິຊັນ (Partition) ແບບ XFS ທີ່ເມົາທ໌ (Mount) ໄວ້ຢູ່ ``/manager_storage`` ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເປັນສະຖານທີ່ສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄັງຊອບແວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/mgr-storage-server <devicename>\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/mgr-storage-server <devicename>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up storage volumes and partitions, "
"including recommended minimum sizes, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າວໍລຸມເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ພາທິຊັນ, ລວມທັງຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ແນະນຳ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade the Server"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses a rolling release versioning schema.  Check the release "
"notes for information about which upgrade strategy to use to upgrade to the "
"next version:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເວີຊັນແບບ rolling release. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ release notes ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບກົນລະຍຸດການອັບເກຣດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນຖັດໄປ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minor Upgrades"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍ (Minor Upgrades)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can consider minor upgrades as regular upgrades.  For more information, "
"see xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຖືວ່າການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍແມ່ນການອັບເກຣດປົກກະຕິ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Major Upgrades"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ (Major Upgrades)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can consider major upgrades as special upgrades.  In this case "
"components such as the base operating system, Salt, or the PostgreSQL "
"database will be upgraded.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຖືວ່າການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນການອັບເກຣດແບບພິເສດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ ອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຫຼັກ, Salt, ຫຼື ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ຈະຖືກອັບເກຣດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Major Upgrade"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When {productname} core components are upgraded to new major versions, you "
"need to perform a major upgrade on the {productname} Server.  This is the "
"case if a version upgrade of PostgreSQL, Salt, or openSUSE Leap is needed.  "
"openSUSE Leap is the underlying base operating system (OS)."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອົງປະກອບຫຼັກຂອງ {productname} ຖືກອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນໃຫຍ່ໃໝ່, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server. ນີ້ແມ່ນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງມີການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຂອງ PostgreSQL, Salt, ຫຼື openSUSE Leap. ໂດຍທີ່ openSUSE Leap ແມ່ນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານ (OS)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Some additional manual steps might be required, and this information is only "
"available in the release notes.  For important extra information about your "
"upgrade, see the release notes at:"
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີບາງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ໃນ release notes ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ສຳຄັນກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ release notes ໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid "https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."
msgstr "https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You will not be able to fix issues that arise during the migration.  Ensure "
"you have created a backup before you start the migration.  For more "
"information about backing up {productname}, see "
"xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[].  If you are running {productname} "
"Server on a virtual machine, we recommend that you create a snapshot before "
"you start."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (Migration) ໄດ້. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (Backup) ໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[]. ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ {productname} Server ໃນເຄື່ອງສະເືອນ (Virtual Machine), ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງ snapshot ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Before the upgrade, ensure that storage requirements are met.  For more "
"information, see xref:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[].  The migration "
"procedure can fill the root partition if there is not enough space available "
"due to the service pack migration and the download of new software "
"packages.  It is the same for the [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` when upgrading "
"PostgreSQL.  It takes a copy of the old database, thus be sure to have at "
"least enough space available to cope with a copy of the database."
msgstr "ກ່ອນການອັບເກຣດ, ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ມາດຕະຖານດ້ານພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]. ຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ root partition ເຕັມໄດ້ ຫາກມີພື້ນທີ່ບໍ່ພຽງພໍເນື່ອງຈາກການຍ້າຍ service pack ແລະ ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດຊອບແວໃໝ່. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ເມື່ອອັບເກຣດ PostgreSQL. ມັນຈະມີການສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີພື້ນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບການສຳເນົາຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [command]``server-migrator.sh`` script migrates {productname} Server to "
"the latest version.  It also upgrades the underlying operating system to "
"version {opensuse-version}.  The script is part of the "
"[package]``susemanager`` package."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ [command]``server-migrator.sh`` ຈະຍ້າຍ {productname} Server ໄປເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ມັນຍັງອັບເກຣດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ເປັນເວີຊັນ {opensuse-version}. ສະຄຣິບນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັກເກດ [package]``susemanager``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before running the [command]``server-migrator.sh`` script, check whether the "
"most recent version of the [package]``susemanager`` package is installed:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ [command]``server-migrator.sh``, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າແພັກເກດ [package]``susemanager`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper up susemanager\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper up susemanager\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Run the [command]``/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/server-migrator.sh`` script to "
"upgrade the base OS and {productname} Server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ [command]``/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/server-migrator.sh`` ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ OS ພື້ນຖານ ແລະ {productname} Server."

#. //   At the moment 2023.09, not needed
#. . To migrate the database to the latest database version run the migrate script:
#. +
#. ----
#. /usr/lib/susemanager/bin/pg-migrate-x-to-y.sh
#. ----
#. +
#. For more information about PostgreSQL database migration, see xref:db-migration-xy.adoc[].
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "After the migration is complete, manually reboot the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ທຳການ reboot ເຄື່ອງ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Minor Upgrade"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Several times a year, the {productname} team releases minor upgrades of the "
"{productname} Server.  These updates address bug fixes and feature "
"improvements, and sometimes include new features."
msgstr "ໃນແຕ່ລະປີ, ທີມງານ {productname} ຈະປ່ອຍເວີຊັນອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍຂອງ {productname} Server ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ. ການອັບເດດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະແກ້ໄຂບັກ ແລະ ປັບປຸງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ, ແລະ ບາງຄັ້ງກໍລວມມີຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Some additional manual steps might be required, and this information is only "
"available in the release notes.  For more information about such a major "
"upgrade, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີບາງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ສະເພາະໃນບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ດັ່ງກ່າວ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For information about your upgrade, see the release notes at "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດຂອງທ່ານ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Performing a minor upgrade is similar to installing operating system package "
"updates."
msgstr "ການເຮັດການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັບເດດແພັກເກດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating Packages on the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດໃນ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"By default, several update repositories are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄັງຊອບແວອັບເດດຫຼາຍແຫ່ງໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {productname} Server. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"It is recommended you make a backup of the server before upgrading.  For "
"more information about backing up {productname}, see "
"xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[]."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເຊີເວີກ່ອນການອັບເກຣດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:backup-restore.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, stop the "
"spacewalk services:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຢຸດການບໍລິການ spacewalk:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Refresh software repositories:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊ (Refresh) ຄັງຊອບແວ:"

#.  Zypper list-patches or patch doesn't update Uyuni
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid "Update new packages: (Repeat this if prompted by zypper)"
msgstr "ອັບເດດແພັກເກດໃໝ່: (ເຮັດຊ້ຳຫາກ zypper ແຈ້ງເຕືອນ)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Uyuni is different from SUSE Manager in this step.  SUSE Manager uses "
"[command]``zypper patch``, but Uyuni requires [command]``zypper up``."
msgstr "Uyuni ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ SUSE Manager ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້. SUSE Manager ໃຊ້ [command]``zypper patch``, ແຕ່ Uyuni ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [command]``zypper up``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If zypper reports that the Uyuni package will not be upgraded, run the "
"command manually:"
msgstr "ຫາກ zypper ແຈ້ງວ່າແພັກເກດ Uyuni ຈະບໍ່ຖືກອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install Uyuni-Server-release\n"
msgstr "zypper install Uyuni-Server-release\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "Restart the spacewalk services:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ spacewalk ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-service start\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-service start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Reboot the server if a patch update recommends rebooting."
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot) ເຊີເວີ ຫາກການອັບເດດ patch ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຣີບູດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid ""
"By default, zypper refreshes the repository every ten minutes (see "
"``repo.refresh.delay`` in [path]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf``).  If "
"``autorefresh`` is disabled, run [command]``zypper ref`` to refresh all "
"repositories."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, zypper ຈະຣີເຟຣຊຄັງຊອບແວທຸກໆສິບນາທີ (ເບິ່ງ ``repo.refresh.delay`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf``). ຫາກ ``autorefresh`` ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [command]``zypper ref`` ເພື່ອຣີເຟຣຊຄັງຊອບແວທັງໝົດ."

#.  We can remove  the version info when 4.1 / 2020.07 is released
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Starting with {productname} 4.1, [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` is "
"not needed anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname} 4.1 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` ອີກແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Starting with {productname} 2020.04 [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` is "
"not needed anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname} 2020.04 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` ອີກແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The schema upgrade is run automatically when the spacewalk service is "
"started with [command]``spacewalk-service start``."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ schema ຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອການບໍລິການ spacewalk ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [command]``spacewalk-service start``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Services affected by a package update are not automatically restarted after "
"an update.  You need to restart these services manually to avoid potential "
"failures.  Use [command]``zypper ps`` to check for applications that are "
"using old code and require restarting."
msgstr "ການບໍລິການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ໃຊ້ [command]``zypper ps`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຍັງໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດເກົ່າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section describes the initial steps you need to take after installation "
"to make your {productname} environment ready to use."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "The following tables specify the minimum server and proxy requirements."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕໍ່າສຳລັບເຊີເວີ ແລະ proxy."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Do not use NFS for storage because it does not support SELinux file "
"labeling."
msgstr "ຢ່າໃຊ້ NFS ສຳລັບການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ເພາະວ່າມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຕິດສະຫຼາກໄຟລ໌ (File labeling) ຂອງ SELinux."

