#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy caches packages in the [path]``/var/cache/`` directory.  "
"If there is not enough space available in [path]``/var/cache/``, the proxy "
"will remove old, unused packages and replace them with newer packages."
msgstr "{productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ຈະແຄຊ (cache) ແພັກເກດໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/``. ຫາກມີພື້ນທີ່ບໍ່ພຽງພໍໃນ [path]``/var/cache/``, ພຣັອກຊີຈະລຶບແພັກເກດເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ອອກ ແລ້ວແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍແພັກເກດໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The larger [path]``/var/cache/`` directory is on the proxy, the less traffic "
"there will be between it and the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຍິ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/`` ໃນພຣັອກຊີມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າໃດ, ປະລິມານການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (traffic) ລະຫວ່າງມັນກັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງໜ້ອຍລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"By making the [path]``/var/cache/`` directory on the proxy the same size as "
"[path]``/var/spacewalk/`` on the {productname} Server, you avoid a large "
"amount of traffic after the first synchronization."
msgstr "ໂດຍການກຳນົດໃຫ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/`` ໃນພຣັອກຊີ ມີຂະໜາດດຽວກັນກັບ [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` ໃນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຫຼີກເວັ້ນ traffic ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານຫຼັງຈາກການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The [path]``/var/cache/`` directory can be small on the {productname} Server "
"compared to the proxy."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/`` ໃນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າໃນພຣັອກຊີໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For a guide to size estimation, see the <<server-hardware-requirements>> "
"section."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄູ່ມືການປະເມີນຂະໜາດ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ <<server-hardware-requirements>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:2
msgid "Proxy systems are registered as clients using bootstrap script or {webui}."
msgstr "ລະບົບ Proxy ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນໄຄເອັນ (Client) ໂດຍໃຊ້ bootstrap script ຫຼື {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, create openSUSE Leap and the {productname} "
"Proxy channels with the [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ openSUSE Leap ແລະ {productname} Proxy ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` is part of the "
"[package]``spacewalk-utils`` package:"
msgstr "[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັກເກດ [package]``spacewalk-utils``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-155\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_5-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-155\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Instead of [systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-155`` you can also try "
"[systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-devel-leap`` which is the current development "
"version."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ [systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-155`` ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດລອງໃຊ້ [systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-devel-leap`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ກຳລັງພັດທະນາໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you can select the correct child channels while creating the "
"activation key, ensure you have properly synchronized the {opensuse} Leap "
"channel with all the needed child channels and the {productname} Proxy "
"channel."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເລືອກ child channels ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ activation key, ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ {opensuse} Leap ພ້ອມກັບ child channels ທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງ {productname} Proxy ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Create an activation key with {opensuse} Leap as a base channel and the "
"other channels as child channels.  For more information about activation "
"keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ໂດຍມີ {opensuse} Leap ເປັນ base channel ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໆເປັນ child channels. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:11
msgid "Create a bootstrap script for the proxy, and adjust it."
msgstr "ສ້າງ bootstrap script ສຳລັບ proxy, ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງມັນ."

#.     For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleap.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:12
msgid "Add the GPG key to the [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=`` parameter."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ GPG key ເຂົ້າໃນພາຣາມີເຕີ [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=``."

#.     For more information about bootstrap scripts, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:13
msgid "Bootstrap the client using the script."
msgstr "ເຮັດ Bootstrap ໃຫ້ໄຄແອນໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Salt[Keys] and accept the key.  When the key is accepted, "
"the new proxy will show in menu:Systems[Overview] in the [guimenu]``Recently "
"Registered Systems`` section."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Keys] ແລະ ກົດຍອມຮັບ (accept) key. ເມື່ອ key ຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ, proxy ໃໝ່ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນ menu:Systems[Overview] ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Recently Registered Systems``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], and check "
"that the proxy channel is selected."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງ proxy ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For setting up a registered {productname} Proxy, see "
"xref:uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uyuni Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Uyuni Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} Proxy requires additional configuration."
msgstr "{productname} Proxy ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [path]``uyuni_proxy`` pattern"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ [path]``uyuni_proxy`` pattern"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Check that the Proxy pattern is installed correctly.  This step is part of "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-uyuni.adoc[].  To verify a "
"successful installation, on the server select the "
"[package]``pattern_uyuni_proxy`` package for installation."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ Proxy pattern ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-uyuni.adoc[]. ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກແພັກເກດ [package]``pattern_uyuni_proxy`` ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີເພື່ອທຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The salt-broker service will be automatically started after installation is "
"complete.  This service forwards Salt interactions to the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ການບໍລິການ salt-broker ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ. ການບໍລິການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ການໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງ Salt ໄປຍັງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Chains"
msgstr "Proxy Chains"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"It is possible to arrange proxies in a chain.  In such a case, the upstream "
"proxy is named `parent`."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຈັດລຽງ proxy ເປັນແບບຕ່ອງໂສ້. ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, proxy ຕົ້ນທາງ (Upstream) ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ `parent`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Make sure the TCP ports `4505` and `4506` are open on the proxy.  The proxy "
"must be able to reach the {productname} Server or a parent proxy on these "
"ports."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເປີດພອດ TCP `4505` ແລະ `4506` ເທິງ proxy ແລ້ວ. proxy ຈະຕ້ອງສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server ຫຼື parent proxy ຜ່ານພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy Server Certificate and Key"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກ Server Certificate ແລະ Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The proxy will share some SSL information with the {productname} Server.  "
"Copy the certificate and its key from the {productname} Server or the parent "
"proxy."
msgstr "proxy ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ SSL ບາງຢ່າງຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} Server. ໃຫ້ຄັດລອກ certificate ແລະ key ຂອງມັນມາຈາກ {productname} Server ຫຼື parent proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"As root, enter the following commands on the proxy using your {productname} "
"Server or parent Proxy (named [replaceable]``PARENT``):"
msgstr "ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເທິງ proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} Server ຫຼື parent Proxy ຂອງທ່ານ (ຊື່ວ່າ [replaceable]``PARENT``):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -m 700 /root/ssl-build\n"
"cd /root/ssl-build\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/rhn-ca-openssl.cnf .\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir -m 700 /root/ssl-build\n"
"cd /root/ssl-build\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT .\n"
"scp root@PARENT:/root/ssl-build/rhn-ca-openssl.cnf .\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To keep the security chain intact, the {productname} Proxy functionality "
"requires the SSL certificate to be signed by the same CA as the "
"{productname} Server certificate.  Using certificates signed by different "
"CAs for proxies and server is not supported."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັກສາຕ່ອງໂສ້ຄວາມປອດໄພໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ {productname} Proxy ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ SSL certificate ຖືກເຊັນໂດຍ CA ດຽວກັນກັບ certificate ຂອງ {productname} Server. ການໃຊ້ certificate ທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ CA ຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບ proxies ແລະ server ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run [command]``configure-proxy.sh``"
msgstr "ຣັນ [command]``configure-proxy.sh``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` script finalizes the setup of your "
"{productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Execute the interactive [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` script.  Pressing "
"kbd:[Enter] without further input will make the script use the default "
"values provided between brackets ``[]``.  Here is some information about the "
"requested settings:"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຣັນສະຄຣິບ [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ. ການກົດ kbd:[Enter] ໂດຍບໍ່ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ໄວ້ໃນວົງເລັບ ``[]``. ນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} Parent:: The {productname} parent can be either another proxy "
"or the {productname} Server."
msgstr "{productname} Parent:: {productname} parent ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງ proxy ໂຕອື່ນ ຫຼື {productname} Server."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Proxy"
msgstr "HTTP Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"A HTTP proxy enables your {productname} proxy to access the Web.  This is "
"needed if direct access to the Web is prohibited by a firewall."
msgstr "HTTP proxy ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ {productname} proxy ຂອງທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໄດ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນຫາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໂດຍກົງຖືກຫ້າມໂດຍໄຟວໍ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traceback Email"
msgstr "Traceback Email"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:21
msgid "An email address where to report problems."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລສຳລັບລາຍງານບັນຫາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use SSL"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:23
msgid "For safety reasons, press ``Y``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ໃຫ້ກົດ ``Y``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do You Want to Import Existing Certificates?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າ (Import) Certificate ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Answer ``N``.  This ensures using the new certificates that were copied "
"previously from the {productname} server."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕອບ ``N``. ນີ້ຈະຮັບປະກັນການໃຊ້ certificate ໃໝ່ທີ່ຄັດລອກມາຈາກ {productname} server ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization"
msgstr "ອົງກອນ (Organization)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The next questions are about the characteristics to use for the SSL "
"certificate of the proxy.  The organization might be the same organization "
"that was used on the server, unless of course your proxy is not in the same "
"organization as your main server."
msgstr "ຄຳຖາມຕໍ່ໄປແມ່ນກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SSL certificate ຂອງ proxy. ອົງກອນອາດຈະເປັນອົງກອນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ server, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າ proxy ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນອົງກອນດຽວກັນກັບ server ຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Unit"
msgstr "Organization Unit"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:29
msgid "The default value here is the proxy's hostname."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ແມ່ນ hostname ຂອງ proxy."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "City"
msgstr "ເມືອງ (City)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:31
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:33
msgid "Further information attached to the proxy's certificate."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ແນບມາກັບ certificate ຂອງ proxy."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "State"
msgstr "ແຂວງ (State)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Country Code"
msgstr "ລະຫັດປະເທດ (Country Code)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``country code`` field, enter the country code set during "
"the {productname} installation.  For example, if your proxy is in the US and "
"your {productname} is in DE, enter `DE` for the proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``country code``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດປະເທດທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ຖ້າ proxy ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນ US ແລະ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນ DE, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `DE` ສຳລັບ proxy."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The country code must be two upper case letters.  For a complete list of "
"country codes, see https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#search."
msgstr "ລະຫັດປະເທດຈະຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່ສອງຕົວ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ລະຫັດປະເທດທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#search."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cname Aliases (Separated by Space)"
msgstr "Cname Aliases (ແຍກກັນດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Use this if your proxy can be accessed through various DNS CNAME aliases.  "
"Otherwise it can be left empty."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຫາກ proxy ຂອງທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ DNS CNAME aliases ຕ່າງໆ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "CA Password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ CA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Enter the password that was used for the certificate of your {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ certificate ຂອງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do You Want to Use an Existing SSH Key for Proxying SSH-Push Salt Minion?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ SSH Key ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສຳລັບການເຮັດ Proxying SSH-Push Salt Minion ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Use this option if you want to reuse a SSH key that was used for SSH-Push "
"Salt clients on the server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ SSH key ອັນເກົ່າທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SSH-Push Salt clients ເທິງ server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"If parts are missing, such as CA key and public certificate, the script "
"prints commands that you must execute to integrate the needed files.  When "
"the mandatory files are copied, run [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` again.  "
"If you receive an HTTP error during script execution, run the script again."
msgstr "ຫາກມີບາງສ່ວນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ ເຊັ່ນ CA key ແລະ public certificate, ສະຄຣິບຈະສະແດງຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຣັນເພື່ອລວມໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າກັນ. ເມື່ອຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຣັນ [command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ອີກຄັ້ງ. ຫາກທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ HTTP ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຣັນສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ຣັນສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:44
msgid ""
"[command]``configure-proxy.sh`` activates services required by {productname} "
"Proxy, such as [systemitem]``squid``, [systemitem]``apache2``, "
"[systemitem]``salt-broker``, and [systemitem]``jabberd``."
msgstr "[command]``configure-proxy.sh`` ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການຕ່າງໆທີ່ {productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່ນ [systemitem]``squid``, [systemitem]``apache2``, [systemitem]``salt-broker``, ແລະ [systemitem]``jabberd``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"To check the status of the proxy system and its clients, click the proxy "
"system's details page on the {webui} (menu:Systems[Proxy], then the system "
"name).  [guimenu]``Connection`` and [guimenu]``Proxy`` subtabs display "
"various status information."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທົດສອບສະຖານະຂອງລະບົບ proxy ແລະ clients ຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບ proxy ໃນ {webui} (menu:Systems[Proxy], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ລະບົບ). ແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Connection`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Proxy`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable PXE Boot"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ PXE Boot"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Profiles and System Information"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (Synchronize) ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:48
msgid ""
"To enable PXE boot through a proxy, additional software must be installed "
"and configured on both the {productname} Proxy and the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ PXE boot ຜ່ານ proxy, ຈະຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າຊອບແວເພີ່ມເຕີມທັງເທິງ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:49
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, install the "
"[package]``susemanager-tftpsync-recv`` package:"
msgstr "ເທິງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [package]``susemanager-tftpsync-recv``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync-recv\n"
msgstr "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync-recv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:51
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, run the [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` setup "
"script and enter the requested information:"
msgstr "ເທິງ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ຣັນສະຄຣິບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure-tftpsync.sh\n"
msgstr "configure-tftpsync.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:53
msgid ""
"You need to provide the hostname and IP address of the {productname} Server "
"and the proxy.  You also need to enter the path to the tftpboot directory on "
"the proxy."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸ hostname ແລະ IP address ຂອງ {productname} Server ແລະ ຂອງ proxy. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ tftpboot ເທິງ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:54
msgid "On the {productname} Server, install [package]``susemanager-tftpsync``:"
msgstr "ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ [package]``susemanager-tftpsync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync\n"
msgstr "zypper in susemanager-tftpsync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:56
msgid "On the {productname} Server, run [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh``."
msgstr "ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ຣັນ [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:57
msgid "This creates the configuration, and uploads it to the {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະສ້າງການກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ອັບໂຫລດມັນໄປຍັງ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure-tftpsync.sh FQDN_of_Proxy\n"
msgstr "configure-tftpsync.sh FQDN_of_Proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:59
msgid "Start an initial synchronization on the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນເທິງ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler sync\n"
msgstr "cobbler sync\n"

#. For more information about PXE booting, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc[Install via the Network].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:61
msgid ""
"It can also be done after a change within {cobbler} that needs to be "
"synchronized immediately.  Otherwise {cobbler} synchronization will run "
"automatically when needed."
msgstr "ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນຫຼັງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງພາຍໃນ {cobbler} ທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນທັນທີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນຂອງ {cobbler} ຈະລັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure DHCP for PXE through Proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ສຳລັບ PXE ຜ່ານ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:63
msgid ""
"{productname} uses {cobbler} for client provisioning.  PXE (tftp) is "
"installed and activated by default.  Clients must be able to find the PXE "
"boot on the {productname} Proxy using DHCP.  Use this DHCP configuration for "
"the zone which contains the clients to be provisioned:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ {cobbler} ສຳລັບການຈັດກຽມໄຄແອນ. PXE (tftp) ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໄຄແອນຕ້ອງສາມາດຊອກຫາ PXE boot ໃນ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ DHCP. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ນີ້ສຳລັບ zone ທີ່ມີໄຄແອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຈັດກຽມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"next-server: <IP_Address_of_Proxy>\n"
"filename: \"pxelinux.0\"\n"
msgstr ""
"next-server: <IP_Address_of_Proxy>\n"
"filename: \"pxelinux.0\"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace the {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:66
msgid ""
"A proxy does not contain any information about the clients that are "
"connected to it.  Therefore, a proxy can be replaced by a new one at any "
"time.  The replacement proxy must have the same name and IP address as its "
"predecessor."
msgstr "Proxy ບໍ່ໄດ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆກ່ຽວກັບໄຄແອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, Proxy ສາມາດຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຕົວໃໝ່ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່ຕ້ອງມີຊື່ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຄືກັນກັບຕົວເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Shut down the old proxy, and leave it installed while you prepare the "
"replacement.  Create a reactivation key for this system and then register "
"the new proxy using the reactivation key.  If you do not use the "
"reactivation key, you will need to re-register all the clients against the "
"new proxy."
msgstr "ປິດເຄື່ອງ proxy ໂຕເກົ່າ ແລະ ປ່ອຍມັນໄວ້ແບບນັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ທ່ານກະກຽມໂຕໃໝ່. ສ້າງ reactivation key ສຳລັບລະບົບນີ້ ແລ້ວລົງທະບຽນ proxy ໂຕໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ reactivation key ນັ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ reactivation key, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນ clients ທັງໝົດໃໝ່ກັບ proxy ໂຕໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:68
msgid ""
"The reactivation key is only needed if you do not want to lose the history "
"of the machine.  If you do not use a reactivation key, the replacement proxy "
"will become a \"new\" one with a new ID."
msgstr "Reactivation key ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ປະຫວັດຂອງເຄື່ອງນັ້ນສູນຫາຍ. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ reactivation key, Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່ຈະກາຍເປັນເຄື່ອງ \"ໃໝ່\" ທີ່ມີ ID ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing a Proxy and Keeping the Clients Registered"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນແທນ Proxy ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຄົງການລົງທະບຽນຂອງໄຄແອນໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Before starting the actual migration procedure, save the data from the old "
"proxy, if needed.  Consider copying important or manually created data to a "
"central place that can also be accessed by the new proxy."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຕົວຈິງ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ proxy ເກົ່າຫາກຈຳເປັນ. ພິຈາລະນາການສຳເນົາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງໄປໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນກາງ ທີ່ proxy ໃໝ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:71
msgid "Shut down the proxy."
msgstr "ປິດເຄື່ອງ proxy."

#.  For installation instructions, see xref:install-proxy-unified.adoc[Proxy Installation].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:72
msgid "Deploy a new {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Deploy) {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:73
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the newly installed {productname} "
"Proxy, and delete it from the systems list."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ແລ້ວລຶບມັນອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:74
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, create a reactivation key for the old proxy system: On the "
"System Details tab of the old proxy click [guimenu]``Reactivation``."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ reactivation key ສຳລັບລະບົບ Proxy ເກົ່າ: ຢູ່ແຖບ System Details ຂອງ Proxy ເກົ່າ ໃຫ້ກົດ [guimenu]``Reactivation``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Generate New Key``, and make a note of the new key, as you "
"will need it later.  For more information about reactivation keys, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-reactivation.adoc[Reactivation "
"Keys]."
msgstr "ກົດ [guimenu]``Generate New Key``, ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກ key ໃໝ່ໄວ້ ເພາະທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ມັນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ reactivation keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-reactivation.adoc[Reactivation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:76
msgid "OPTIONAL: After the installation of the new proxy, you might also need to:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:77
msgid "Copy the centrally saved data to the new proxy system"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນກາງໄປຫາລະບົບ proxy ໂຕໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:78
msgid "Install any other needed software"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວອື່ນໆທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:79
msgid "Set up TFTP synchronization if the proxy is used for autoinstallation"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ TFTP ຫາກ proxy ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:80
msgid ""
"During the installation of the proxy, clients will not be able to reach the "
"{productname} Server.  After you have deleted a proxy, the systems list can "
"be temporarily incorrect.  All clients that were previously connected to the "
"proxy will show as being directly connected to the server instead.  After "
"the first successful operation on a client, such as execution of a remote "
"command or installation of a package or patch, this information will "
"automatically be corrected.  This may take some hours."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ proxy, clients ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ {productname} Server ໄດ້. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານລຶບ proxy ອອກແລ້ວ, ລາຍຊື່ລະບົບອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນຜິດພາດຊົ່ວຄາວ. clients ທັງໝົດທີ່ເຄີຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ proxy ຈະສະແດງສະຖານະວ່າເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ server ໂດຍກົງແທນ. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມີການເຮັດວຽກເທິງ client ສຳເລັດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ (ເຊັ່ນ ການຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຣີໂມດ ຫຼື ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ), ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:2
msgid "This section covers {productname} Server setup, using these procedures:"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid "Start {productname} setup with {yast}"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {yast}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid "Create the main administration account with the {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກດ້ວຍ {productname} {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:5
msgid "Name your base organization and add login credentials"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ອົງກອນຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:6
msgid "Synchronize the {sle} product channel from {scclongform}"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນຊ່ອງທາງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sle} ຈາກ {scclongform}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up {productname} with {yast} (Legacy)"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {yast} (ແບບເກົ່າ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:8
msgid "This section will guide you through {productname} setup procedures."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: {productname} Setup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:10
msgid "Log in to the {productname} Server and start {yast}."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} Server ແລະ ເລີ່ມ {yast}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In {yast}, navigate to menu:Network Services[Uyuni Setup] to begin the "
"setup."
msgstr "ໃນ {yast}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Network Services[Uyuni Setup] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"From the introduction screen select menu:Uyuni Setup[Set up Uyuni from "
"scratch] and click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າແນະນຳ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Uyuni Setup[Set up Uyuni from scratch] ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enter an email address to receive status notifications and click btn:[Next] "
"to continue."
msgstr "ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລເພື່ອຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະຖານະ ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"{productname} can sometimes send a large volume of notification emails.  You "
"can disable email notifications in the {webui} after setup, if you need to."
msgstr "{productname} ບາງຄັ້ງອາດສົ່ງອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທາງອີເມລໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:15
msgid "Enter your certificate information and a password."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Passwords must be at at least seven characters in length, and must not "
"contain spaces, single or double quotation marks (``'`` or ``\"``), "
"exclamation marks (``!``), or dollar signs (``$``).  Always store your "
"passwords in a secure location."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເຈັດຕົວອັກສອນ, ແລະ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ, ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າດ່ຽວ ຫຼື ຄູ່ (``'`` ຫຼື ``\"``), ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທ້ວງ (``!``), ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍໂດລາ (``$``). ໃຫ້ເກັບຮັກສາລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ປອດໄພສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:17
msgid "You must have the certificate password to set up the {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີລະຫັດຜ່ານໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"From the menu:Uyuni Setup[Database Settings] screen, enter a database user "
"and password and click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ menu:Uyuni Setup[Database Settings], ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Yes] to run setup when prompted."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Yes] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມື່ອມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:23
msgid "When setup is complete, click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:24
msgid "You will see the address of the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະເຫັນທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Click btn:[Finish] to complete {productname} setup."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Finish] ເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Main Administration Account"
msgstr "ການສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This section covers how to create your organization's main administration "
"account for {productname}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງວິທີສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກຂອງອົງກອນສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In container-based deployments, the administration account is established as "
"part of the deployment process, rendering this step useful exclusively to "
"legacy installations."
msgstr "ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບຄອນເທນເນີ (Container-based), ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເພາະສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບເກົ່າ (Legacy) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The main administration account has the highest authority within "
"{productname}.  Ensure you keep access information for this account secure."
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກມີອຳນາດສູງສຸດພາຍໃນ {productname}. ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເກັບຮັກສາຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າເຖິງບັນຊີນີ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"We recommend that you create lower level administration accounts for "
"organizations and groups.  Do not share the main administration access "
"details."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະດັບຮອງສຳລັບອົງກອນ ແລະ ກຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ. ຢ່າແບ່ງປັນລາຍລະອຽດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Newer browser versions can block web access to the {productname} Server FQDN "
"because of HSTS."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງບຣາວເຊີທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າອາດຈະບລັອກການເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໄປຫາ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ເນື່ອງຈາກ HSTS."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Installing the CA certificate from the [path]``pub`` directory via HTTP and "
"importing it to the browser will allow access to the server."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ຈາກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``pub`` ຜ່ານ HTTP ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າມັນໄປຍັງບຣາວເຊີ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"On the server, go to "
"http://<server>.example.com/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ, ໄປທີ່ http://<server>.example.com/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Import the certificate file.  In the browser settings (for Firefox), open "
"menu:Privacy & Security[Certificates > View Certificates], and import the "
"file."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ. ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າບຣາວເຊີ (ສຳລັບ Firefox), ໃຫ້ເປີດ menu:Privacy & Security[Certificates > View Certificates], ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Main Administration Account"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:36
msgid "In your web browser, enter the address for the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:37
msgid ""
"This address was provided after you completed setup.  For more information, "
"see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc#server-setup-yast[]."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້ໄດ້ມາຫຼັງຈາກທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc#server-setup-yast[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Log in to the {webui}, navigate to the menu:Create Organization[Organization "
"Name] field, and enter your organization name."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {webui}, ໄປທີ່ຊ່ອງ menu:Create Organization[Organization Name], ແລະ ໃສ່ຊື່ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the menu:Create Organization[Desired Login] and menu:Create "
"Organization[Desired Password] fields, enter your username and password."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ menu:Create Organization[Desired Login] ແລະ menu:Create Organization[Desired Password], ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Fill in the Account Information fields including an email for system "
"notifications."
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນບັນຊີ ລວມທັງອີເມລສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Organization] to finish creating your administration "
"account."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Organization] ເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"When you have completed the {productname} {webui} setup, you are taken to "
"the menu:Home[Overview] page."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {webui} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກພາຍັງໜ້າ menu:Home[Overview]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Synchronizing Products from {scclongform}"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນຜະລິດຕະພັນຈາກ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:44
msgid ""
"{scclongform} ({scc}) maintains a collection of repositories which contain "
"packages, software and updates for all supported enterprise client systems.  "
"These repositories are organized into channels each of which provide "
"software specific to a distribution, release, and architecture.  After "
"synchronizing with {scc}, clients can receive updates, be organized into "
"groups, and assigned to specific product software channels."
msgstr "{scclongform} ({scc}) ຮັກສາການລວບລວມຄັງຊອບແວທີ່ປະກອບມີແພັກເກດ, ຊອບແວ ແລະ ການອັບເດດ ສຳລັບລະບົບໄຄເອັນລະດັບອົງກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ຄັງຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຈັດລຽງເປັນຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງຈະໃຫ້ຊອບແວສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລຸ້ນ, ການປ່ອຍ, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ. ຫຼັງຈາກຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນກັບ {scc} ແລ້ວ, ໄຄເອັນຈະສາມາດຮັບການອັບເດດ, ຖືກຈັດເປັນກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຜະລິດຕະພັນສະເພາະໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:46
msgid "For Uyuni, synchronizing products from {scclongform} is optional."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Uyuni, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນຜະລິດຕະພັນຈາກ {scclongform} ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Before you can synchronize software repositories with {scc}, you will need "
"to enter organization credentials in {productname}.  The organization "
"credentials give you access to the {suse} product downloads.  You will find "
"your organization credentials in https://scc.suse.com/organizations."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນຄັງຊອບແວກັບ {scc} ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ (Credentials) ໃນ {productname}. ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງການດາວໂຫຼດຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໄດ້. ທ່ານຈະພົບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນໄດ້ໃນ https://scc.suse.com/organizations."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:48
msgid "Enter your organization credentials in the {productname} {webui}:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃນ {productname} {webui}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:50
msgid "In the {susemgr} {webui}, navigate to menu:Main Menu[Admin > Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {susemgr} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Main Menu[Admin > Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:51
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page, navigate to the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] tab."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Setup Wizard``, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບ btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:53
msgid "Enter a username and password, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"A check mark icon is shown when the credentials are confirmed.  When you "
"have successfully entered the new credentials, you can synchronize with "
"{scclongform}."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕິກຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຖືກຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ. ເມື່ອທ່ານປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍຈະສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນກັບ {scclongform} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:56
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:57
msgid "From the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page select the btn:[SUSE Products] tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກແຖບ btn:[SUSE Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Wait a moment for the products list to populate.  If you previously "
"registered with {scclongform} a list of products will populate the table.  "
"This table lists architecture, channels, and status information.  For more "
"information, see xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າຈັກຄາວເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນປາກົດຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານເຄີຍລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform} ມາກ່ອນ ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະສະແດງໃນຕາຕະລາງ. ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ຈະລະບຸສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If your {sle} client is based on [systemitem]``x86_64`` architecture scroll "
"down the page and select the check box for this channel now."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຄແອນ {sle} ຂອງທ່ານອີງໃສ່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ [systemitem]``x86_64`` ໃຫ້ເລື່ອນລົງ ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງໝາຍຕິກສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Add channels to {productname} by selecting the check box to the left of each "
"channel."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} ໂດຍການເລືອກຊ່ອງໝາຍຕິກທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Click the arrow symbol to the left of the description to unfold a product "
"and list available modules."
msgstr "ກົດທີ່ສັນຍະລັກລູກສອນທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງຄຳອະທິບາຍເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນທີ່ມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:63
msgid "Click btn:[Add Products] to start product synchronization."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Add Products] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:64
msgid ""
"After adding the channel, {productname} will schedule the channel to be "
"synchronized.  This can take a long time as {productname} will copy channel "
"software sources from the {suse} repositories located at {scclongform} to "
"local [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` directory of your server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງແລ້ວ, {productname} ຈະກຳນົດເວລາໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ເພາະວ່າ {productname} ຈະສຳເນົາແຫຼ່ງຊອບແວຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ ຈາກຄັງຊອບແວຂອງ {suse} ທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ {scclongform} ມາໄວ້ໃນໄດເລັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` ຂອງເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In some environments, transparent huge pages provided by the kernel can slow "
"down PostgreSQL workloads significantly."
msgstr "ໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, transparent huge pages ທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ kernel ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ PostgreSQL ຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To disable transparent huge pages, set the "
"[parameter]``transparent_hugepage`` kernel parameter to ``never``.  You will "
"also need to open the [path]``/etc/default/grub`` file and add or edit the "
"line [option]``GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT``.  For example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ transparent huge pages, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີ kernel [parameter]``transparent_hugepage`` ເປັນ ``never``. ທ່ານຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/default/grub`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວ [option]``GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT=\"resume=/dev/sda1 splash=silent quiet showopts "
"elevator=none transparent_hugepage=never\"\n"
msgstr "GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT=\"resume=/dev/sda1 splash=silent quiet showopts elevator=none transparent_hugepage=never\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:68
msgid ""
"To write the new configuration run [command]``grub2-mkconfig -o "
"/boot/grub2/grub.cfg``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Monitor the channel synchronization process in real-time by viewing channel "
"log files located in the directory [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync``:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕາມຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງແບບ real-time ໂດຍການເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ log ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<CHANNEL_NAME>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<CHANNEL_NAME>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:71
msgid ""
"When the channel synchronization process is complete, you can continue with "
"client registration.  For more instructions, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການລົງທະບຽນໄຄແອນຕໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/actkey-bootstrap-proxy-suma.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Activation Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ (Activation Key)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/actkey-bootstrap-proxy-suma.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and click btn:[Create key]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys], ແລະ ກົດ btn:[ສ້າງຄີ]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/actkey-bootstrap-proxy-suma.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Create an activation key for the proxy host with {sle-micro} {microversion} "
"or {sles} {bci-suma} as the parent channel.  This key should include all "
"recommended channels and the proxy as an extension child channel."
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງ proxy host ໂດຍໃຊ້ {sle-micro} {microversion} ຫຼື {sles} {bci-suma} ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ຄີນີ້ຄວນລວມເອົາຊ່ອງທາງທັງໝົດທີ່ແນະນຳ ແລະ ໃຫ້ proxy ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກເສີມ (Extension child channel)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/actkey-bootstrap-proxy-suma.adoc:5
msgid "Proceed to boostrapping the proxy host as a [systemitem]``default`` client."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ (Bootstrapping) proxy host ໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``default`` client."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy Host as a Client"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ Proxy Host ໃນຖານະໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Bootstrapping the Proxy Host"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ (Bootstrapping) Proxy Host"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:4
msgid "Fill in the fields for your proxy host."
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆສຳລັບ proxy host ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:5
msgid "Select the activation key created in the previous step from the drop-down."
msgstr "ເລືອກ activation key ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈາກເມນູເລືອກ (Drop-down)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:6
msgid "Click btn:[Bootstrap]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ (Bootstrap)]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Wait for the bootstrap process to complete successfully.  Check the "
"menu:Salt[] menu and confirm the {salt} key is listed and accepted."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບສຳເລັດ. ກວດເບິ່ງເມນູ menu:Salt[] ແລະ ຢືນຢັນວ່າຄີ {salt} ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ ແລະ ຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:12
msgid "Reboot the proxy host if the operating system is {sle-micro}."
msgstr "ຣີບູດ proxy host ຫາກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການແມ່ນ {sle-micro}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:System[] list and trigger a second reboot in "
"case of {sle-micro} after all events are finished to conclude the "
"onboarding."
msgstr "ເລືອກ host ຈາກລາຍຊື່ menu:System[] ແລະ ສັ່ງຣີບູດຄັ້ງທີສອງໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເປັນ {sle-micro} ຫຼັງຈາກເຫດການທັງໝົດສິ້ນສຸດລົງ ເພື່ອສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າລະບົບ (Onboarding)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating the Proxy Host"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດ Proxy Host"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install packages and enable podman"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before using proxy, some packages need to be present on host and "
"[package]``podman`` needs to be running."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ proxy, ຕ້ອງມີບາງແພັກເກດຢູ່ໃນ host ແລະ [package]``podman`` ຕ້ອງກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the prerequisites"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມຂໍ້ກຳນົດເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:4
msgid "On the proxy host, ensure that the following packages are installed:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນ proxy host, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແລ້ວ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:5
msgid "[package]``podman``"
msgstr "[package]``podman``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:6
msgid "[package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``"
msgstr "[package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:7
msgid "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-salt-broker-image``"
msgstr "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-salt-broker-image``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:8
msgid "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-ssh-image``"
msgstr "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-ssh-image``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:9
msgid "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-tftpd-image``"
msgstr "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-tftpd-image``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:10
msgid "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-httpd-image``"
msgstr "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-httpd-image``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:11
msgid "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-squid-image``"
msgstr "[package]``suse-manager-5.0-x86_64-proxy-squid-image``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Start the Podman service on the proxy host by rebooting the system, or "
"running a command:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ Podman ໃນ proxy host ໂດຍການຣີບູດລະບົບ, ຫຼື ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now podman.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now podman.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:14
msgid "On the proxy host, install the Proxy with:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນ proxy host, ຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate proxy configuration"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For the containerized {productname} Proxy, you must build a new proxy "
"configuration file and then redeploy the container for the changes to take "
"effect.  This is the process for updating settings, including the SSL "
"certificate."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ໃໝ່ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນ deploy ຄອນເທນເນີຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນສຳລັບການອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ລວມທັງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:20
msgid ""
"2 GB represents the default proxy squid cache size.  This will need to be "
"adjusted for your environment."
msgstr "2 GB ແມ່ນຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ proxy squid cache. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For Podman deployment, the container host for the {productname} Proxy must "
"be registered as a client to the {productname} Server prior to generating "
"this proxy configuration."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ Podman, container host ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນ ເປັນໄຄເອັນກັບ {productname} Server ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If a proxy FQDN is used to generate a proxy container configuration that is "
"not a registered client (as in the Kubernetes use case), a new system entry "
"will appear in system list.  This new entry will be shown under previously "
"entered Proxy FQDN value and will be of [literal]``Foreign`` system type."
msgstr "ຫາກໃຊ້ FQDN ຂອງ proxy ເພື່ອສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy container ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ (ເຊັ່ນໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ Kubernetes), ຈະມີລາຍການລະບົບໃໝ່ປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນລາຍຊື່ລະບົບ. ລາຍການໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ຄ່າ FQDN ຂອງ Proxy ທີ່ປ້ອນໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ແລະ ຈະເປັນປະເພດລະບົບ [literal]``Foreign``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Peripheral servers are always using third-party SSL certificates.  If the "
"hub server has generated the certificates for the peripheral server, it "
"needs to generate the certificate of each proxy too.  On the hub server, run "
"the following command."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນນອກ (Peripheral servers) ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມສະເໝີ. ຫາກ hub server ໄດ້ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນນອກແລ້ວ, ມັນກໍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງແຕ່ລະ proxy ນຳອີກ. ໃນ hub server, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=PROXY --set-cname=\"proxy.example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=PROXY --set-cname=\"proxy.example.com\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:9
msgid "The files to use will be"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:10
msgid "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` as the root CA,"
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` ເປັນ root CA,"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:11
msgid ""
"[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.crt`` as the proxy certificate "
"and"
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.crt`` ເປັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງ proxy ແລະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:12
msgid ""
"[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.key`` as the proxy "
"certificate's key."
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.key`` ເປັນຄີຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ proxy."

#.  tag::generate-proxy-config-section[]
#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate proxy configuration with {webui}"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating proxy container configuration using {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy container ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] and fill the "
"required data."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] ແລະ ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` field type maximal allowed "
"size for Squid cache.  Recommended is to use at most 80% of available "
"storage for the containers."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບ Squid cache. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ເກີນ 80% ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The CA certificates generated by the server are stored in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍເຊີເວີຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເລັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Generate] to register a new proxy FQDN in the {productname} "
"Server and generate a configuration archive ([filename]``config.tar.gz``) "
"containing details for the container host."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[ສ້າງ (Generate)] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ FQDN ຂອງ proxy ໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ([filename]``config.tar.gz``) ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:26
msgid ""
"After a few moments you are presented with file to download.  Save this file "
"locally."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈັກຄາວ ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດ. ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate proxy configuration with [command]``spacecmd`` and self-signed "
"certificate"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ດ້ວຍ [command]``spacecmd`` ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ລົງນາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (Self-signed certificate)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:29
msgid "You can generate a Proxy configuration using [literal]``spacecmd``."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Proxy ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``spacecmd``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generating proxy configuration with [command]``spacecmd`` and "
"self-signed certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ດ້ວຍ [command]``spacecmd`` ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ລົງນາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:34
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:44
msgid "Copy the generated configuration from the server container:"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກ server container:"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate proxy configuration with [command]``spacecmd`` and custom "
"certificate"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ດ້ວຍ [command]``spacecmd`` ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ (Custom certificate)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can generate a Proxy configuration using [literal]``spacecmd`` for "
"custom certificates rather than the default self-signed certificates."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``spacecmd`` ສຳລັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ລົງນາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generating proxy configuration with [command]``spacecmd`` and "
"custom certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ດ້ວຍ [command]``spacecmd`` ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:40
msgid "Execute the following commands replacing the Server and Proxy FQDN:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໂດຍປ່ຽນແທນ FQDN ຂອງ Server ແລະ Proxy:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:42
msgid ""
"If your setup uses an intermediate CA, copy it as well and include it in the "
"command with the `-i` option (can be provided multiple times if needed) :"
msgstr "ຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ intermediate CA, ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາມັນນຳ ແລະ ລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ `-i` (ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງຫາກຈຳເປັນ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/generate_proxy_config.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i "
"/tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 "
"email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o "
"/tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i /tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#. type: Title ==
