"Insert the DVD or USB flash drive (USB disk or key) containing the "
"installation image for {sle-micro} {microversion}."
msgstr "ສຽບແຜ່ນ DVD ຫຼື USB flash drive ທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບ {sle-micro} {microversion}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:12
msgid "Adjust Keyboard and language."
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນຄີບອດ ແລະ ພາສາ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:13
msgid "Click the [systemitem]``checkbox`` to accept the license agreement."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ [systemitem]``checkbox`` ເພື່ອຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Select the registration method.  For this example, we will register the "
"server with {scclongform}."
msgstr "ເລືອກວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີກັບ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The {productname} {productnumber} containers are installed as extensions.  "
"Depending on the specific extension needed from the list below, additional "
"{scclongform} registration codes will be required for each."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງ {productname} {productnumber} ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງເປັນສ່ວນເສີມ (Extensions). ຂຶ້ນກັບສ່ວນເສີມສະເພາະທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈາກລາຍຊື່ລຸ່ມນີ້, ຈະຕ້ອງມີລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {scclongform} ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server"
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} Server"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:19
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Retail Branch Server"
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} Retail Branch Server"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:11
msgid "Enter your {scclongform} email address."
msgstr "ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລ {scclongform} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To install a proxy, select the {productname} {productnumber} Proxy "
"extension; to install a server, select the {productname} {productnumber} "
"Server extension ``Checkbox``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ proxy, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy; ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ server, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:20
msgid "Enter your {productname} {productnumber} extension registration code."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:29
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On the [systemitem]``Authentication for the System`` page enter a password "
"for the root user.  Click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [systemitem]``Authentication for the System`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ root user. ກົດ btn:[ຖັດໄປ]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:31
msgid ""
"This concludes installation of {sle-micro} {microversion} and {productname} "
"{productnumber} as an extension.  For more information about preparing your "
"machines (virtual or physical), see "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.5/html/SLE-Micro-all/book-deployment-slemicro.html[{sle-micro} "
"{microversion} Deployment Guide]."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການສິ້ນສຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} {microversion} ແລະ {productname} {productnumber} ໃນຖານະສ່ວນເສີມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຽມເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ (ສະເືອນ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງຈິງ), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.5/html/SLE-Micro-all/book-deployment-slemicro.html[{sle-micro} {microversion} Deployment Guide]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL: Registration from the command line"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ການລົງທະບຽນຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ (Command line)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:33
msgid ""
"If you added {productname} {productnumber} as an extension during "
"{sle-micro} {microversion} installation then you can skip this procedure.  "
"However, optionally you may skip registration during {sle-micro} "
"{microversion} installation by selecting the btn:[Skip Registration] "
"button.  This section provides steps on registering your products after "
"{sle-micro} {microversion} installation."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ເພີ່ມ {productname} {productnumber} ເປັນສ່ວນເສີມໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} {microversion} ແລ້ວ ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເລືອກຂ້າມການລົງທະບຽນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} {microversion} ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[ຂ້າມການລົງທະບຽນ]. ສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ບາດກ້າວໃນການລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} {microversion}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The following steps register a {productname} {productnumber} extension with "
"the {x86_64} architecture and thus require a registration code for the "
"{x86_64} architecture.  To register {arm} or {s390x} architectures use the "
"correct registration code."
msgstr "ບາດກ້າວຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນການລົງທະບຽນສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} ດ້ວຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64} ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64}. ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {arm} ຫຼື {s390x} ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering from the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:36
msgid "List available extensions with the following command:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ມີຢູ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update --quiet register --list-extensions\n"
msgstr "transactional-update --quiet register --list-extensions\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:38
msgid "From the list of available extensions, select the one you wish to install:"
msgstr "ຈາກລາຍຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:39
msgid ""
"If installing the Server, use your {productname} Server Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Server Extension {productnumber} x86_64 ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p SUSE-Manager-Server/5.0/x86_64 -r "
"<reg_code>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p SUSE-Manager-Server/5.0/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:41
msgid ""
"If installing the Proxy, use your {productname} Proxy Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy Extension {productnumber} x86_64 ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p SUSE-Manager-Proxy/5.0/x86_64 -r "
"<reg_code>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p SUSE-Manager-Proxy/5.0/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating the System"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:46
msgid "Log in as *root*."
msgstr "ລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນຖານະ *root*."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:50
msgid ""
"{sle-micro} is designed to update itself automatically by default and will "
"reboot after applying updates.  However, this behavior is not desirable for "
"the {productname} environment.  To prevent automatic updates on your server, "
"{productname} disables the transactional-update timer during the bootstrap "
"process."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ {sle-micro} ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ອັບເດດຕົວເອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຈະຣີບູດຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງ {productname}. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ, {productname} ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານ transactional-update timer ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການ bootstrap."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:51
msgid ""
"If you prefer the {sle-micro} default behavior, enable the timer by running "
"the following command:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ {sle-micro}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ timer ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-host.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now transactional-update.timer\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now transactional-update.timer\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Skip the registration. The {sle-micro} {microversion} entitlement is "
"included within the {productname} entitlement."
msgstr "ຂ້າມການລົງທະບຽນ. ສິດການໃຊ້ງານ {sle-micro} {microversion} ແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນສິດການໃຊ້ງານຂອງ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This concludes installation of {sle-micro} {microversion}.  For more "
"information about preparing your machines (virtual or physical), see "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.5/html/SLE-Micro-all/book-deployment-slemicro.html[{sle-micro} "
"{microversion} Deployment Guide]."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການສິ້ນສຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} {microversion}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຽມເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ (ສະເືອນ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງຈິງ), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.5/html/SLE-Micro-all/book-deployment-slemicro.html[{sle-micro} {microversion} Deployment Guide]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {sles} {bci-suma} Host"
msgstr "ກຽມເຄື່ອງ {sles} {bci-suma} Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:2
msgid "Alternatively, you can deploy {productname} on {sles} {bci-suma}."
msgstr "ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນ {sles} {bci-suma} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:3
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The following procedure describes the main steps of the installation "
"process."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອະທິບາຍບາດກ້າວຫຼັກຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {productname} Extensions on {sles} {bci-suma}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} ໃນ {sles} {bci-suma}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Locate and download {sles} {bci-suma} [literal]``.iso`` at "
"https://www.suse.com/download/sles/."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ [literal]``.iso`` ຂອງ {sles} {bci-suma} ໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.suse.com/download/sles/."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Make sure that you have registration codes both for the host operating "
"system ({sles} {bci-suma}) and extensions."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນທັງສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ host ({sles} {bci-suma}) ແລະ ສ່ວນເສີມຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:7
msgid "Start the installation of {sles} {bci-suma}."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles} {bci-suma}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the [literal]``Language, keyboard and product selection`` select the "
"product to install."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [literal]``Language, keyboard and product selection`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:9
msgid ""
"On the [literal]``License agreement`` read the agreement and check "
"[guimenu]``I Agree to the License Terms``."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [literal]``License agreement`` ໃຫ້ອ່ານຂໍ້ຕົກລົງ ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ [guimenu]``I Agree to the License Terms``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Select the registration method. For this example, we will register the "
"server with SUSE Customer Center."
msgstr "ເລືອກວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີກັບ SUSE Customer Center."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:12
msgid "Enter your registration code for {sles} {bci-suma}."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບ {sles} {bci-suma}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Please note that for {sles} {bci-suma}, you are required to have a valid "
"{sles} subscription and corresponding registration code, which you must "
"provide on this screen.  You will be required to enter the {productname} "
"Extension registration code below."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາສັງເກດວ່າສຳລັບ {sles} {bci-suma}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Subscription) {sles} ທີ່ຍັງມີຜົນ ແລະ ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸໃນໜ້ານີ້. ທ່ານຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ ສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the screen [literal]``Extensions and Modules Selection`` check the "
"following:"
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [literal]``Extensions and Modules Selection`` ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Select the {productname} Server Extension to install the Server, or the "
"{productname} Proxy Extension to install the Proxy."
msgstr "ເລືອກ {productname} Server Extension ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Server, ຫຼື {productname} Proxy Extension ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:14
msgid "Basesystem Module"
msgstr "Basesystem Module"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:15
msgid "Containers Module"
msgstr "Containers Module"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:17
msgid ""
"When the installation completes, log in to the newly installed server as "
"root."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ໃນຖານະ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Update the System (optional, if the system was not set to download updates "
"during install):"
msgstr "ອັບເດດລະບົບ (ທາງເລືອກ, ຫາກລະບົບບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດການອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ):"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:27
msgid "Log in as root and install the product package."
msgstr "ລັອກອິນໃນຖານະ root ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:28
msgid "On the server:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product SUSE-Manager-Server\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product SUSE-Manager-Server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:30
msgid "On the proxies:"
msgstr "ໃນ proxies:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product SUSE-Multi-Manager-Proxy\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product SUSE-Multi-Manager-Proxy\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Make sure that package [package]``podman`` is installed.  Additionally, on "
"the server [package]``mgradm`` and [package]``mgradm-bash-completion`` or on "
"the proxies, [package]``mgrpxy`` and [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` "
"also need to be installed."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``podman`` ແລ້ວ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນເຊີເວີ [package]``mgradm`` ແລະ [package]``mgradm-bash-completion`` ຫຼື ໃນ proxies, [package]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` ກໍຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-host.adoc:33
msgid "Start the Podman service by rebooting the system, or running a command:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ Podman ໂດຍການຣີບູດລະບົບ, ຫຼື ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:10
msgid "Skip the registration."
msgstr "ຂ້າມການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Please note that for {sles} {bci-suma}, you are required to have a valid "
"{sles} subscription configured on the server."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາສັງເກດວ່າສຳລັບ {sles} {bci-suma}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {sles} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register {sle-micro} and {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {sle-micro} ແລະ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"

#.  Before starting obtain your SUSE Manager Registration Code from SUSE Customer Center - https://scc.suse.com.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering {sle-micro} and {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ {sle-micro} ແລະ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:8
msgid "Register {productname} {productnumber} Proxy with {scclongform}."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ກັບ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p SUSE-Manager-Proxy/5.0/x86_64 -r "
"<REGCODE>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p SUSE-Manager-Proxy/5.0/x86_64 -r <REGCODE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container volumes."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``. ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງ container volumes ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/register-proxy-suma.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This command will move the persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` to the specified storage "
"device."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະຍ້າຍ persistent storage volumes ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/start_proxy.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Start and Check Proxy Status"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ກວດສອບສະຖານະ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/transfer_proxy_config.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {webui} generates a configuration archive.  This archive needs to be "
"made available on the proxy container host."
msgstr "{webui} ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໄວ້ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນ proxy container host."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/transfer_proxy_config.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Copying the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສຳເນົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/transfer_proxy_config.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If not already done, copy the configuration archive "
"([literal]``config.tar.gz``) generated in the previous step from the server "
"container to the server host:"
msgstr "ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ, ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ([literal]``config.tar.gz``) ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ຈາກ server container ໄປຍັງ server host:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/container-deployment/transfer_proxy_config.adoc:6
msgid "If not already done, copy the files from the server host to the proxy host:"
msgstr "ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ, ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ຈາກ server host ໄປຍັງ proxy host:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-check-rpmnew-rpmsave.adoc:1
msgid ""
"Check for [filename]`+*.rpmnew+` and [filename]`+*.rpmsave+` files inside "
"the container:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ [filename]`+*.rpmnew+` ແລະ [filename]`+*.rpmsave+` ພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-check-rpmnew-rpmsave.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec 'find /etc/ -name \"*.rpmnew\" -o -name \"*.rpmsave\"'\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec 'find /etc/ -name \"*.rpmnew\" -o -name \"*.rpmsave\"'\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-check-rpmnew-rpmsave.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When an upgrade includes changes to a default configuration file that has "
"been altered after package installation, instead of overwriting the file, "
"one of these file types is created:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອການອັບເກຣດລວມມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ, ແທນທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ, ໜຶ່ງໃນປະເພດໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-check-rpmnew-rpmsave.adoc:4
msgid ""
"[filename]`+*.rpmnew+`: contains the new default configuration and leaves "
"your altered file untouched"
msgstr "[filename]`+*.rpmnew+`: ປະກອບມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ່ອຍໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-check-rpmnew-rpmsave.adoc:5
msgid ""
"[filename]`+*.rpmsave+`: a copy of your altered configuration that has been "
"replaced by the new default file"
msgstr "[filename]`+*.rpmsave+`: ແມ່ນສຳເນົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂ ເຊິ່ງຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍໄຟລ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-check-rpmnew-rpmsave.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you find any [filename]`+*.rpmnew+` or [filename]`+*.rpmsave+` files, "
"examine their content and merge desirable changes."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບໄຟລ໌ [filename]`+*.rpmnew+` ຫຼື [filename]`+*.rpmsave+`, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງເນື້ອໃນຂອງພວກມັນ ແລະ ລວມເອົາການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າກັນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-login-into-suse-registry.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"set +o history\n"
"echo SCC_MIRRORING_PASSWORD | podman login -u \"SCC_MIRRORING_USER\" "
"--password-stdin registry.suse.com\n"
"set -o history\n"
msgstr ""
"set +o history\n"
"echo SCC_MIRRORING_PASSWORD | podman login -u \"SCC_MIRRORING_USER\" --password-stdin registry.suse.com\n"
"set -o history\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Risk of Automated Version Downgrade and PTF Loss*\n"
msgstr "*ຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງການຫຼຸດເວີຊັນອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການສູນເສຍ PTF*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running the `mgradm upgrade podman` command when no newer upgrade is "
"available will cause the system to automatically revert to the base "
"version.  This process removes all currently applied Program Temporary Fixes "
"(PTFs) without a confirmation prompt."
msgstr "ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm upgrade podman` ໃນເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ມີການອັບເກຣດໃໝ່ກວ່າ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບກັບຄືນໄປເປັນເວີຊັນພື້ນຖານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະລຶບການແກ້ໄຂຊົ່ວຄາວ (PTFs) ທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຖາມຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To avoid unintended data or fix loss, verify upgrade availability before "
"execution.  Future releases will include a confirmation prompt to prevent "
"this behavior."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຂອງການອັບເກຣດກ່ອນການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ. ເວີຊັນໃນອະນາຄົດຈະມີການເພີ່ມໜ້າຈໍຖາມຢືນຢັນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນພຶດຕິກຳນີ້."
